      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-021-lesson",
          "title": "C 021：作用域与生命周期",
          "summary": "变量在哪里可见、活多久。",
          "concepts": [
            "局部变量",
            "全局变量",
            "块作用域"
          ],
          "objective": "分清局部与全局变量的可见范围。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 020"
          ],
          "explain": "在花括号里声明的变量是局部的，出了这对花括号就不可见。在每个函数外声明的是全局变量，整个文件可见。局部变量遮蔽同名全局变量时，函数内看到的是局部那个。尽量少用全局变量。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint counter = 0;\n\nvoid tick(void) {\n    int local = 100;\n    counter++;\n    printf(\"local=%d counter=%d\\n\", local, counter);\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    tick();\n    tick();\n    printf(\"final counter=%d\\n\", counter);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "local=100 counter=1\nlocal=100 counter=2\nfinal counter=2\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "在函数里访问另一个函数的局部变量会编译失败。",
            "全局变量让函数间产生隐藏依赖，调试变难。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "在 main 里再声明一个局部 counter 并演示遮蔽。",
              "hint": "main 内 int counter = 5; 打印它看结果。",
              "answer": "int counter = 5;\nprintf(\"shadow=%d\\n\", counter); // 5"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-022",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "C 022：数组基础",
      "summary": "一次存一组同类型数据。",
      "concepts": [
        "数组",
        "下标",
        "越界",
        "初始化"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-022-lesson",
          "title": "C 022：数组基础",
          "summary": "一次存一组同类型数据。",
          "concepts": [
            "数组",
            "下标",
            "越界",
            "初始化"
          ],
          "objective": "声明数组、按索引读写并安全遍历。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 013"
          ],
          "explain": "数组把同类型元素连续存放，下标从 0 开始。长度 5 的数组合法下标是 0 到 4。C 不检查越界，写超范围会破坏别的内存。用 for 循环配合下标遍历是最常见的用法，长度可以先算出来存进变量。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int scores[5] = {88, 92, 79, 95, 67};\n    int n = 5;\n    scores[0] = 90;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        printf(\"scores[%d]=%d\\n\", i, scores[i]);\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "scores[0]=90\nscores[1]=92\nscores[2]=79\nscores[3]=95\nscores[4]=67\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "下标从 0 开始，访问 scores[5] 已越界。",
            "数组名不能整体赋值，scores = ... 是语法错误。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把数组最后一个元素改成 100 并打印整个数组。",
              "hint": "用 scores[4] = 100;（长度 5 的最后一个下标是 4）。",
              "answer": "scores[n - 1] = 100;\nfor (int i = 0; i < n; i++) printf(\"%d \", scores[i]);"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-023",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "C 023：数组求和、平均与极值",
      "summary": "数组统计四件套。",
      "concepts": [
        "遍历",
        "累加",
        "最大值",
        "最小值"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-023-lesson",
          "title": "C 023：数组求和、平均与极值",
          "summary": "数组统计四件套。",
          "concepts": [
            "遍历",
            "累加",
            "最大值",
            "最小值"
          ],
          "objective": "用一次遍历同时求总和、平均、最大和最小。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 022"
          ],
          "explain": "遍历数组时用一个 sum 累加、一个 max 和一个 min 跟踪极值。max/min 的初值应取第一个元素，而不是 0——否则全负数数组会得到错误的最大值 0。平均要转成 double 再除。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int data[6] = {-3, 8, -1, 5, 12, 4};\n    int n = 6, sum = 0, max = data[0], min = data[0];\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        sum += data[i];\n        if (data[i] > max) max = data[i];\n        if (data[i] < min) min = data[i];\n    }\n    printf(\"sum=%d\\n\", sum);\n    printf(\"avg=%.2f\\n\", (double)sum / n);\n    printf(\"max=%d min=%d\\n\", max, min);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "sum=25\navg=4.17\nmax=12 min=-3\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "max 初值设 0 会让全负数组判定错误。",
            "平均用整数除法会丢掉小数。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "额外统计数组里正数和负数的个数。",
              "hint": "用两个计数器在循环里按符号加一。",
              "answer": "int pos = 0, neg = 0;\nfor (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { if (data[i] > 0) pos++; else if (data[i] < 0) neg++; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-024",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "C 024：字符串是字符数组",
      "summary": "C 字符串的本质。",
      "concepts": [
        "char 数组",
        "字符串",
        "\\0 结尾"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-024-lesson",
          "title": "C 024：字符串是字符数组",
          "summary": "C 字符串的本质。",
          "concepts": [
            "char 数组",
            "字符串",
            "\\0 结尾"
          ],
          "objective": "理解字符串以 \\0 结尾，能手动遍历字符。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 022"
          ],
          "explain": "C 没有独立的字符串类型，字符串就是一个以 \\0（空字符）结尾的 char 数组。字面量 \"abc\" 实际占 4 个字节：a、b、c、\\0。遍历到 \\0 之前不能越界，printf 的 %s 也靠 \\0 判断结束。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    char word[] = \"code\";\n    int len = 0;\n    while (word[len] != '\\0') {\n        len++;\n    }\n    printf(\"word=%s len=%d\\n\", word, len);\n    printf(\"first=%c last=%c\\n\", word[0], word[len - 1]);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "word=code len=4\nfirst=c last=e\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "手动构造字符串忘记补 \\0，%s 会一直读到越界。",
            "数组长度要比可见字符多 1 才放得下 \\0。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把字符串 \"code\" 倒序打印。",
              "hint": "从 len-1 倒着循环到 0。",
              "answer": "for (int i = len - 1; i >= 0; i--) printf(\"%c\", word[i]); // edoc"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-025",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "C 025：string.h 常用函数",
      "summary": "不要手写 strlen，用标准库。",
      "concepts": [
        "strlen",
        "strcmp",
        "strcpy",
        "strcat"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-025-lesson",
          "title": "C 025：string.h 常用函数",
          "summary": "不要手写 strlen，用标准库。",
          "concepts": [
            "strlen",
            "strcmp",
            "strcpy",
            "strcat"
          ],
          "objective": "用标准库处理字符串长度、比较和拼接。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 024"
          ],
          "explain": "<string.h> 提供 strlen（长度）、strcmp（比较，返回 0 表示相等）、strcpy（复制）、strcat（拼接）。strcmp 按字典序返回负数、0 或正数，不能只用 == 比较字符串内容。复制和拼接的目标缓冲区必须足够大。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <string.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    char a[32] = \"hello\";\n    char b[] = \"world\";\n    printf(\"len=%zu\\n\", strlen(a));\n    printf(\"cmp=%d\\n\", strcmp(a, b) < 0);\n    strcat(a, \" \");\n    strcat(a, b);\n    printf(\"joined=%s\\n\", a);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "len=5\ncmp=1\njoined=hello world\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "用 == 比较两个字符串比较的是地址，不是内容。",
            "strcat 前目标数组必须有足够空间，否则缓冲区溢出。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把 \"QFLI\" 和 \"Forge\" 拼成 \"QFLI-Forge\"。",
              "hint": "先 strcpy 再 strcat 中间的 \"-\"。",
              "answer": "char s[32];\nstrcpy(s, \"QFLI\");\nstrcat(s, \"-\");\nstrcat(s, \"Forge\");"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-026",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "C 026：用 scanf 读取输入",
      "summary": "scanf 与 printf 互为镜像。",
      "concepts": [
        "scanf",
        "input.txt",
        "& 取地址",
        "返回值"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-026-lesson",
          "title": "C 026：用 scanf 读取输入",
          "summary": "scanf 与 printf 互为镜像。",
          "concepts": [
            "scanf",
            "input.txt",
            "& 取地址",
            "返回值"
          ],
          "objective": "从标准输入读取整数并计算。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 004"
          ],
          "explain": "本 App 的运行模型是「先把输入准备好、再一次性跑完」，所以标准输入写在项目根目录的 input.txt 里。scanf 的用法和 printf 反过来：它按格式把读到的值写进变量的地址，所以变量前要加 &。scanf 返回成功读取的项数，可用于判断输入是否足够。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int a, b;\n    if (scanf(\"%d %d\", &a, &b) != 2) {\n        printf(\"need two integers\\n\");\n        return 1;\n    }\n    printf(\"%d + %d = %d\\n\", a, b, a + b);\n    printf(\"%d * %d = %d\\n\", a, b, a * b);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "17 + 5 = 22\n17 * 5 = 85\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "忘记变量前的 & 会写入错误地址，程序可能崩溃。",
            "%d 读整数，读小数要用 %lf 且目标是 double 的地址。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "再读一个整数 c，输出三个数的和。",
              "hint": "scanf 改成 \"%d %d %d\"，input.txt 补一个数。",
              "answer": "int c;\nscanf(\"%d %d %d\", &a, &b, &c);\nprintf(\"sum=%d\\n\", a + b + c);"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-027",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "C 027：getchar 与 putchar",
      "summary": "按字符处理输入，理解 EOF。",
      "concepts": [
        "getchar",
        "putchar",
        "EOF",
        "字符流"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-027-lesson",
          "title": "C 027：getchar 与 putchar",
          "summary": "按字符处理输入，理解 EOF。",
          "concepts": [
            "getchar",
            "putchar",
            "EOF",
            "字符流"
          ],
          "objective": "逐字符读写标准输入输出。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 026"
          ],
          "explain": "getchar 每次读一个字符，读到输入末尾返回 EOF（通常是 -1）。putchar 输出一个字符。它们常用来做逐字符统计，比如数一数输入里有多少个字母。用 int 接收 getchar 的返回值才能正确判断 EOF。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int ch;\n    int letters = 0;\n    while ((ch = getchar()) != EOF) {\n        if ((ch >= 'a' && ch <= 'z') || (ch >= 'A' && ch <= 'Z')) {\n            letters++;\n        }\n    }\n    printf(\"letters=%d\\n\", letters);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "letters=10\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "用 char 接收 getchar 返回值会无法区分 EOF 和有效字符。",
            "把赋值写成 while ((ch = getchar()) != EOF) 才正确。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "统计输入里的空格数量。",
              "hint": "在循环里判断 ch == ' '。",
              "answer": "int spaces = 0;\nwhile ((ch = getchar()) != EOF) if (ch == ' ') spaces++;"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-028",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "C 028：const 与 #define",
      "summary": "给常量起名字，代码更清晰。",
      "concepts": [
        "const",
        "#define",
        "符号常量",
        "只读变量"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-028-lesson",
          "title": "C 028：const 与 #define",
          "summary": "给常量起名字，代码更清晰。",
          "concepts": [
            "const",
            "#define",
            "符号常量",
            "只读变量"
          ],
          "objective": "用 const 和宏定义常量，避免魔法数字。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 002"
          ],
          "explain": "const 修饰的变量只读，编译器会检查你不能改写它，适合有类型的常量。宏 #define 在预处理阶段做文本替换，没有类型。一般优先用 const，宏多用于包含头文件、条件编译和简单配置。常量名习惯全大写。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\n#define PI 3.14159\n\nint main(void) {\n    const int maxCount = 100;\n    double r = 2.0;\n    printf(\"area=%.4f\\n\", PI * r * r);\n    printf(\"maxCount=%d\\n\", maxCount);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "area=12.5664\nmaxCount=100\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "const 变量在初始化后赋值会编译错误。",
            "宏定义后不加分号，否则分号会被一起替换进去。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "定义一个 const double 表示折扣率 0.8，并计算 100 元折后价。",
              "hint": "const double discount = 0.8;。",
              "answer": "const double discount = 0.8;\nprintf(\"%.2f\\n\", 100 * discount); // 80.00"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-029",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "C 029：注释与代码风格",
      "summary": "让代码自己会说话，注释补充原因。",
      "concepts": [
        "//",
        "/* */",
        "命名",
        "可读性"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-029-lesson",
          "title": "C 029：注释与代码风格",
          "summary": "让代码自己会说话，注释补充原因。",
          "concepts": [
            "//",
            "/* */",
            "命名",
            "可读性"
          ],
          "objective": "用注释解释「为什么」，用命名表达「是什么」。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 001"
          ],
          "explain": "// 注释到行尾，/* */ 可跨多行。注释应解释意图和原因，而不是重复代码。变量和函数用能表达含义的名字，例如 totalSeconds 而不是 t。统一的缩进（每层 4 个空格）能大幅提升可读性。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\n/* 把秒数换算成「分:秒」格式。\n   用 -1 表示无效输入，避免返回一个看似合理的 0。 */\nvoid printClock(int seconds) {\n    if (seconds < 0) {\n        printf(\"invalid\\n\"); // 负秒数没有意义\n        return;\n    }\n    printf(\"%d:%02d\\n\", seconds / 60, seconds % 60);\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    printClock(125);\n    printClock(-5);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "2:05\ninvalid\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "过期的注释比没有注释更糟，改代码要同步改注释。",
            "嵌套 /* */ 注释不合法，内层 */ 会提前结束外层。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 printClock 增加一行注释说明 %02d 的作用。",
              "hint": "%02d 表示至少两位、不足补零。",
              "answer": "printf(\"%d:%02d\\n\", seconds / 60, seconds % 60); // %02d: 秒数补零对齐"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-030",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "C 030：用 printf 调试",
      "summary": "最土也最有效的调试手段。",
      "concepts": [
        "调试",
        "打印变量",
        "定位"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-030-lesson",
          "title": "C 030：用 printf 调试",
          "summary": "最土也最有效的调试手段。",
          "concepts": [
            "调试",
            "打印变量",
            "定位"
          ],
          "objective": "用临时打印快速定位逻辑错误。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 028"
          ],
          "explain": "在可疑位置打印变量的值，观察程序实际走的路径和中间结果，是排查逻辑错误最快的办法。打印时带上标签（如 i=、sum=）便于区分。定位后应删除或收敛这些调试打印，不要留在最终代码里。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int values[] = {4, 9, 2, 7};\n    int n = 4, max = values[0];\n    for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n        printf(\"i=%d candidate=%d max=%d\\n\", i, values[i], max);\n        if (values[i] > max) max = values[i];\n    }\n    printf(\"final max=%d\\n\", max);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "i=1 candidate=9 max=4\ni=2 candidate=2 max=9\ni=3 candidate=7 max=9\nfinal max=9\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "调试打印太多会淹没关键信息，聚焦可疑区间。",
            "忘记删除调试打印会污染程序的正常输出。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "在求和循环里加打印，确认每次累加后的 sum。",
              "hint": "在 sum += x 后打印 sum。",
              "answer": "sum += x;\nprintf(\"sum=%d\\n\", sum);"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-031",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "C 031：编译与链接是怎么回事",
      "summary": "编译生成目标文件，链接拼成程序。",
      "concepts": [
        "编译",
        "链接",
        "目标文件",
        "可执行文件"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-031-lesson",
          "title": "C 031：编译与链接是怎么回事",
          "summary": "编译生成目标文件，链接拼成程序。",
          "concepts": [
            "编译",
            "链接",
            "目标文件",
            "可执行文件"
          ],
          "objective": "理解从源码到可执行文件的两大阶段。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 019"
          ],
          "explain": "编译器先把每个 .c 文件单独编译成目标文件，这一步只检查单个文件的语法和声明；链接器再把所有目标文件和库拼成可执行文件，这一步才检查函数是否真的存在。所以「找不到某个函数」通常是链接错误，而不是编译错误。App 的桌面后端会自动完成这两步。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint helper(void);\n\nint main(void) {\n    printf(\"helper=%d\\n\", helper());\n    return 0;\n}\n\nint helper(void) { return 42; }\n",
          "output": "helper=42\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "只声明没定义会在链接阶段报 undefined reference。",
            "把函数定义放进头文件并被多个 .c 包含会导致重复定义。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "说出「undefined reference」属于编译阶段还是链接阶段。",
              "hint": "它和函数的存在性有关。",
              "answer": "链接阶段——编译期只知道声明，链接期才去找定义。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-032",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "C 032：头文件与多文件结构",
      "summary": "为什么要把声明和实现分开。",
      "concepts": [
        "头文件",
        "声明与定义",
        "模块化",
        "include"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-032-lesson",
          "title": "C 032：头文件与多文件结构",
          "summary": "为什么要把声明和实现分开。",
          "concepts": [
            "头文件",
            "声明与定义",
            "模块化",
            "include"
          ],
          "objective": "理解头文件放声明、源文件放定义的分工。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 031"
          ],
          "explain": "多文件项目里，习惯把函数的声明放进 .h 头文件，把定义放进 .c 源文件，其他文件通过 #include \"name.h\" 使用。头文件用 include guard（#ifndef / #define / #endif）防止被重复包含。本 App 的教程示例是单文件自包含的，这里用注释描述真实项目里的文件划分方式。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\n/* 真实项目会拆成：\n     mathutils.h  : int add(int, int); int mul(int, int);\n     mathutils.c  : 两个函数的定义\n     main.c       : #include \"mathutils.h\" 后调用\n   这里把三者合并成单文件，效果一致。 */\n\nint add(int a, int b) { return a + b; }\nint mul(int a, int b) { return a * b; }\n\nint main(void) {\n    printf(\"add=%d mul=%d\\n\", add(20, 22), mul(6, 7));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "add=42 mul=42\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "头文件里写函数定义被多处包含会重复定义。",
            "缺少 include guard 会导致重复声明甚至递归包含。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写出 mathutils.h 应当包含的内容。",
              "hint": "只要声明，不要定义。",
              "answer": "#ifndef MATHUTILS_H\n#define MATHUTILS_H\nint add(int, int);\nint mul(int, int);\n#endif"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-033",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "C 033：命令行参数入门",
      "summary": "程序也能接收启动参数。",
      "concepts": [
        "argc",
        "argv",
        "程序参数"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-033-lesson",
          "title": "C 033：命令行参数入门",
          "summary": "程序也能接收启动参数。",
          "concepts": [
            "argc",
            "argv",
            "程序参数"
          ],
          "objective": "理解 main(argc, argv) 如何接收运行参数。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 031"
          ],
          "explain": "main 的完整形式是 int main(int argc, char *argv[])。argc 是参数个数（包含程序名），argv 是参数字符串数组，argv[0] 是程序名。本 App 运行时通常没有额外参数，但理解这个签名能看懂很多真实代码。示例用注释说明真实运行时 argv[0] 是程序自身的路径。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    /* 真实签名是 int main(int argc, char *argv[])。\n       运行示例程序时 argc=1，argv[0] 是可执行文件的路径。\n       这里用固定值演示参数计数与遍历的思路。 */\n    int argc = 3;\n    char *argv[] = {\"program\", \"--verbose\", \"input.txt\"};\n    printf(\"argc=%d\\n\", argc);\n    for (int i = 0; i < argc; i++) {\n        printf(\"argv[%d]=%s\\n\", i, argv[i]);\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "argc=3\nargv[0]=program\nargv[1]=--verbose\nargv[2]=input.txt\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "argv[0] 是程序名，真正的用户参数从 argv[1] 开始。",
            "读取 argv[i] 前要先确认 i < argc。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "说明为什么遍历 argv 前要检查 i < argc。",
              "hint": "越界访问 argv 会读到无效指针。",
              "answer": "argv 只有 argc 个有效元素，i >= argc 时是越界访问。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-034",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "C 034：阶段小结——温度统计",
      "summary": "用前面所学完成一个温度统计器。",
      "concepts": [
        "综合",
        "数组",
        "循环",
        "函数",
        "条件"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-034-lesson",
          "title": "C 034：阶段小结——温度统计",
          "summary": "用前面所学完成一个温度统计器。",
          "concepts": [
            "综合",
            "数组",
            "循环",
            "函数",
            "条件"
          ],
          "objective": "把变量、数组、循环、函数、条件组合成一个小程序。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 023",
            "C 029"
          ],
          "explain": "这个小结把数组、遍历、函数拆分、条件判断串起来：读入一组温度，算出平均值，统计高于平均的天数。把「求平均」和「计数」拆成独立函数，是保持 main 清爽的好习惯。下面的示例把输入写死在数组里，真实程序会用 scanf 从 input.txt 读取。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\ndouble average(const int *values, int n) {\n    int sum = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) sum += values[i];\n    return (double)sum / n;\n}\n\nint countAbove(const int *values, int n, double threshold) {\n    int count = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        if (values[i] > threshold) count++;\n    }\n    return count;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    int temps[7] = {21, 24, 19, 26, 23, 25, 20};\n    double avg = average(temps, 7);\n    printf(\"avg=%.2f\\n\", avg);\n    printf(\"above=%d\\n\", countAbove(temps, 7, avg));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "avg=22.57\nabove=4\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "average 里若用整数除法会得到错误的平均值。",
            "阈值和数组元素比较时注意是「高于」还是「高于等于」。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "再统计低于平均温度的天数。",
              "hint": "仿照 countAbove 写 countBelow，判断改为 <。",
              "answer": "int countBelow(const int *v, int n, double t) {\n    int c = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) if (v[i] < t) c++;\n    return c;\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-035",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 035：指针入门——地址与解引用",
      "summary": "指针是地址，解引用是访问地址上的值。",
      "concepts": [
        "指针",
        "& 取地址",
        "* 解引用",
        "指针类型"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-035-lesson",
          "title": "C 035：指针入门——地址与解引用",
          "summary": "指针是地址，解引用是访问地址上的值。",
          "concepts": [
            "指针",
            "& 取地址",
            "* 解引用",
            "指针类型"
          ],
          "objective": "理解指针存的是地址，学会用 & 和 * 读写。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 034"
          ],
          "explain": "指针变量存放另一个变量的地址，类型写成 int *。&x 取 x 的地址，*p 取出 p 指向的值。声明 int *p 与使用 *p 是两回事：声明里 * 表示「是指针」，表达式里 * 表示「解引用」。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int value = 42;\n    int *p = &value;\n    printf(\"value=%d\\n\", value);\n    printf(\"*p=%d\\n\", *p);\n    *p = 100;\n    printf(\"after *p=100, value=%d\\n\", value);\n    printf(\"same address=%d\\n\", p == &value);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "value=42\n*p=42\nafter *p=100, value=100\nsame address=1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "解引用未初始化的指针会访问随机内存并崩溃。",
            "int *p, q; 里只有 p 是指针，q 是 int。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "通过指针把 value 变成 7，并打印新的值。",
              "hint": "写 *p = 7; 再打印 value。",
              "answer": "*p = 7;\nprintf(\"%d\\n\", value); // 7"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-036",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 036：用指针交换两个变量",
      "summary": "经典 swap：解释为什么必须传指针。",
      "concepts": [
        "指针参数",
        "swap",
        "原地修改"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-036-lesson",
          "title": "C 036：用指针交换两个变量",
          "summary": "经典 swap：解释为什么必须传指针。",
          "concepts": [
            "指针参数",
            "swap",
            "原地修改"
          ],
          "objective": "通过传指针让函数修改调用方的变量。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 035"
          ],
          "explain": "C 参数按值传递，函数改参数不影响调用方。把变量地址传进去，函数就能通过 *p 修改原变量。swap 是理解这一点的最好例子：参数是 int *，交换的是 *a 和 *b。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nvoid swap(int *a, int *b) {\n    int t = *a;\n    *a = *b;\n    *b = t;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    int x = 1, y = 2;\n    swap(&x, &y);\n    printf(\"x=%d y=%d\\n\", x, y);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "x=2 y=1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "调用时忘记取地址 swap(x, y) 会传入非法指针。",
            "在 swap 里直接交换指针形参本身不会影响调用方。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个函数同时把两个数加一。",
              "hint": "参数是 int *，函数体里 (*a)++; (*b)++;。",
              "answer": "void incBoth(int *a, int *b) { (*a)++; (*b)++; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-037",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 037：指针与数组的关系",
      "summary": "arr[i] 就是 *(arr + i)。",
      "concepts": [
        "数组名退化",
        "指针算术",
        "*(p+i)"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-037-lesson",
          "title": "C 037：指针与数组的关系",
          "summary": "arr[i] 就是 *(arr + i)。",
          "concepts": [
            "数组名退化",
            "指针算术",
            "*(p+i)"
          ],
          "objective": "理解数组名可当指针用，以及等价的两种下标写法。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 035"
          ],
          "explain": "数组名在表达式里会退化成指向首元素的指针。arr[i] 完全等价于 *(arr + i)。指针加 1 不是加 1 个字节，而是加一个元素的大小。这解释了为什么指针和数组在函数参数里几乎可以互换。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int arr[4] = {10, 20, 30, 40};\n    int *p = arr;\n    printf(\"arr[2]=%d\\n\", arr[2]);\n    printf(\"*(arr+2)=%d\\n\", *(arr + 2));\n    printf(\"p[3]=%d\\n\", p[3]);\n    printf(\"*(p+1)=%d\\n\", *(p + 1));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "arr[2]=30\n*(arr+2)=30\np[3]=40\n*(p+1)=20\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "指针加法按元素大小移动，不是按字节。",
            "数组名是常量指针，不能写 arr++。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用指针遍历数组并打印所有元素。",
              "hint": "用 for (int *q = arr; q < arr + 4; q++)。",
              "answer": "for (int *q = arr; q < arr + 4; q++) printf(\"%d \", *q);"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-038",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 038：指针遍历与指针算术",
      "summary": "移到末尾再相减，就是元素个数。",
      "concepts": [
        "指针自增",
        "首尾指针",
        "减法求长度"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-038-lesson",
          "title": "C 038：指针遍历与指针算术",
          "summary": "移到末尾再相减，就是元素个数。",
          "concepts": [
            "指针自增",
            "首尾指针",
            "减法求长度"
          ],
          "objective": "用指针移动遍历数组，用指针差求元素个数。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 037"
          ],
          "explain": "指针可以自增自减，指向下一个或上一个元素。两个指向同一数组的指针相减，得到它们之间的元素个数（类型是 ptrdiff_t）。用「起点指针」和「移动指针」相减是求长度的常用技巧。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int arr[5] = {3, 6, 9, 12, 15};\n    int *begin = arr;\n    int *end = arr + 5;\n    int sum = 0;\n    for (int *p = begin; p != end; p++) {\n        sum += *p;\n    }\n    printf(\"count=%ld\\n\", (long)(end - begin));\n    printf(\"sum=%d\\n\", sum);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "count=5\nsum=45\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "两个不同数组的指针相减是未定义行为。",
            "end 指向最后一个元素的下一个位置，不能解引用。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用指针求数组元素的最大值。",
              "hint": "从第二个元素开始比较，更新 best。",
              "answer": "int best = *arr;\nfor (int *p = arr + 1; p < end; p++) if (*p > best) best = *p;"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-039",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 039：const 指针与指向 const 的指针",
      "summary": "const 放在 * 的哪边决定限制谁。",
      "concepts": [
        "const int *",
        "int * const",
        "只读"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-039-lesson",
          "title": "C 039：const 指针与指向 const 的指针",
          "summary": "const 放在 * 的哪边决定限制谁。",
          "concepts": [
            "const int *",
            "int * const",
            "只读"
          ],
          "objective": "分清「不能改指向」和「不能改内容」。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 035"
          ],
          "explain": "const int *p 表示不能通过 p 修改它指向的值（但 p 可以指向别处）。int * const p 表示 p 本身不能改指向。函数参数用 const int * 表明只读，是良好的接口习惯。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint sum(const int *values, int n) {\n    int total = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) total += values[i];\n    return total;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    int arr[3] = {5, 10, 15};\n    printf(\"sum=%d\\n\", sum(arr, 3));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "sum=30\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "在只读参数里写 values[i] = 0 会编译错误，这是有意保护。",
            "const 的位置很重要：const int * 与 int * const 不同。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个只读函数找出数组中的最小值。",
              "hint": "参数用 const int *，只读不改。",
              "answer": "int minOf(const int *v, int n) { int m = v[0]; for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) if (v[i] < m) m = v[i]; return m; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
