          "id": "c-tutorial-040-lesson",
          "title": "C 040：strlen / strcpy / strcmp 深入",
          "summary": "动手实现一遍，才算真的懂。",
          "concepts": [
            "strlen",
            "strcpy",
            "strcmp 返回语义",
            "自己实现"
          ],
          "objective": "理解标准字符串函数的实现细节与边界。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 025"
          ],
          "explain": "strlen 数到 \\0 为止；strcmp 逐个字符比较，遇到第一个不同就返回两者之差，全相等才返回 0；strcpy 复制包括 \\0。自己实现一遍能看清它们都依赖 \\0，也提醒你目标缓冲区必须够大。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <string.h>\n\nsize_t myStrlen(const char *s) {\n    size_t n = 0;\n    while (s[n] != '\\0') n++;\n    return n;\n}\n\nint myStrcmp(const char *a, const char *b) {\n    while (*a && *a == *b) { a++; b++; }\n    return (unsigned char)*a - (unsigned char)*b;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    printf(\"len=%zu\\n\", myStrlen(\"hello\"));\n    printf(\"cmp=%d\\n\", myStrcmp(\"abc\", \"abd\") < 0);\n    printf(\"eq=%d\\n\", myStrcmp(\"same\", \"same\") == 0);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "len=5\ncmp=1\neq=1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "strcmp 返回的不是 -1/0/1，判断请用 < 0 / == 0。",
            "自己实现时用 unsigned char 比较，避免符号扩展影响顺序。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "实现 myStrcpy 并演示复制一个短字符串。",
              "hint": "逐字符复制直到包含 \\0。",
              "answer": "char *myStrcpy(char *dst, const char *src) { char *d = dst; while ((*d++ = *src++)); return dst; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-041",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 041：strtok 拆分子串",
      "summary": "把 \"a,b,c\" 拆成三段。",
      "concepts": [
        "strtok",
        "分隔符",
        "原地切分"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-041-lesson",
          "title": "C 041：strtok 拆分子串",
          "summary": "把 \"a,b,c\" 拆成三段。",
          "concepts": [
            "strtok",
            "分隔符",
            "原地切分"
          ],
          "objective": "用 strtok 按分隔符逐段解析字符串。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 040"
          ],
          "explain": "strtok 按给定分隔符把字符串切成若干段。第一次传入原字符串，之后传 NULL 继续取下一段。它会就地修改字符串（把分隔符替换成 \\0），所以不能传字符串字面量，要传可写的 char 数组。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <string.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    char line[] = \"apple,banana,,cherry\";\n    int count = 0;\n    char *token = strtok(line, \",\");\n    while (token != NULL) {\n        printf(\"[%s]\\n\", token);\n        count++;\n        token = strtok(NULL, \",\");\n    }\n    printf(\"count=%d\\n\", count);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "[apple]\n[banana]\n[cherry]\ncount=3\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "strtok 会跳过连续分隔符产生的空段。",
            "传入字符串字面量会因写入只读内存而崩溃。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把 \"12-34-56\" 按 - 拆开并求三段之和。",
              "hint": "在循环里用 atoi 转成整数累加。",
              "answer": "int sum = 0;\nfor (char *t = strtok(s, \"-\"); t; t = strtok(NULL, \"-\")) sum += atoi(t);"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-042",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 042：结构体基础",
      "summary": "把名字和坐标绑在一起。",
      "concepts": [
        "struct",
        "成员访问",
        "初始化"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-042-lesson",
          "title": "C 042：结构体基础",
          "summary": "把名字和坐标绑在一起。",
          "concepts": [
            "struct",
            "成员访问",
            "初始化"
          ],
          "objective": "用 struct 把相关字段打包成一个类型。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 019"
          ],
          "explain": "struct 让你自定义组合类型。定义后是一个新类型，用点号 . 访问成员。初始化用花括号按字段顺序给值，也可以用「指定初始化器」.name = ... 按名字赋值，更不易出错。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nstruct Point {\n    int x;\n    int y;\n};\n\nint main(void) {\n    struct Point a = {3, 4};\n    struct Point b = {.x = -1, .y = 7};\n    printf(\"a=(%d,%d)\\n\", a.x, a.y);\n    printf(\"b=(%d,%d)\\n\", b.x, b.y);\n    a.x += 10;\n    printf(\"a.x=%d\\n\", a.x);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "a=(3,4)\nb=(-1,7)\na.x=13\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "struct 定义末尾的分号不能漏。",
            "指定初始化器按名字赋值，顺序可以打乱。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 Point 加一个计算到原点距离平方的函数。",
              "hint": "返回 p.x*p.x + p.y*p.y。",
              "answer": "int lenSq(struct Point p) { return p.x * p.x + p.y * p.y; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-043",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 043：结构体数组与遍历",
      "summary": "结构体数组就是一张记录表。",
      "concepts": [
        "struct 数组",
        "遍历",
        "聚合统计"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-043-lesson",
          "title": "C 043：结构体数组与遍历",
          "summary": "结构体数组就是一张记录表。",
          "concepts": [
            "struct 数组",
            "遍历",
            "聚合统计"
          ],
          "objective": "用结构体数组存一张表并做统计。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 042"
          ],
          "explain": "结构体数组把多条记录连续存放，用下标访问第 i 条记录的成员：list[i].score。遍历可以做求和、求极值、查找等任何聚合操作。结构体数组是 C 里表达「表格」的常用方式。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nstruct Student {\n    char name[16];\n    int score;\n};\n\nint main(void) {\n    struct Student list[3] = {\n        {\"小明\", 88},\n        {\"小红\", 95},\n        {\"小刚\", 72},\n    };\n    int sum = 0, best = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n        sum += list[i].score;\n        if (list[i].score > list[best].score) best = i;\n        printf(\"%s: %d\\n\", list[i].name, list[i].score);\n    }\n    printf(\"avg=%.1f best=%s\\n\", sum / 3.0, list[best].name);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "小明: 88\n小红: 95\n小刚: 72\navg=85.0 best=小红\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "name 字段是定长数组，存不下过长名字会截断。",
            "比较用 > 还是 >= 决定并列时取哪一个。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "统计分数及格（>= 60）的人数。",
              "hint": "遍历时用 if (list[i].score >= 60) count++;。",
              "answer": "int pass = 0;\nfor (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) if (list[i].score >= 60) pass++;"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-044",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 044：结构体指针与 -> 运算符",
      "summary": "p->x 就是 (*p).x 的简写。",
      "concepts": [
        "结构体指针",
        "->",
        "(*p).x"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-044-lesson",
          "title": "C 044：结构体指针与 -> 运算符",
          "summary": "p->x 就是 (*p).x 的简写。",
          "concepts": [
            "结构体指针",
            "->",
            "(*p).x"
          ],
          "objective": "通过指针访问结构体成员，理解 -> 的由来。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 043"
          ],
          "explain": "当 p 是指向结构体的指针时，(*p).x 写法繁琐且易错，于是有了 ->：p->x 等价于 (*p).x。传结构体给函数时通常传指针，避免整个结构体被复制，也能在函数里修改原结构体。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nstruct Counter {\n    int value;\n    int step;\n};\n\nvoid advance(struct Counter *c) {\n    c->value += c->step;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    struct Counter c = {0, 5};\n    advance(&c);\n    advance(&c);\n    printf(\"value=%d\\n\", c.value);\n    printf(\"via arrow=%d\\n\", (&c)->value);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "value=10\nvia arrow=10\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "对非指针用 -> 是语法错误，对指针用 . 也是。",
            "传指针给函数要取地址 advance(&c)。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个函数把 Counter 清零。",
              "hint": "参数是 struct Counter *，把 value 设 0。",
              "answer": "void reset(struct Counter *c) { c->value = 0; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-045",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 045：typedef 简化类型名",
      "summary": "typedef struct {...} Name; 的常见写法。",
      "concepts": [
        "typedef",
        "类型别名",
        "可读性"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-045-lesson",
          "title": "C 045：typedef 简化类型名",
          "summary": "typedef struct {...} Name; 的常见写法。",
          "concepts": [
            "typedef",
            "类型别名",
            "可读性"
          ],
          "objective": "用 typedef 给类型起短名，提升可读性。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 042"
          ],
          "explain": "typedef 给已有类型起别名。最常用的形式是 typedef struct { ... } Point;，这样就不必每次都写 struct Point。typedef 只是别名，不产生新类型，也不影响运行时。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\ntypedef struct {\n    double real;\n    double imag;\n} Complex;\n\nComplex add(Complex a, Complex b) {\n    Complex r = {a.real + b.real, a.imag + b.imag};\n    return r;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    Complex a = {1.0, 2.0};\n    Complex b = {3.0, 4.0};\n    Complex c = add(a, b);\n    printf(\"sum=%.1f+%.1fi\\n\", c.real, c.imag);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "sum=4.0+6.0i\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "typedef 不创建新类型，别名与原类型完全互通。",
            "typedef 与 #define 不同，它受作用域和类型系统约束。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 typedef 给 unsigned long 起名 Size，并声明一个变量。",
              "hint": "typedef unsigned long Size;。",
              "answer": "typedef unsigned long Size;\nSize n = 42;"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
