      "id": "c-tutorial-046",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 046：enum 枚举",
      "summary": "让状态和选项自解释。",
      "concepts": [
        "enum",
        "命名常量",
        "状态机"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-046-lesson",
          "title": "C 046：enum 枚举",
          "summary": "让状态和选项自解释。",
          "concepts": [
            "enum",
            "命名常量",
            "状态机"
          ],
          "objective": "用 enum 给一组相关整数起名字。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 045"
          ],
          "explain": "enum 定义一组命名的整数常量，默认从 0 开始递增。它让 switch 语句和状态表达更清晰：不用记 0 代表什么，直接写 Red。枚举值本质是 int，可以参与比较和运算，但可读性更好。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\ntypedef enum { RED, GREEN, YELLOW } Light;\n\nconst char *nameOf(Light l) {\n    switch (l) {\n        case RED: return \"red\";\n        case GREEN: return \"green\";\n        case YELLOW: return \"yellow\";\n    }\n    return \"unknown\";\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    Light current = GREEN;\n    printf(\"current=%s\\n\", nameOf(current));\n    printf(\"red value=%d\\n\", RED);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "current=green\nred value=0\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "enum 值本质是整数，不能直接用 %s 打印，要靠映射函数。",
            "在 switch 里漏 case 不报错，必要时加 default。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 Light 增加一个 PURPLE 值并返回其名字。",
              "hint": "在枚举和 switch 里各加一项。",
              "answer": "typedef enum { RED, GREEN, YELLOW, PURPLE } Light;\n// switch 里加 case PURPLE: return \"purple\";"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-047",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 047：union 联合体",
      "summary": "同一块内存的多种解释。",
      "concepts": [
        "union",
        "共享内存",
        "类型双关"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-047-lesson",
          "title": "C 047：union 联合体",
          "summary": "同一块内存的多种解释。",
          "concepts": [
            "union",
            "共享内存",
            "类型双关"
          ],
          "objective": "理解 union 的成员共享同一块内存。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 042"
          ],
          "explain": "union 的所有成员共用同一块内存，大小等于最大成员。写入一个成员会覆盖其他成员。它常用于节省内存（同一时刻只用一个字段）或查看同一段字节的不同表示。读取「最后写入之外」的成员是易错点。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nunion Value {\n    int i;\n    float f;\n    unsigned char bytes[4];\n};\n\nint main(void) {\n    union Value v;\n    v.i = 0x01020304;\n    printf(\"i=%d\\n\", v.i);\n    printf(\"bytes=%02x %02x %02x %02x\\n\",\n           v.bytes[0], v.bytes[1], v.bytes[2], v.bytes[3]);\n    printf(\"size=%zu\\n\", sizeof(union Value));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "i=16909060\nbytes=04 03 02 01\nsize=4\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "字节顺序依赖机器（小端/大端），结果不可跨平台假设。",
            "写入一个成员后读取另一个成员的值是实现定义行为。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 union 判断本机是小端还是大端。",
              "hint": "写 v.i = 1，看 v.bytes[0] 是否为 1。",
              "answer": "v.i = 1;\nprintf(v.bytes[0] == 1 ? \"little\" : \"big\");"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-048",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 048：位运算与位掩码",
      "summary": "置位、清位、取位、翻转位。",
      "concepts": [
        "& | ^ ~",
        "<< >>",
        "置位",
        "掩码"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-048-lesson",
          "title": "C 048：位运算与位掩码",
          "summary": "置位、清位、取位、翻转位。",
          "concepts": [
            "& | ^ ~",
            "<< >>",
            "置位",
            "掩码"
          ],
          "objective": "用位运算操作二进制位。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 004"
          ],
          "explain": "位运算直接操作二进制位：x | (1<<n) 置位，x & ~(1<<n) 清位，(x>>n)&1 取第 n 位，x ^ (1<<n) 翻转。它广泛用于标志位、协议解析和性能敏感代码。注意 << 对负数左移是未定义行为。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    unsigned flags = 0;\n    flags |= (1u << 2);\n    flags |= (1u << 5);\n    printf(\"set bit2=%u bit5=%u\\n\", (flags >> 2) & 1u, (flags >> 5) & 1u);\n    flags &= ~(1u << 2);\n    printf(\"cleared bit2=%u\\n\", (flags >> 2) & 1u);\n    printf(\"flags=%u\\n\", flags);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "set bit2=1 bit5=1\ncleared bit2=0\nflags=32\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "1<<n 用 int，n 较大时要写成 1u<<n 避免符号问题。",
            "用 & 判断标志位时结果可能是 2、4 等，判断非零即可。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "统计一个无符号整数里二进制 1 的个数。",
              "hint": "循环 x &= x - 1; 每轮消除最低位的 1。",
              "answer": "int count = 0;\nwhile (x) { x &= x - 1; count++; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-049",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 049：按位实现标志集合",
      "summary": "用一个整数表示一组开关。",
      "concepts": [
        "位标志",
        "enum 掩码",
        "权限"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-049-lesson",
          "title": "C 049：按位实现标志集合",
          "summary": "用一个整数表示一组开关。",
          "concepts": [
            "位标志",
            "enum 掩码",
            "权限"
          ],
          "objective": "把多个开关位打包进一个整数。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 048"
          ],
          "explain": "把每个权限/开关定义成 2 的幂（1、2、4、8...），用一个整数保存它们的组合。判断用 (set & flag) != 0，添加用 |=，移除用 &= ~flag。这比用多个 bool 更省空间，也能一次传递多个开关。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nenum Perm {\n    PERM_READ = 1 << 0,\n    PERM_WRITE = 1 << 1,\n    PERM_EXEC = 1 << 2,\n};\n\nint has(int set, int flag) { return (set & flag) != 0; }\n\nint main(void) {\n    int perms = PERM_READ | PERM_EXEC;\n    printf(\"read=%d write=%d exec=%d\\n\",\n           has(perms, PERM_READ), has(perms, PERM_WRITE), has(perms, PERM_EXEC));\n    perms |= PERM_WRITE;\n    printf(\"after add write=%d\\n\", has(perms, PERM_WRITE));\n    perms &= ~PERM_READ;\n    printf(\"after remove read=%d\\n\", has(perms, PERM_READ));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "read=1 write=0 exec=1\nafter add write=1\nafter remove read=0\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "标志值必须是 2 的幂，不能重复。",
            "用 == 判断组合标志会出错，要用 (set & flag) != 0。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "打印 perms 里还剩下哪些权限。",
              "hint": "逐个用 has 判断并打印名字。",
              "answer": "if (has(perms, PERM_READ)) printf(\"read \");\nif (has(perms, PERM_WRITE)) printf(\"write \");\nif (has(perms, PERM_EXEC)) printf(\"exec \");"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-050",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 050：函数指针",
      "summary": "把函数当参数传递。",
      "concepts": [
        "函数指针",
        "回调",
        "返回类型 (*)(参数)"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-050-lesson",
          "title": "C 050：函数指针",
          "summary": "把函数当参数传递。",
          "concepts": [
            "函数指针",
            "回调",
            "返回类型 (*)(参数)"
          ],
          "objective": "声明函数指针并通过它调用函数。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 035"
          ],
          "explain": "函数指针存放函数的地址，类型写法是 返回类型 (*名字)(参数类型)。赋值时写函数名即可。通过函数指针调用可以像普通函数一样。它是 C 实现回调、策略选择的基础。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint add(int a, int b) { return a + b; }\nint mul(int a, int b) { return a * b; }\n\nint main(void) {\n    int (*op)(int, int) = add;\n    printf(\"add=%d\\n\", op(3, 4));\n    op = mul;\n    printf(\"mul=%d\\n\", op(3, 4));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "add=7\nmul=12\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "写成 int *op(int,int) 是「返回指针的函数」，不是函数指针。",
            "函数指针签名必须与目标函数完全一致。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "声明一个函数指针指向一个求最大值的函数。",
              "hint": "签名 int (int, int)。",
              "answer": "int maxOf(int a, int b) { return a > b ? a : b; }\nint (*op)(int, int) = maxOf;"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-051",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 051：回调函数",
      "summary": "让调用方决定「对每个元素做什么」。",
      "concepts": [
        "回调",
        "高阶函数",
        "遍历"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-051-lesson",
          "title": "C 051：回调函数",
          "summary": "让调用方决定「对每个元素做什么」。",
          "concepts": [
            "回调",
            "高阶函数",
            "遍历"
          ],
          "objective": "把函数作为参数传给另一个函数。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 050"
          ],
          "explain": "回调就是「把函数当参数传进去，由被调用者在合适时机调用它」。例如遍历数组并对每个元素应用一个操作，操作本身由调用方提供。这样同一个遍历框架能支持求和、打印、统计等不同行为。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nvoid forEach(int *arr, int n, void (*visit)(int)) {\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) visit(arr[i]);\n}\n\nvoid printIt(int x) { printf(\"%d \", x); }\nvoid squareIt(int x) { printf(\"%d \", x * x); }\n\nint main(void) {\n    int arr[4] = {1, 2, 3, 4};\n    forEach(arr, 4, printIt);\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    forEach(arr, 4, squareIt);\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1 2 3 4 \n1 4 9 16 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "回调的签名必须与参数类型匹配。",
            "回调里用到的外部状态要在调用前准备好。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个回调把每个元素打印成 [x] 形式。",
              "hint": "回调签名 void (int)，打印 [ 值 ]。",
              "answer": "void bracket(int x) { printf(\"[%d]\", x); }\nforEach(arr, 4, bracket);"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-052",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 052：malloc 与 free",
      "summary": "运行时才确定大小的内存。",
      "concepts": [
        "malloc",
        "free",
        "堆内存",
        "泄漏"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-052-lesson",
          "title": "C 052：malloc 与 free",
          "summary": "运行时才确定大小的内存。",
          "concepts": [
            "malloc",
            "free",
            "堆内存",
            "泄漏"
          ],
          "objective": "在堆上分配和释放内存。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 036"
          ],
          "explain": "malloc 在堆上分配指定字节数，返回 void *，失败返回 NULL。用完后必须 free 释放，否则内存泄漏。malloc 不会清零内存，需要清零可用 calloc。分配和释放要一一对应。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int n = 5;\n    int *arr = (int *)malloc((size_t)n * sizeof(int));\n    if (arr == NULL) {\n        printf(\"alloc failed\\n\");\n        return 1;\n    }\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) arr[i] = i * i;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) printf(\"%d \", arr[i]);\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    free(arr);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "0 1 4 9 16 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "忘记检查 malloc 返回 NULL 会崩溃。",
            "free 后继续用该指针是悬空指针，行为未定义。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "分配一个能存 10 个 double 的数组并全部置 0。",
              "hint": "malloc 后逐个赋值，或用 calloc(10, sizeof(double))。",
              "answer": "double *v = (double *)calloc(10, sizeof(double));\n// 用完后 free(v);"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-053",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 053：calloc 与 realloc",
      "summary": "动态数组的扩容套路。",
      "concepts": [
        "calloc",
        "realloc",
        "扩容",
        "临时指针"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-053-lesson",
          "title": "C 053：calloc 与 realloc",
          "summary": "动态数组的扩容套路。",
          "concepts": [
            "calloc",
            "realloc",
            "扩容",
            "临时指针"
          ],
          "objective": "用 calloc 分配清零内存，用 realloc 扩容。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 052"
          ],
          "explain": "calloc(n, size) 分配并清零。realloc(ptr, newSize) 调整已分配内存大小，可能搬到新地址并返回新指针；失败返回 NULL 且原内存仍有效。所以要先存到临时指针，成功后再赋回。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int *a = (int *)calloc(3, sizeof(int));\n    for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) printf(\"%d \", a[i]);\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    int *tmp = (int *)realloc(a, 5 * sizeof(int));\n    if (tmp == NULL) {\n        free(a);\n        return 1;\n    }\n    a = tmp;\n    a[3] = 100;\n    a[4] = 200;\n    for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) printf(\"%d \", a[i]);\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    free(a);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "0 0 0 \n0 0 0 100 200 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "把 realloc 的返回值直接赋给原指针，失败时会泄漏原内存。",
            "realloc 后旧指针可能失效，必须使用返回的新指针。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 realloc 把长度为 3 的数组扩到 8，并在新位置写值。",
              "hint": "先存临时指针再赋回。",
              "answer": "int *t = realloc(a, 8 * sizeof(int));\nif (t) a = t;"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-054",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 054：动态数组的增删",
      "summary": "当 size 追平 capacity 就翻倍扩容。",
      "concepts": [
        "动态数组",
        "size/capacity",
        "追加"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-054-lesson",
          "title": "C 054：动态数组的增删",
          "summary": "当 size 追平 capacity 就翻倍扩容。",
          "concepts": [
            "动态数组",
            "size/capacity",
            "追加"
          ],
          "objective": "用 size 与 capacity 管理一个可增长数组。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 053"
          ],
          "explain": "可增长数组记录两个量：size（已有元素数）和 capacity（已分配容量）。追加时若 size == capacity 就先扩容（常见做法是容量翻倍），再写入。这种「翻倍扩容」使追加的平均代价接近常数。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int capacity = 2, size = 0;\n    int *a = (int *)malloc((size_t)capacity * sizeof(int));\n    for (int v = 10; v <= 60; v += 10) {\n        if (size == capacity) {\n            capacity *= 2;\n            a = (int *)realloc(a, (size_t)capacity * sizeof(int));\n        }\n        a[size++] = v;\n    }\n    printf(\"size=%d capacity=%d\\n\", size, capacity);\n    for (int i = 0; i < size; i++) printf(\"%d \", a[i]);\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    free(a);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "size=6 capacity=8\n10 20 30 40 50 60 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "扩容后要使用 realloc 返回的新指针。",
            "capacity 是容量不是长度，别用它遍历元素。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "在追加前检查 size==capacity 并打印每次扩容。",
              "hint": "扩容分支里打印 old capacity -> new。",
              "answer": "if (size == capacity) { printf(\"grow %d->%d\\n\", capacity, capacity * 2); capacity *= 2; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-055",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 055：内存安全——越界、泄漏、悬空",
      "summary": "C 不替你检查内存，规则要自己守。",
      "concepts": [
        "越界",
        "泄漏",
        "悬空指针",
        "双重释放"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-055-lesson",
          "title": "C 055：内存安全——越界、泄漏、悬空",
          "summary": "C 不替你检查内存，规则要自己守。",
          "concepts": [
            "越界",
            "泄漏",
            "悬空指针",
            "双重释放"
          ],
          "objective": "识别并避免四类常见内存错误。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 052"
          ],
          "explain": "四类典型错误：越界（写到数组外）、泄漏（malloc 后忘记 free）、悬空指针（free 后继续用）、双重释放（对同一块 free 两次）。规矩是：谁分配谁释放，释放后把指针置 NULL，边界用长度变量守。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int n = 3;\n    int *a = (int *)malloc((size_t)n * sizeof(int));\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) a[i] = i + 1;\n    printf(\"sum=%d\\n\", a[0] + a[1] + a[2]);\n    free(a);\n    a = NULL;\n    printf(\"freed and nulled=%d\\n\", a == NULL);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "sum=6\nfreed and nulled=1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "free 后不置 NULL，之后误用仍会编译通过但运行出错。",
            "在循环里反复 malloc 却不 free 是最隐蔽的泄漏。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "说明为什么 free 之后要把指针置为 NULL。",
              "hint": "防止重复释放和悬空访问。",
              "answer": "置 NULL 后误用会立刻以空指针暴露，重复 free(NULL) 也被定义为安全。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-056",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 056：二维数组",
      "summary": "矩阵就是数组的数组。",
      "concepts": [
        "二维数组",
        "行列遍历",
        "内存布局"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-056-lesson",
          "title": "C 056：二维数组",
          "summary": "矩阵就是数组的数组。",
          "concepts": [
            "二维数组",
            "行列遍历",
            "内存布局"
          ],
          "objective": "声明并遍历二维数组，理解行优先存储。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 043"
          ],
          "explain": "int m[2][3] 是 2 行 3 列的矩阵，m[i][j] 访问第 i 行第 j 列。它在内存里是行优先连续存放的。遍历时用两层循环，外层行、内层列。把二维数组传给函数时，列数必须写进参数类型。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int m[2][3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};\n    int sum = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < 2; i++) {\n        for (int j = 0; j < 3; j++) {\n            printf(\"%d \", m[i][j]);\n            sum += m[i][j];\n        }\n        printf(\"\\n\");\n    }\n    printf(\"sum=%d\\n\", sum);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1 2 3 \n4 5 6 \nsum=21\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "m[2][3] 是「2 行 3 列」，索引顺序别反。",
            "传二维数组给函数时第二维长度是类型的一部分，不能省。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "求出矩阵每行的和并打印。",
              "hint": "每行内层循环累加一个 rowSum。",
              "answer": "for (int i = 0; i < 2; i++) { int rowSum = 0; for (int j = 0; j < 3; j++) rowSum += m[i][j]; printf(\"row%d=%d\\n\", i, rowSum); }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-057",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 057：递归——阶乘与斐波那契",
      "summary": "函数调用自己，直到触及基准情形。",
      "concepts": [
        "递归",
        "基准情形",
        "调用栈"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-057-lesson",
          "title": "C 057：递归——阶乘与斐波那契",
          "summary": "函数调用自己，直到触及基准情形。",
          "concepts": [
            "递归",
            "基准情形",
            "调用栈"
          ],
          "objective": "用递归解决可分拆的问题。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 052"
          ],
          "explain": "递归函数必须有一个「基准情形」直接返回，否则会无限递归导致栈溢出。阶乘 n! = n * (n-1)!，基准是 0! = 1。斐波那契的朴素递归会重复计算大量子问题，只适合演示。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nlong factorial(int n) {\n    if (n <= 1) return 1;\n    return n * factorial(n - 1);\n}\n\nint fib(int n) {\n    if (n < 2) return n;\n    return fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2);\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    printf(\"5! = %ld\\n\", factorial(5));\n    printf(\"fib(10) = %d\\n\", fib(10));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "5! = 120\nfib(10) = 55\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "忘了基准情形会栈溢出。",
            "朴素 fib 是指数级复杂度，n 稍大就极慢。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用递归求 1 到 n 的和。",
              "hint": "基准 n<=0 返回 0，否则 n + sum(n-1)。",
              "answer": "int sumTo(int n) { return n <= 0 ? 0 : n + sumTo(n - 1); }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-058",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 058：递归与迭代的取舍",
      "summary": "能用迭代就别用深递归。",
      "concepts": [
        "尾递归",
        "迭代",
        "栈深度"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-058-lesson",
          "title": "C 058：递归与迭代的取舍",
          "summary": "能用迭代就别用深递归。",
          "concepts": [
            "尾递归",
            "迭代",
            "栈深度"
          ],
          "objective": "理解递归与迭代的等价与代价。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 057"
          ],
          "explain": "任何递归都能改写成迭代。递归逻辑清晰但有栈深度限制和函数调用开销；迭代更快、内存更省。像「遍历目录」「解析嵌套结构」这类问题递归更自然，而简单累加用迭代更稳。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nlong factIter(int n) {\n    long r = 1;\n    for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) r *= i;\n    return r;\n}\n\nint gcdIter(int a, int b) {\n    while (b != 0) {\n        int t = a % b;\n        a = b;\n        b = t;\n    }\n    return a;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    printf(\"10! = %ld\\n\", factIter(10));\n    printf(\"gcd(48,36) = %d\\n\", gcdIter(48, 36));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "10! = 3628800\ngcd(48,36) = 12\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "阶乘结果很快超出 int 范围，要用 long。",
            "深递归（几十万层）会耗尽栈，应改迭代。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用迭代实现从 n 倒着打印到 1。",
              "hint": "for (int i = n; i >= 1; i--)。",
              "answer": "for (int i = n; i >= 1; i--) printf(\"%d \", i);"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-059",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 059：冒泡排序",
      "summary": "相邻比较，大的往后浮。",
      "concepts": [
        "排序",
        "冒泡",
        "交换",
        "提前退出"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-059-lesson",
          "title": "C 059：冒泡排序",
          "summary": "相邻比较，大的往后浮。",
          "concepts": [
            "排序",
            "冒泡",
            "交换",
            "提前退出"
          ],
          "objective": "实现冒泡排序并理解它的复杂度。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 038"
          ],
          "explain": "冒泡排序重复走访数组，比较相邻两元素，逆序就交换。每一轮把当前最大的「冒」到末尾。如果某一轮没有发生交换，说明已经有序，可以提前结束。平均和最坏是 O(n^2)。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nvoid bubble(int *a, int n) {\n    for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i++) {\n        int swapped = 0;\n        for (int j = 0; j < n - 1 - i; j++) {\n            if (a[j] > a[j + 1]) {\n                int t = a[j]; a[j] = a[j + 1]; a[j + 1] = t;\n                swapped = 1;\n            }\n        }\n        if (!swapped) break;\n    }\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    int a[6] = {5, 2, 9, 1, 5, 6};\n    bubble(a, 6);\n    for (int i = 0; i < 6; i++) printf(\"%d \", a[i]);\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1 2 5 5 6 9 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "内层循环上界是 n-1-i，已排好的尾部不用再看。",
            "相等元素不交换，才保证稳定排序。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "改成降序排序。",
              "hint": "把内层比较的 > 改成 <。",
              "answer": "if (a[j] < a[j + 1]) { int t = a[j]; a[j] = a[j + 1]; a[j + 1] = t; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-060",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 060：选择排序与插入排序",
      "summary": "选择排序每轮选最小，插入排序像理牌。",
      "concepts": [
        "选择排序",
        "插入排序",
        "稳定性"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-060-lesson",
          "title": "C 060：选择排序与插入排序",
          "summary": "选择排序每轮选最小，插入排序像理牌。",
          "concepts": [
            "选择排序",
            "插入排序",
            "稳定性"
          ],
          "objective": "实现两种 O(n^2) 排序并比较适用场景。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 059"
          ],
          "explain": "选择排序每轮从未排序区间挑出最小元素放到前面，交换次数少。插入排序把新元素插入到已排好序的前缀里，像整理扑克牌；对近乎有序的数据非常快，而且是稳定的。两者都是 O(n^2)。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nvoid selection(int *a, int n) {\n    for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i++) {\n        int min = i;\n        for (int j = i + 1; j < n; j++) if (a[j] < a[min]) min = j;\n        int t = a[i]; a[i] = a[min]; a[min] = t;\n    }\n}\n\nvoid insertion(int *a, int n) {\n    for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n        int key = a[i], j = i - 1;\n        while (j >= 0 && a[j] > key) { a[j + 1] = a[j]; j--; }\n        a[j + 1] = key;\n    }\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    int a[6] = {4, 7, 2, 9, 1, 5};\n    selection(a, 6);\n    for (int i = 0; i < 6; i++) printf(\"%d \", a[i]);\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    int b[6] = {4, 7, 2, 9, 1, 5};\n    insertion(b, 6);\n    for (int i = 0; i < 6; i++) printf(\"%d \", b[i]);\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1 2 4 5 7 9 \n1 2 4 5 7 9 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "选择排序不稳定，相同值的相对顺序可能改变。",
            "插入排序内层用 > 才稳定，用 >= 会破坏稳定性。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "说明插入排序为什么对近乎有序的数据很快。",
              "hint": "看 while 循环进入的次数。",
              "answer": "近乎有序时内层 while 很少进入，移动次数接近 0，整体接近 O(n)。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-061",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 061：归并排序",
      "summary": "分成两半排好再合并。",
      "concepts": [
        "分治",
        "归并",
        "O(n log n)",
        "额外空间"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-061-lesson",
          "title": "C 061：归并排序",
          "summary": "分成两半排好再合并。",
          "concepts": [
            "分治",
            "归并",
            "O(n log n)",
            "额外空间"
          ],
          "objective": "用分治实现稳定 O(n log n) 排序。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 057"
          ],
          "explain": "归并排序把数组一分为二，分别排好序，再合并两个有序数组。合并时从两边取较小者，保证稳定。时间复杂度 O(n log n)，代价是需要 O(n) 的额外空间。递归下降的基准是区间只剩一个元素。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n\nvoid merge(int *a, int *tmp, int lo, int mid, int hi) {\n    int i = lo, j = mid + 1, k = lo;\n    while (i <= mid && j <= hi) tmp[k++] = (a[i] <= a[j]) ? a[i++] : a[j++];\n    while (i <= mid) tmp[k++] = a[i++];\n    while (j <= hi) tmp[k++] = a[j++];\n    for (int t = lo; t <= hi; t++) a[t] = tmp[t];\n}\n\nvoid msort(int *a, int *tmp, int lo, int hi) {\n    if (lo >= hi) return;\n    int mid = lo + (hi - lo) / 2;\n    msort(a, tmp, lo, mid);\n    msort(a, tmp, mid + 1, hi);\n    merge(a, tmp, lo, mid, hi);\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    int a[7] = {38, 27, 43, 3, 9, 82, 10};\n    int *tmp = (int *)malloc(7 * sizeof(int));\n    msort(a, tmp, 0, 6);\n    for (int i = 0; i < 7; i++) printf(\"%d \", a[i]);\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    free(tmp);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "3 9 10 27 38 43 82 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "merge 里用 a[i] <= a[j] 才稳定。",
            "中间下标用 lo + (hi - lo) / 2 避免大数相加溢出。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "说明归并排序比冒泡排序快在哪里。",
              "hint": "比较两者复杂度。",
              "answer": "归并是 O(n log n)，冒泡是 O(n^2)；数据越大差距越明显，代价是额外 O(n) 空间。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-062",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 062：快速排序与 qsort",
      "summary": "选基准分区，再递归两边。",
      "concepts": [
        "快排",
        "分区",
        "qsort",
        "比较函数"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-062-lesson",
          "title": "C 062：快速排序与 qsort",
          "summary": "选基准分区，再递归两边。",
          "concepts": [
            "快排",
            "分区",
            "qsort",
            "比较函数"
          ],
          "objective": "理解快排分区，并会用标准 qsort。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 061"
          ],
          "explain": "快速排序选一个基准，把比它小的放到左边、大的放到右边，再对两边递归。平均 O(n log n)，原地排序。标准库的 qsort 就是通用快排，需要你提供一个比较函数：返回负数、0 或正数表示 a 小于、等于、大于 b。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n\nint cmpAsc(const void *a, const void *b) {\n    int x = *(const int *)a;\n    int y = *(const int *)b;\n    return (x > y) - (x < y);\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    int a[6] = {42, 8, 17, 4, 23, 15};\n    qsort(a, 6, sizeof(int), cmpAsc);\n    for (int i = 0; i < 6; i++) printf(\"%d \", a[i]);\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "4 8 15 17 23 42 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "比较函数必须返回 int，不能直接 return a - b（可能溢出）。",
            "(x > y) - (x < y) 是写出三态比较的简洁技巧。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个降序比较函数并用 qsort 排序。",
              "hint": "把两个减法交换方向即可。",
              "answer": "int cmpDesc(const void *a, const void *b) { int x = *(const int*)a, y = *(const int*)b; return (y > x) - (y < x); }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-063",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 063：二分查找",
      "summary": "每次砍掉一半区间。",
      "concepts": [
        "二分查找",
        "有序前提",
        "边界"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-063-lesson",
          "title": "C 063：二分查找",
          "summary": "每次砍掉一半区间。",
          "concepts": [
            "二分查找",
            "有序前提",
            "边界"
          ],
          "objective": "在有序数组里用 O(log n) 查找目标。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 062"
          ],
          "explain": "二分查找要求数组已排序。每次看中间元素，比目标小就把左边界右移，比目标大就把右边界左移。关键是 mid 的计算和边界更新要避免死循环：mid = lo + (hi - lo)/2，区间用闭区间 [lo, hi]。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint bsearchInt(const int *a, int n, int target) {\n    int lo = 0, hi = n - 1;\n    while (lo <= hi) {\n        int mid = lo + (hi - lo) / 2;\n        if (a[mid] == target) return mid;\n        if (a[mid] < target) lo = mid + 1;\n        else hi = mid - 1;\n    }\n    return -1;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    int a[7] = {2, 5, 8, 12, 16, 23, 38};\n    printf(\"find 16 -> %d\\n\", bsearchInt(a, 7, 16));\n    printf(\"find 9 -> %d\\n\", bsearchInt(a, 7, 9));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "find 16 -> 4\nfind 9 -> -1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "对未排序数组做二分结果是错的。",
            "边界写成 lo < hi 或更新写 mid 本身都可能死循环。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "找出目标第一次出现的下标（数组有重复时）。",
              "hint": "找到后不要立即返回，继续往左收缩 hi = mid - 1。",
              "answer": "if (a[mid] == target) { result = mid; hi = mid - 1; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-064",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "C 064：单链表",
      "summary": "节点存数据加一个指向下一个的指针。",
      "concepts": [
        "链表",
        "节点",
        "next 指针",
        "插入遍历"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-064-lesson",
          "title": "C 064：单链表",
          "summary": "节点存数据加一个指向下一个的指针。",
          "concepts": [
            "链表",
            "节点",
            "next 指针",
            "插入遍历"
          ],
          "objective": "用节点和 next 指针实现链表。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 052"
          ],
          "explain": "链表由节点组成，每个节点含数据和指向下一个节点的指针，最后一个节点的 next 是 NULL。头插法在头部插入是 O(1)。遍历靠 next 指针一个个走。链表插入删除比数组灵活，但随机访问是 O(n)。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n\ntypedef struct Node {\n    int value;\n    struct Node *next;\n} Node;\n\nNode *push(Node *head, int value) {\n    Node *n = (Node *)malloc(sizeof(Node));\n    n->value = value;\n    n->next = head;\n    return n;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    Node *head = NULL;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= 3; i++) head = push(head, i);\n    for (Node *p = head; p != NULL; p = p->next) printf(\"%d \", p->value);\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    while (head != NULL) { Node *t = head->next; free(head); head = t; }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "3 2 1 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "头插法让元素顺序反转，最后插入的在最前。",
            "释放链表要先存下一个节点，再 free 当前节点。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个函数求链表长度。",
              "hint": "遍历时用计数器累加。",
              "answer": "int length(Node *head) { int n = 0; for (Node *p = head; p; p = p->next) n++; return n; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
