      "summary": "用 FILE* 读写文本文件。",
      "concepts": [
        "fopen",
        "fclose",
        "fgets",
        "fprintf",
        "逐行读取"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-065-lesson",
          "title": "C 065：文件读写——文本模式",
          "summary": "用 FILE* 读写文本文件。",
          "concepts": [
            "fopen",
            "fclose",
            "fgets",
            "fprintf",
            "逐行读取"
          ],
          "objective": "打开文件、逐行读取、写回并正确关闭。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 041"
          ],
          "explain": "fopen 返回 FILE*，失败返回 NULL，必须检查。fgets 逐行读取（带缓冲区大小），fprintf 写文本。用完必须 fclose，否则数据可能没落盘。读文件循环用 while (fgets(...)) 判断是否到文件尾。示例自建一个临时文件再读它，保证可重复运行。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    FILE *w = fopen(\"demo.txt\", \"w\");\n    if (!w) { printf(\"open failed\\n\"); return 1; }\n    fprintf(w, \"alpha\\n\");\n    fprintf(w, \"beta\\n\");\n    fclose(w);\n    FILE *r = fopen(\"demo.txt\", \"r\");\n    char line[64];\n    int count = 0;\n    while (fgets(line, sizeof(line), r)) {\n        printf(\"line: %s\", line);\n        count++;\n    }\n    fclose(r);\n    printf(\"count=%d\\n\", count);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "line: alpha\nline: beta\ncount=2\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "不检查 fopen 的 NULL 返回会导致后续崩溃。",
            "忘记 fclose 会泄漏文件句柄、丢失缓冲数据。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个程序统计某文件的行数。",
              "hint": "循环 fgets，每读到一行计数器加一。",
              "answer": "int lines = 0;\nwhile (fgets(line, sizeof(line), f)) lines++;"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-066",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 066：二进制文件读写",
      "summary": "按字节读写数据结构。",
      "concepts": [
        "fwrite",
        "fread",
        "fseek",
        "结构体序列化"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-066-lesson",
          "title": "C 066：二进制文件读写",
          "summary": "按字节读写数据结构。",
          "concepts": [
            "fwrite",
            "fread",
            "fseek",
            "结构体序列化"
          ],
          "objective": "用 fwrite/fread 存取结构体数组。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 065"
          ],
          "explain": "fwrite 把内存中的一段字节写到文件，fread 反过来读回。把结构体数组整块写出去、整块读回来很常见。注意字节序和结构体填充会随平台变化，跨平台持久化要自己定义格式。fseek 可以定位到文件的任意位置。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\ntypedef struct { int id; int score; } Record;\n\nint main(void) {\n    Record out[2] = {{1, 90}, {2, 85}};\n    FILE *f = fopen(\"data.bin\", \"wb\");\n    fwrite(out, sizeof(Record), 2, f);\n    fclose(f);\n    Record in[2];\n    f = fopen(\"data.bin\", \"rb\");\n    size_t n = fread(in, sizeof(Record), 2, f);\n    fclose(f);\n    printf(\"read=%zu\\n\", n);\n    for (size_t i = 0; i < n; i++) printf(\"id=%d score=%d\\n\", in[i].id, in[i].score);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "read=2\nid=1 score=90\nid=2 score=85\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "fread 的返回值是「读到了几个元素」，要用它判断是否读完。",
            "直接写结构体字节在不同平台/编译器下不兼容。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 fseek 读取第二个记录。",
              "hint": "fseek(f, sizeof(Record), SEEK_SET) 再 fread 一个。",
              "answer": "fseek(f, (long)sizeof(Record), SEEK_SET);\nfread(&one, sizeof(Record), 1, f);"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-067",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 067：errno 与错误处理",
      "summary": "系统调用失败时问 errno 为什么。",
      "concepts": [
        "errno",
        "perror",
        "strerror",
        "错误传播"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-067-lesson",
          "title": "C 067：errno 与错误处理",
          "summary": "系统调用失败时问 errno 为什么。",
          "concepts": [
            "errno",
            "perror",
            "strerror",
            "错误传播"
          ],
          "objective": "用 errno 和 perror 报告系统调用失败原因。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 065"
          ],
          "explain": "很多标准库和系统调用失败时会设置全局的 errno。perror 会打印「你给的说明: 系统错误信息」。strerror(errno) 返回对应的文字说明。错误处理的原则：能就地处理的就地处理，否则把错误往上返回，不要吞掉。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <errno.h>\n#include <string.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    FILE *f = fopen(\"no_such_file_qfli.txt\", \"r\");\n    if (f == NULL) {\n        printf(\"errno=%d\\n\", errno);\n        printf(\"message: %s\\n\", strerror(errno));\n    } else {\n        fclose(f);\n    }\n    printf(\"handled=%d\\n\", f == NULL);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "errno=2\nmessage: No such file or directory\nhandled=1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "errno 只反映最近一次失败，检查前不要调用可能改它的函数。",
            "成功调用不会清零 errno，不能靠它判断是否成功。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "在打开失败时用 perror 打印错误。",
              "hint": "perror(\"open demo\") 会带上前缀。",
              "answer": "if (f == NULL) perror(\"open demo\");"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-068",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 068：不透明指针与句柄",
      "summary": "头文件只见句柄，实现藏在 .c 里。",
      "concepts": [
        "opaque pointer",
        "封装",
        "句柄",
        "ABI"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-068-lesson",
          "title": "C 068：不透明指针与句柄",
          "summary": "头文件只见句柄，实现藏在 .c 里。",
          "concepts": [
            "opaque pointer",
            "封装",
            "句柄",
            "ABI"
          ],
          "objective": "用不透明指针隐藏结构体实现细节。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 052"
          ],
          "explain": "不透明指针是「只暴露一个指针类型，不暴露结构体定义」的封装手法：调用方只能通过函数操作句柄，无法直接访问字段。这样修改内部结构不影响调用方，也便于保持二进制兼容。示例把结构体定义和操作函数放在一起，模拟这种模块边界。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n\ntypedef struct Counter Counter;\n\nCounter *counterCreate(int start);\nvoid counterAdd(Counter *c, int delta);\nint counterValue(const Counter *c);\nvoid counterDestroy(Counter *c);\n\nstruct Counter { int value; };\n\nCounter *counterCreate(int start) {\n    Counter *c = (Counter *)malloc(sizeof(Counter));\n    if (c) c->value = start;\n    return c;\n}\nvoid counterAdd(Counter *c, int delta) { c->value += delta; }\nint counterValue(const Counter *c) { return c->value; }\nvoid counterDestroy(Counter *c) { free(c); }\n\nint main(void) {\n    Counter *c = counterCreate(10);\n    counterAdd(c, 32);\n    printf(\"value=%d\\n\", counterValue(c));\n    counterDestroy(c);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "value=42\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "调用方若能看到 struct 定义，封装就失效了。",
            "句柄的创建和销毁要配对，否则泄漏。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给句柄接口加一个 counterReset 函数。",
              "hint": "把 value 设回 0。",
              "answer": "void counterReset(Counter *c) { c->value = 0; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-069",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 069：回调式接口与虚表",
      "summary": "把一组函数指针放进结构体当接口。",
      "concepts": [
        "虚表",
        "struct 函数指针",
        "多态"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-069-lesson",
          "title": "C 069：回调式接口与虚表",
          "summary": "把一组函数指针放进结构体当接口。",
          "concepts": [
            "虚表",
            "struct 函数指针",
            "多态"
          ],
          "objective": "用函数指针结构体模拟面向对象的多态。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 051"
          ],
          "explain": "C 没有类，但可以用「结构体里放函数指针」来模拟虚表。不同实现提供各自的函数，调用方通过统一的接口指针调用。标准库的 FILE 和很多驱动接口都是这个思路。示例定义一个简单的 Shape 接口和两种实现。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\ntypedef struct Shape Shape;\nstruct Shape {\n    const char *name;\n    double (*area)(const Shape *);\n};\n\ndouble rectArea(const Shape *s) { (void)s; return 3.0 * 4.0; }\ndouble circleArea(const Shape *s) { (void)s; return 3.14159 * 1.0 * 1.0; }\n\nint main(void) {\n    Shape r = {\"rect\", rectArea};\n    Shape c = {\"circle\", circleArea};\n    const Shape *shapes[2] = {&r, &c};\n    for (int i = 0; i < 2; i++) {\n        printf(\"%s area=%.2f\\n\", shapes[i]->name, shapes[i]->area(shapes[i]));\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "rect area=12.00\ncircle area=3.14\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "函数指针要用 -> 或 (*p) 调用，别写成方法语法。",
            "每个实现都必须填充虚表里的所有函数指针。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 Shape 加一个求周长的函数指针和两种实现。",
              "hint": "在 struct 里加 double (*perimeter)(const Shape *)。",
              "answer": "struct Shape { const char *name; double (*area)(const Shape *); double (*perimeter)(const Shape *); };"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-070",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 070：变参函数与 va_list",
      "summary": "像 printf 那样接收不确定个数的参数。",
      "concepts": [
        "变参",
        "va_list",
        "va_start",
        "va_arg"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-070-lesson",
          "title": "C 070：变参函数与 va_list",
          "summary": "像 printf 那样接收不确定个数的参数。",
          "concepts": [
            "变参",
            "va_list",
            "va_start",
            "va_arg"
          ],
          "objective": "实现一个参数个数可变的函数。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 050"
          ],
          "explain": "用 <stdarg.h> 的 va_list、va_start、va_arg、va_end 可以实现变参函数。因为无法自动得知参数个数，通常约定一个「参数个数」参数或一个哨兵值。printf 是靠格式串里的占位符个数来知道要取几个参数。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdarg.h>\n\nint sum(int count, ...) {\n    va_list args;\n    va_start(args, count);\n    int total = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < count; i++) total += va_arg(args, int);\n    va_end(args);\n    return total;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    printf(\"sum3=%d\\n\", sum(3, 10, 20, 12));\n    printf(\"sum4=%d\\n\", sum(4, 1, 2, 3, 4));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "sum3=42\nsum4=10\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "va_arg 的类型必须与传入实参的实际类型一致，否则未定义。",
            "忘记 va_end 可能在某些 ABI 上出问题。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个变参函数求最大值，用哨兵 0 结束。",
              "hint": "循环 va_arg 直到遇到 0。",
              "answer": "int maxSenti(int first, ...) { va_list a; va_start(a, first); int m = first, v; while ((v = va_arg(a, int)) != 0) if (v > m) m = v; va_end(a); return m; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-071",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 071：预处理器——宏与条件编译",
      "summary": "预处理在编译前做文本级替换。",
      "concepts": [
        "#define",
        "带参数宏",
        "#ifdef",
        "include guard"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-071-lesson",
          "title": "C 071：预处理器——宏与条件编译",
          "summary": "预处理在编译前做文本级替换。",
          "concepts": [
            "#define",
            "带参数宏",
            "#ifdef",
            "include guard"
          ],
          "objective": "用宏做常量、简单内联和条件编译。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 028"
          ],
          "explain": "预处理器在编译前工作：#define 定义常量或带参数宏，#ifdef/#ifndef 做条件编译，include guard 防止头文件被重复包含。带参数宏要整体加括号，避免运算符优先级问题。能用函数就别用宏，宏只是文本替换。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\n#define SQUARE(x) ((x) * (x))\n#define MAX(a, b) ((a) > (b) ? (a) : (b))\n#define FLAG 1\n\nint main(void) {\n    printf(\"square(3+1)=%d\\n\", SQUARE(3 + 1));\n    printf(\"max=%d\\n\", MAX(10, 7));\n#ifdef FLAG\n    printf(\"flag enabled\\n\");\n#endif\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "square(3+1)=16\nmax=10\nflag enabled\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "宏参数不加括号会因优先级得到错误结果。",
            "带副作用的参数如 SQUARE(i++) 会被求值两次。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个带参数宏求三个数的最大值。",
              "hint": "嵌套使用 MAX。",
              "answer": "#define MAX3(a, b, c) MAX(MAX(a, b), c)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-072",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 072：条件编译与平台适配",
      "summary": "同一份源码适配多种环境。",
      "concepts": [
        "#if",
        "#elif",
        "#else",
        "平台宏"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-072-lesson",
          "title": "C 072：条件编译与平台适配",
          "summary": "同一份源码适配多种环境。",
          "concepts": [
            "#if",
            "#elif",
            "#else",
            "平台宏"
          ],
          "objective": "用条件编译针对不同平台/配置编译不同代码。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 071"
          ],
          "explain": "条件编译常用于平台差异和调试开关。编译器会预定义一些平台宏，如 _WIN32、__linux__、__APPLE__。用 #if defined(...) 组合判断。注意：被条件编译排除的代码不参与编译，所以语法错误也不会被发现。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n#if defined(_WIN32)\n    const char *os = \"windows\";\n#elif defined(__APPLE__)\n    const char *os = \"macos\";\n#elif defined(__linux__)\n    const char *os = \"linux\";\n#else\n    const char *os = \"unknown\";\n#endif\n    printf(\"os=%s\\n\", os);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "os=linux\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "不同平台的输出不同，示例输出以 Linux 为准。",
            "条件编译块的括号/分号要成对，写错很难定位。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "增加一个 OS_NAME 宏，未定义时回退到 \"unknown\"。",
              "hint": "先用 #ifndef OS_NAME 定义默认值。",
              "answer": "#ifndef OS_NAME\n#define OS_NAME \"unknown\"\n#endif"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-073",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 073：字符串解析——手写 tokenizer",
      "summary": "把 \"12 + 34\" 拆成数字和运算符。",
      "concepts": [
        "词法分析",
        "状态机",
        "字符分类"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-073-lesson",
          "title": "C 073：字符串解析——手写 tokenizer",
          "summary": "把 \"12 + 34\" 拆成数字和运算符。",
          "concepts": [
            "词法分析",
            "状态机",
            "字符分类"
          ],
          "objective": "手写一个简单的表达式分词器。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 048"
          ],
          "explain": "分词是编译器和配置解析的第一步：扫描字符流，把连续的数字归成一个数，把运算符各归成一个记号。实现时用一个「当前位置」指针，遇到空白跳过，遇到数字就吃到不再是数字为止。这是自底向上解析文本的基本功。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <ctype.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    const char *s = \"12 + 34*5\";\n    int i = 0;\n    while (s[i] != '\\0') {\n        if (isspace((unsigned char)s[i])) { i++; continue; }\n        if (isdigit((unsigned char)s[i])) {\n            int value = 0;\n            while (isdigit((unsigned char)s[i])) {\n                value = value * 10 + (s[i] - '0');\n                i++;\n            }\n            printf(\"number %d\\n\", value);\n        } else {\n            printf(\"operator %c\\n\", s[i]);\n            i++;\n        }\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "number 12\noperator +\nnumber 34\noperator *\nnumber 5\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "传给 isdigit/isspace 前要转成 unsigned char，避免负值。",
            "数字解析忘记推进下标会死循环。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "让分词器跳过逗号。",
              "hint": "遇到 s[i] == ',' 就 i++ 继续。",
              "answer": "if (s[i] == ',') { i++; continue; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-074",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 074：手写 CSV 解析",
      "summary": "把一行数据解析成字段。",
      "concepts": [
        "CSV",
        "字段拆分",
        "异常行"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-074-lesson",
          "title": "C 074：手写 CSV 解析",
          "summary": "把一行数据解析成字段。",
          "concepts": [
            "CSV",
            "字段拆分",
            "异常行"
          ],
          "objective": "按逗号拆分一行 CSV 并转换成数值。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 073"
          ],
          "explain": "CSV 解析比 strtok 多几步：要处理引号包裹的字段、空字段和字段个数不一致的行。示例用逐字符扫描，遇到逗号就收一个字段。真实项目里还要处理带逗号的引号字段、转义和换行，这里演示核心流程。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    const char *row = \"alice,30,engineer\";\n    char field[32];\n    int fi = 0, fields = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; ; i++) {\n        char c = row[i];\n        if (c == ',' || c == '\\0') {\n            field[fi] = '\\0';\n            printf(\"field[%d]=%s\\n\", fields, field);\n            fields++;\n            fi = 0;\n            if (c == '\\0') break;\n        } else if (fi < (int)sizeof(field) - 1) {\n            field[fi++] = c;\n        }\n    }\n    printf(\"total=%d\\n\", fields);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "field[0]=alice\nfield[1]=30\nfield[2]=engineer\ntotal=3\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "字段缓冲区要防止溢出，fi 不能超过容量。",
            "最后一行末尾没有逗号，要靠 \\0 收尾。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把第二列转成整数年龄并打印。",
              "hint": "对字段用 atoi。",
              "answer": "printf(\"age=%d\\n\", age); // age = atoi(第二个字段)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-075",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 075：散列函数与哈希表思想",
      "summary": "把字符串映射成一个整数下标。",
      "concepts": [
        "哈希",
        "FNV",
        "冲突",
        "装载因子"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-075-lesson",
          "title": "C 075：散列函数与哈希表思想",
          "summary": "把字符串映射成一个整数下标。",
          "concepts": [
            "哈希",
            "FNV",
            "冲突",
            "装载因子"
          ],
          "objective": "实现一个字符串散列函数并理解冲突。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 064"
          ],
          "explain": "哈希表靠散列函数把键映射到桶下标，从而平均 O(1) 查找。FNV-1a 是简单可靠的字符串散列：先取一个偏移基数，再对每个字节先异或后乘。不同键可能落到同一桶（冲突），需要拉链或开放寻址处理。装载因子过高会退化。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdint.h>\n\nuint32_t fnv1a(const char *s) {\n    uint32_t h = 2166136261u;\n    while (*s) {\n        h ^= (unsigned char)*s++;\n        h *= 16777619u;\n    }\n    return h;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    const char *keys[] = {\"apple\", \"banana\", \"cherry\"};\n    for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n        printf(\"%s bucket=%u\\n\", keys[i], fnv1a(keys[i]) % 16);\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "apple bucket=15\nbanana bucket=0\ncherry bucket=8\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "用乘法和异或，别用取模，否则分布差。",
            "桶数取质数或 2 的幂会得到不同分布。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个更简单的 djb2 散列并比较结果。",
              "hint": "h = h*33 + c，初值 5381。",
              "answer": "uint32_t djb2(const char *s) { uint32_t h = 5381; while (*s) h = h * 33 + (unsigned char)*s++; return h; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-076",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 076：多文件工程与头文件分工",
      "summary": "接口放头文件，实现放源文件。",
      "concepts": [
        "模块",
        "声明/定义",
        "include guard",
        "内部/外部链接"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-076-lesson",
          "title": "C 076：多文件工程与头文件分工",
          "summary": "接口放头文件，实现放源文件。",
          "concepts": [
            "模块",
            "声明/定义",
            "include guard",
            "内部/外部链接"
          ],
          "objective": "把代码按模块拆分成 .h 和 .c。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 032"
          ],
          "explain": "多文件工程里，模块的公共接口放在 .h 头文件（只放声明），实现放在 .c 源文件。头文件加 include guard 防重复包含。只在模块内部使用的函数应加 static，限制在文件内。示例用注释展示典型的文件划分，代码保持单文件自包含以便运行。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\n/* 典型三文件结构：\n     stack.h  : typedef + 函数声明（带 include guard）\n     stack.c  : 结构体定义 + 函数实现（static 辅助函数）\n     main.c   : #include \"stack.h\" 后使用\n   这里合并为单文件演示同一逻辑。 */\n\ntypedef struct { int data[8]; int top; } Stack;\n\nstatic void push(Stack *s, int v) { s->data[s->top++] = v; }\nstatic int pop(Stack *s) { return s->data[--s->top]; }\n\nint main(void) {\n    Stack s = {{0}, 0};\n    push(&s, 1);\n    push(&s, 2);\n    push(&s, 3);\n    printf(\"pop=%d\\n\", pop(&s));\n    printf(\"pop=%d\\n\", pop(&s));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "pop=3\npop=2\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "把定义放进头文件并被多个 .c 包含会导致重复定义。",
            "static 函数只在本文件可见，是模块私有化的手段。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写出 stack.h 的 include guard 与 push 声明。",
              "hint": "#ifndef/#define/#endif 包裹再声明 push。",
              "answer": "#ifndef STACK_H\n#define STACK_H\ntypedef struct { int data[8]; int top; } Stack;\nvoid push(Stack *, int);\nint pop(Stack *);\n#endif"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-077",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 077：分离编译与链接顺序",
      "summary": "为什么函数找不到是链接错误。",
      "concepts": [
        "分离编译",
        "链接",
        "符号",
        "undefined reference"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-077-lesson",
          "title": "C 077：分离编译与链接顺序",
          "summary": "为什么函数找不到是链接错误。",
          "concepts": [
            "分离编译",
            "链接",
            "符号",
            "undefined reference"
          ],
          "objective": "理解编译每个文件、再链接成可执行文件的过程。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 076"
          ],
          "explain": "大项目把每个 .c 单独编译成 .o 目标文件（只检查本文件），再由链接器把所有 .o 和库合并成可执行文件。链接期才检查「函数是否真的存在」，所以拼错或漏实现报的是 undefined reference。用 nm 可以查看目标文件的符号。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\n/* 模拟两个翻译单元：unit_a 提供 add，main 调用它。\n   真实构建：cc -c unit_a.c 得到 unit_a.o\n             cc -c main.c   得到 main.o\n             cc unit_a.o main.o -o app  （链接） */\n\nint add(int a, int b);\n\nint main(void) {\n    printf(\"add=%d\\n\", add(20, 22));\n    return 0;\n}\n\nint add(int a, int b) { return a + b; }\n",
          "output": "add=42\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "编译单个 .c 时只需声明；链接时才需要定义。",
            "重复定义（两个 .o 里有同名非 static 函数）会报错。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "说明为什么把函数定义写进头文件容易出现重复定义。",
              "hint": "头文件被多个 .c 包含后，每个 .o 都有一份定义。",
              "answer": "头文件被多个源文件包含后，每个目标文件都含一份非 static 定义，链接时冲突。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-078",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 078：Makefile 与增量构建",
      "summary": "只重新编译改动过的文件。",
      "concepts": [
        "make",
        "目标",
        "依赖",
        "增量"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-078-lesson",
          "title": "C 078：Makefile 与增量构建",
          "summary": "只重新编译改动过的文件。",
          "concepts": [
            "make",
            "目标",
            "依赖",
            "增量"
          ],
          "objective": "看懂 Makefile 的规则和增量构建思想。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 077"
          ],
          "explain": "Makefile 用「目标: 依赖」描述构建规则，命令在下一行（前面必须是一个制表符）。make 比较目标文件和依赖的时间戳，只重建过期的目标，这就是增量构建。变量 CC、CFLAGS 让编译选项集中管理。示例不依赖 make 运行，只讲解结构。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\n/* 典型 Makefile：\n     CC = gcc\n     CFLAGS = -std=c17 -Wall -Wextra\n     app: main.o util.o\n     \t$(CC) $(CFLAGS) main.o util.o -o app\n     main.o: main.c util.h\n     \t$(CC) $(CFLAGS) -c main.c\n   目标 app 依赖两个 .o；只要某个 .c 比 .o 新就重建。 */\n\nint main(void) {\n    printf(\"make keeps builds incremental\\n\");\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "make keeps builds incremental\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "命令行前必须是制表符，空格会报 missing separator。",
            "依赖漏写头文件，改头文件后不会触发重建。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写出 app 目标依赖 main.o 与 util.o 的规则行。",
              "hint": "目标: 依赖 换行后跟构建命令。",
              "answer": "app: main.o util.o\n\t$(CC) $(CFLAGS) main.o util.o -o app"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-079",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 079：断言与运行时检查",
      "summary": "断言帮你抓住「本不该发生」的 bug。",
      "concepts": [
        "assert",
        "NDEBUG",
        "防御式编程",
        "前置条件"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-079-lesson",
          "title": "C 079：断言与运行时检查",
          "summary": "断言帮你抓住「本不该发生」的 bug。",
          "concepts": [
            "assert",
            "NDEBUG",
            "防御式编程",
            "前置条件"
          ],
          "objective": "用 assert 检查不应发生的条件。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 067"
          ],
          "explain": "assert(条件) 在条件为假时打印文件名行号并终止程序。它用来检查程序内部不变量和前置条件，是调试利器。定义 NDEBUG 后 assert 会被移除，所以不要用它处理可预期的错误（那要用返回值/errno）。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <assert.h>\n\nint divide(int a, int b) {\n    assert(b != 0 && \"divisor must not be zero\");\n    return a / b;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    printf(\"divide=%d\\n\", divide(84, 2));\n    printf(\"checks passed\\n\");\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "divide=42\nchecks passed\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "断言里不要放有副作用的表达式，NDEBUG 下它会被删掉。",
            "可预期的输入错误要用返回值和 errno，不是 assert。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "在求数组平均值的函数里用 assert 检查长度大于 0。",
              "hint": "assert(n > 0);",
              "answer": "double average(const int *v, int n) { assert(n > 0); int s = 0; for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) s += v[i]; return (double)s / n; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-080",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 080：结构体对齐与填充",
      "summary": "对齐要求让结构体出现空洞。",
      "concepts": [
        "对齐",
        "填充",
        "offsetof",
        "sizeof"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-080-lesson",
          "title": "C 080：结构体对齐与填充",
          "summary": "对齐要求让结构体出现空洞。",
          "concepts": [
            "对齐",
            "填充",
            "offsetof",
            "sizeof"
          ],
          "objective": "理解结构体为什么比字段之和更大。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 045"
          ],
          "explain": "为了访问效率，编译器要求每个字段按自身大小对齐，于是字段之间会有填充字节，sizeof(struct) 可能大于字段之和。调整字段顺序（大的在前）常能减少填充。offsetof 宏可以查某个字段的偏移。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stddef.h>\n\nstruct Padded { char a; int b; char c; };\nstruct Packed { int b; char a; char c; };\n\nint main(void) {\n    printf(\"padded=%zu\\n\", sizeof(struct Padded));\n    printf(\"packed=%zu\\n\", sizeof(struct Packed));\n    printf(\"offset b=%zu\\n\", offsetof(struct Padded, b));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "padded=12\npacked=8\noffset b=4\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "不要假设结构体大小等于字段之和。",
            "把结构体直接写入文件/网络会带上填充字节。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把 struct Padded 的字段重排以减少填充，并打印大小。",
              "hint": "把 int 放最前。",
              "answer": "struct Padded { int b; char a; char c; };\nprintf(\"%zu\\n\", sizeof(struct Padded)); // 8"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-081",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 081：环形缓冲区",
      "summary": "用取模下标实现先进先出队列。",
      "concepts": [
        "环形缓冲",
        "读写下标",
        "取模"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-081-lesson",
          "title": "C 081：环形缓冲区",
          "summary": "用取模下标实现先进先出队列。",
          "concepts": [
            "环形缓冲",
            "读写下标",
            "取模"
          ],
          "objective": "实现一个固定容量的环形缓冲区。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 064"
          ],
          "explain": "环形缓冲区用固定数组加读、写两个下标，下标对容量取模实现循环。适用于日志缓冲、生产者消费者等场景，无需动态分配。关键是判断空和满：用 count 计数比用下标差更简单可靠。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\ntypedef struct {\n    int data[4];\n    int head, tail, count;\n} Ring;\n\nvoid push(Ring *r, int v) {\n    if (r->count == 4) return;\n    r->data[r->tail] = v;\n    r->tail = (r->tail + 1) % 4;\n    r->count++;\n}\nint pop(Ring *r, int *out) {\n    if (r->count == 0) return 0;\n    *out = r->data[r->head];\n    r->head = (r->head + 1) % 4;\n    r->count--;\n    return 1;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    Ring r = {{0}, 0, 0, 0};\n    push(&r, 1); push(&r, 2); push(&r, 3);\n    int v;\n    while (pop(&r, &v)) printf(\"%d \", v);\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1 2 3 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "满/空判断不清会覆盖未读数据或读到旧值。",
            "取模的模数必须与数组容量一致。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "让 push 在满时覆盖最旧元素（丢弃最旧）。",
              "hint": "满时先 pop 再 push。",
              "answer": "if (r->count == 4) { int tmp; pop(r, &tmp); }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-082",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 082：通用容器与 void*",
      "summary": "不知道类型也能搬运数据。",
      "concepts": [
        "void *",
        "泛型",
        "字节拷贝",
        "memcpy"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-082-lesson",
          "title": "C 082：通用容器与 void*",
          "summary": "不知道类型也能搬运数据。",
          "concepts": [
            "void *",
            "泛型",
            "字节拷贝",
            "memcpy"
          ],
          "objective": "用 void* 写一个能存任意类型的容器。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 052"
          ],
          "explain": "void* 可以指向任何类型，配合元素大小就能写通用容器：分配 n*size 字节，用 memcpy 按字节拷贝元素，用 char* 做「按字节移动」的指针算术。代价是丢失类型信息，读取时要自己转回正确类型。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n#include <string.h>\n\ntypedef struct {\n    void *data;\n    size_t elemSize;\n    size_t count;\n} Vector;\n\nvoid vectorInit(Vector *v, size_t elemSize) {\n    v->elemSize = elemSize;\n    v->count = 0;\n    v->data = malloc(elemSize * 4);\n}\nvoid vectorPush(Vector *v, const void *elem) {\n    memcpy((char *)v->data + v->count * v->elemSize, elem, v->elemSize);\n    v->count++;\n}\nvoid *vectorAt(Vector *v, size_t i) {\n    return (char *)v->data + i * v->elemSize;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    Vector v;\n    vectorInit(&v, sizeof(int));\n    for (int i = 1; i <= 3; i++) vectorPush(&v, &i);\n    for (size_t i = 0; i < v.count; i++) printf(\"%d \", *(int *)vectorAt(&v, i));\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    free(v.data);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1 2 3 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "void* 上的指针算术不是标准 C，要先转成 char*。",
            "忘记记录 elemSize 就无法正确移动元素。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用同一个 Vector 存 double。",
              "hint": "elemSize 换成 sizeof(double)。",
              "answer": "Vector v; vectorInit(&v, sizeof(double));\ndouble x = 2.5; vectorPush(&v, &x);"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-083",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 083：函数式风格与映射/过滤",
      "summary": "把「做什么」和「怎么遍历」分开。",
      "concepts": [
        "map",
        "filter",
        "reduce",
        "函数指针"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-083-lesson",
          "title": "C 083：函数式风格与映射/过滤",
          "summary": "把「做什么」和「怎么遍历」分开。",
          "concepts": [
            "map",
            "filter",
            "reduce",
            "函数指针"
          ],
          "objective": "用函数指针实现映射、过滤、归约。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 051"
          ],
          "explain": "映射把每个元素变成新值，过滤保留满足条件的元素，归约把整个数组折成一个值。它们的遍历框架固定，具体操作由函数指针提供。这种把逻辑与遍历分离的风格让代码更易复用和测试。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nvoid map(int *dst, const int *src, int n, int (*f)(int)) {\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) dst[i] = f(src[i]);\n}\nint filter(int *dst, const int *src, int n, int (*keep)(int)) {\n    int m = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) if (keep(src[i])) dst[m++] = src[i];\n    return m;\n}\nint reduce(const int *a, int n, int init, int (*op)(int, int)) {\n    int acc = init;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) acc = op(acc, a[i]);\n    return acc;\n}\n\nint dbl(int x) { return x * 2; }\nint isEven(int x) { return x % 2 == 0; }\nint add(int a, int b) { return a + b; }\n\nint main(void) {\n    int src[6] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6};\n    int dst[6];\n    map(dst, src, 6, dbl);\n    printf(\"mapped=%d\\n\", dst[5]);\n    int evens[6];\n    int m = filter(evens, src, 6, isEven);\n    printf(\"evens=%d sum=%d\\n\", m, reduce(evens, m, 0, add));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "mapped=12\nevens=3 sum=12\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "map 的目标数组必须与源数组一样大或更大。",
            "filter 返回的是新长度，遍历要用它而不是原长度。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个过滤奇数的回调并统计个数。",
              "hint": "keep 回调返回 x % 2 != 0。",
              "answer": "int isOdd(int x) { return x % 2 != 0; }\nint m = filter(dst, src, 6, isOdd);"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-084",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 084：性能测量与优化",
      "summary": "先测量，再优化。",
      "concepts": [
        "clock",
        "基准测试",
        "复杂度",
        "过早优化"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-084-lesson",
          "title": "C 084：性能测量与优化",
          "summary": "先测量，再优化。",
          "concepts": [
            "clock",
            "基准测试",
            "复杂度",
            "过早优化"
          ],
          "objective": "用 clock 测量函数耗时并做有依据的优化。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 061"
          ],
          "explain": "优化前必须先测量。clock() 返回进程使用的 CPU 时间（CLOCKS_PER_SEC 为一秒的刻度），可以给一段代码计时。比较不同算法时看的是随规模增长的趋势，而不是绝对毫秒。牢记：过早优化是万恶之源。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <time.h>\n\nlong sumFast(int n) { return (long)n * (n + 1) / 2; }\n\nint main(void) {\n    clock_t start = clock();\n    long r = sumFast(100000000);\n    clock_t end = clock();\n    double seconds = (double)(end - start) / CLOCKS_PER_SEC;\n    printf(\"result=%ld\\n\", r);\n    printf(\"fast=%d\\n\", seconds < 1.0);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "result=5000000050000000\nfast=1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "绝对耗时依赖机器，别把具体毫秒写进断言。",
            "编译器优化可能把循环消掉，测量要防止被优化。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个 O(n) 的循环版本求同样结果并比较。",
              "hint": "循环累加 1..n。",
              "answer": "long sumLoop(int n) { long s = 0; for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) s += i; return s; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-085",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 085：位字段",
      "summary": "在结构体里声明「占几位」。",
      "concepts": [
        "bit-field",
        "struct",
        "紧凑存储"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-085-lesson",
          "title": "C 085：位字段",
          "summary": "在结构体里声明「占几位」。",
          "concepts": [
            "bit-field",
            "struct",
            "紧凑存储"
          ],
          "objective": "用位字段把多个小字段压进一个整数。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 048"
          ],
          "explain": "结构体成员可以声明占多少位，如 unsigned flag : 1;。位字段把多个小值压进极小的空间，适合硬件寄存器映射和紧凑标志。但位字段的内存布局是实现定义的，跨平台/跨编译器不保证一致。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nstruct Flags {\n    unsigned ready : 1;\n    unsigned mode : 2;\n    unsigned level : 3;\n};\n\nint main(void) {\n    struct Flags f = {0, 0, 0};\n    f.ready = 1;\n    f.mode = 3;\n    f.level = 5;\n    printf(\"ready=%u mode=%u level=%u\\n\", f.ready, f.mode, f.level);\n    printf(\"size=%zu\\n\", sizeof(struct Flags));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "ready=1 mode=3 level=5\nsize=4\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "位字段布局是实现定义的，不要据此假设二进制格式。",
            "给位字段赋值超出位数会被截断。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 Flags 加一个占 4 位的 code 字段。",
              "hint": "unsigned code : 4;。",
              "answer": "struct Flags { unsigned ready : 1; unsigned mode : 2; unsigned level : 3; unsigned code : 4; };"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-086",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 086：setjmp/longjmp 错误跳转",
      "summary": "从深层调用直接跳回调用点。",
      "concepts": [
        "setjmp",
        "longjmp",
        "非本地跳转",
        "清理"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-086-lesson",
          "title": "C 086：setjmp/longjmp 错误跳转",
          "summary": "从深层调用直接跳回调用点。",
          "concepts": [
            "setjmp",
            "longjmp",
            "非本地跳转",
            "清理"
          ],
          "objective": "理解 longjmp 如何跨函数跳转。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 067"
          ],
          "explain": "setjmp 记录当前执行点，longjmp 跳回该点，常用于「深层嵌套里出错直接返回顶层」。它绕过正常的函数返回，所以必须自己保证资源清理（释放内存、关闭文件），否则会泄漏。现代 C 一般优先用返回错误码。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <setjmp.h>\n\nstatic jmp_buf jb;\n\nvoid deep(int x) {\n    if (x < 0) longjmp(jb, 1);\n    printf(\"deep ok x=%d\\n\", x);\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    if (setjmp(jb) == 0) {\n        deep(5);\n        deep(-1);\n        printf(\"unreachable\\n\");\n    } else {\n        printf(\"recovered from error\\n\");\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "deep ok x=5\nrecovered from error\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "longjmp 跳过的函数不会执行清理，容易泄漏资源。",
            "setjmp 所在函数的局部变量在 longjmp 后可能不可靠。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "说明为什么用 longjmp 时要格外小心已分配的资源。",
              "hint": "跳转会跳过中间的清理代码。",
              "answer": "longjmp 不展开调用栈，中间函数里的 free/fclose 不会执行，必须手动清理。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-087",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
