      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 087：命令行工具设计",
      "summary": "解析参数、校验、给用法、设退出码。",
      "concepts": [
        "argv 解析",
        "选项",
        "用法提示",
        "退出码"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-087-lesson",
          "title": "C 087：命令行工具设计",
          "summary": "解析参数、校验、给用法、设退出码。",
          "concepts": [
            "argv 解析",
            "选项",
            "用法提示",
            "退出码"
          ],
          "objective": "写一个带选项和用法提示的命令行工具。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 033"
          ],
          "explain": "命令行工具读取 argv，识别选项（如 -n），参数不合法时打印用法到 stderr 并返回非 0 退出码。退出码是脚本判断成功与否的接口：0 表示成功，非 0 表示各类失败。示例硬编码一组参数以便运行。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <string.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int argc = 4;\n    char *argv[] = {\"app\", \"-n\", \"3\", \"name\"};\n    int count = 1;\n    const char *label = NULL;\n    for (int i = 1; i < argc; i++) {\n        if (strcmp(argv[i], \"-n\") == 0 && i + 1 < argc) {\n            count = argv[i + 1][0] - '0';\n            i++;\n        } else {\n            label = argv[i];\n        }\n    }\n    if (label == NULL) {\n        fprintf(stderr, \"usage: app [-n count] label\\n\");\n        return 2;\n    }\n    for (int i = 0; i < count; i++) printf(\"%s\\n\", label);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "name\nname\nname\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "读取 -n 后面的值前要确认 i+1 < argc。",
            "错误信息走 stderr，正常输出走 stdout。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "增加 -q（quiet）选项，安静模式下不打印。",
              "hint": "解析到 -q 时设一个 quiet 标志。",
              "answer": "int quiet = 0;\nif (strcmp(argv[i], \"-q\") == 0) { quiet = 1; continue; }\n// 打印前 if (!quiet) ..."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-088",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 088：大整数加法",
      "summary": "把每一位存进数组，手工模拟进位。",
      "concepts": [
        "大整数",
        "进位",
        "字符串转数字"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-088-lesson",
          "title": "C 088：大整数加法",
          "summary": "把每一位存进数组，手工模拟进位。",
          "concepts": [
            "大整数",
            "进位",
            "字符串转数字"
          ],
          "objective": "用数组模拟超出整数范围的大数加法。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 022"
          ],
          "explain": "当数字超过 64 位，就要自己实现大整数：把每一位数字存进数组，从低位到高位相加，处理进位。示例用十进制字符串倒序存进数组，逐位相加并输出。这是理解「数据表示决定能力上限」的好例子。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <string.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    const char *sa = \"98765432109876543210\";\n    const char *sb = \"12345678901234567890\";\n    int la = (int)strlen(sa), lb = (int)strlen(sb);\n    int a[64] = {0}, b[64] = {0}, sum[65] = {0};\n    for (int i = 0; i < la; i++) a[i] = sa[la - 1 - i] - '0';\n    for (int i = 0; i < lb; i++) b[i] = sb[lb - 1 - i] - '0';\n    int n = la > lb ? la : lb;\n    int carry = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        int s = a[i] + b[i] + carry;\n        sum[i] = s % 10;\n        carry = s / 10;\n    }\n    if (carry) { sum[n] = carry; n++; }\n    printf(\"sum=\");\n    for (int i = n - 1; i >= 0; i--) printf(\"%d\", sum[i]);\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "sum=111111111011111111100\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "最低位在数组下标 0，输出时要倒着打印。",
            "最高位可能因进位多出一位。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "在大整数实现里加一个「加 0」的校验，确保 a+0 == a。",
              "hint": "把 b 全部设 0 再相加。",
              "answer": "memset(b, 0, sizeof(b)); // 再相加应得到原数"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-089",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 089：INI 风格配置解析",
      "summary": "处理键值对、注释、缺失键的默认值。",
      "concepts": [
        "配置解析",
        "键值对",
        "默认值",
        "健壮性"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-089-lesson",
          "title": "C 089：INI 风格配置解析",
          "summary": "处理键值对、注释、缺失键的默认值。",
          "concepts": [
            "配置解析",
            "键值对",
            "默认值",
            "健壮性"
          ],
          "objective": "解析一个简单的 key=value 配置。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 074"
          ],
          "explain": "配置解析要把文本变成程序能用的设置。常见规则：跳过空行和以 # 开头的注释，按 = 拆键值，去掉两端空白，找不到键时用默认值。健壮性体现在：格式错误不崩溃，只是忽略或报错。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <string.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n\nstatic void trim(char *s) {\n    while (*s == ' ' || *s == '\\t') memmove(s, s + 1, strlen(s));\n    size_t n = strlen(s);\n    while (n > 0 && (s[n-1] == ' ' || s[n-1] == '\\n')) s[--n] = '\\0';\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    const char *lines[] = {\"# config\", \"port = 8080\", \"\", \"debug = 1\"};\n    int port = 80, debug = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n        const char *line = lines[i];\n        if (line[0] == '#' || line[0] == '\\0') continue;\n        char buf[64];\n        strncpy(buf, line, sizeof(buf) - 1);\n        buf[sizeof(buf) - 1] = '\\0';\n        char *eq = strchr(buf, '=');\n        if (!eq) continue;\n        *eq = '\\0';\n        char *key = buf, *val = eq + 1;\n        trim(key); trim(val);\n        if (strcmp(key, \"port\") == 0) port = atoi(val);\n        else if (strcmp(key, \"debug\") == 0) debug = atoi(val);\n    }\n    printf(\"port=%d debug=%d\\n\", port, debug);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "port=8080 debug=1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "strncpy 不保证结尾 \\0，要手动补。",
            "键不存在时保留默认值，不要用垃圾值。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "增加一个 name 键（字符串值），缺省为 \"default\"。",
              "hint": "用 strcmp 匹配 \"name\" 再 strcpy 到缓冲区。",
              "answer": "char name[32] = \"default\";\n// if (strcmp(key, \"name\") == 0) strncpy(name, val, sizeof(name)-1);"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-090",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 090：哈希表实现",
      "summary": "数组 + 链表解决冲突。",
      "concepts": [
        "哈希表",
        "拉链法",
        "插入查找",
        "扩容"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-090-lesson",
          "title": "C 090：哈希表实现",
          "summary": "数组 + 链表解决冲突。",
          "concepts": [
            "哈希表",
            "拉链法",
            "插入查找",
            "扩容"
          ],
          "objective": "用拉链法实现一个字符串到整数的哈希表。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 075"
          ],
          "explain": "哈希表用一个桶数组，每个桶是一条链表（拉链法）。插入时算出桶下标，遍历链表看键是否已存在，否则头插。查找同理。装载因子过高时要扩容并重新散列。示例用固定大小桶，演示核心的插入和查找。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n#include <string.h>\n\ntypedef struct Entry {\n    char key[16];\n    int value;\n    struct Entry *next;\n} Entry;\n\n#define BUCKETS 8\n\nstatic unsigned hashOf(const char *s) {\n    unsigned h = 5381;\n    while (*s) h = h * 33 + (unsigned char)*s++;\n    return h % BUCKETS;\n}\n\nstatic void put(Entry **table, const char *key, int value) {\n    unsigned b = hashOf(key);\n    for (Entry *e = table[b]; e; e = e->next)\n        if (strcmp(e->key, key) == 0) { e->value = value; return; }\n    Entry *e = (Entry *)malloc(sizeof(Entry));\n    strncpy(e->key, key, sizeof(e->key) - 1);\n    e->key[sizeof(e->key) - 1] = '\\0';\n    e->value = value;\n    e->next = table[b];\n    table[b] = e;\n}\n\nstatic int *get(Entry **table, const char *key) {\n    for (Entry *e = table[hashOf(key)]; e; e = e->next)\n        if (strcmp(e->key, key) == 0) return &e->value;\n    return NULL;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    Entry *table[BUCKETS] = {0};\n    put(table, \"one\", 1);\n    put(table, \"two\", 2);\n    put(table, \"one\", 100);\n    int *v = get(table, \"one\");\n    printf(\"one=%d\\n\", v ? *v : -1);\n    printf(\"missing=%d\\n\", get(table, \"nope\") == NULL);\n    for (int i = 0; i < BUCKETS; i++)\n        for (Entry *e = table[i]; e; ) { Entry *n = e->next; free(e); e = n; }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "one=100\nmissing=1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "键是定长数组，过长键要处理截断。",
            "重复键要更新而不是再插一个。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "统计哈希表里当前有多少个键。",
              "hint": "遍历所有桶的链表累加计数。",
              "answer": "int count = 0;\nfor (int i = 0; i < BUCKETS; i++) for (Entry *e = table[i]; e; e = e->next) count++;"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-091",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 091：位图与集合",
      "summary": "用每个 bit 表示一个数在不在集合里。",
      "concepts": [
        "位图",
        "bitset",
        "空间效率",
        "集合运算"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-091-lesson",
          "title": "C 091：位图与集合",
          "summary": "用每个 bit 表示一个数在不在集合里。",
          "concepts": [
            "位图",
            "bitset",
            "空间效率",
            "集合运算"
          ],
          "objective": "用一个整数数组表示一个整数集合。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 048"
          ],
          "explain": "位图用一个 bit 表示一个元素是否存在。存 0..63 只需一个 64 位整数：置位用 |= (1<<i)，判断用 >>i & 1。它极其省空间，常用于去重、筛法和集合运算。更大的范围就用 unsigned long 数组。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdint.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    uint64_t set = 0;\n    int values[] = {3, 7, 3, 12, 7};\n    for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) set |= (uint64_t)1 << values[i];\n    printf(\"has 3=%d\\n\", (int)((set >> 3) & 1));\n    printf(\"has 5=%d\\n\", (int)((set >> 5) & 1));\n    printf(\"count=%d\\n\", __builtin_popcountll(set));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "has 3=1\nhas 5=0\ncount=3\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "下标不能超过位宽，否则溢出到未定义。",
            "统计 1 的个数可用 __builtin_popcountll（GCC/Clang）。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "求两个位图集合的交集大小。",
              "hint": "交集是 a & b，再 popcount。",
              "answer": "uint64_t inter = a & b;\nprintf(\"%d\\n\", __builtin_popcountll(inter));"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-092",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 092：简易栈式虚拟机",
      "summary": "把操作码和数据流分开执行。",
      "concepts": [
        "虚拟机",
        "字节码",
        "栈",
        "解释器"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-092-lesson",
          "title": "C 092：简易栈式虚拟机",
          "summary": "把操作码和数据流分开执行。",
          "concepts": [
            "虚拟机",
            "字节码",
            "栈",
            "解释器"
          ],
          "objective": "用栈实现一个能算加减乘的字节码解释器。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 064"
          ],
          "explain": "虚拟机用一条字节码指令流描述操作，用一个栈保存中间值。示例定义 PUSH/ADD/MUL/PRINT 四种操作码，循环读取指令并执行。表达式 (10 + 20) * 2 编译成 PUSH 10, PUSH 20, ADD, PUSH 2, MUL, PRINT。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nenum Op { OP_PUSH, OP_ADD, OP_MUL, OP_PRINT, OP_HALT };\n\nint main(void) {\n    int code[] = {OP_PUSH, 10, OP_PUSH, 20, OP_ADD, OP_PUSH, 2, OP_MUL, OP_PRINT, OP_HALT};\n    int stack[64];\n    int sp = 0;\n    for (int ip = 0; code[ip] != OP_HALT; ip++) {\n        switch (code[ip]) {\n            case OP_PUSH: stack[sp++] = code[++ip]; break;\n            case OP_ADD: { int b = stack[--sp], a = stack[--sp]; stack[sp++] = a + b; break; }\n            case OP_MUL: { int b = stack[--sp], a = stack[--sp]; stack[sp++] = a * b; break; }\n            case OP_PRINT: printf(\"result=%d\\n\", stack[--sp]); break;\n            default: break;\n        }\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "result=60\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "PUSH 后面紧跟数据，要记得跳过它占的那一格。",
            "栈指针不能越界；二元运算前要确认栈里有两个操作数。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "增加一个 OP_SUB 操作码并测试 50-8。",
              "hint": "仿照 OP_ADD，弹两个再压回 a-b。",
              "answer": "case OP_SUB: { int b = stack[--sp], a = stack[--sp]; stack[sp++] = a - b; break; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-093",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 093：内存池/竞技场分配",
      "summary": "一次性申请大块，用完整体重置。",
      "concepts": [
        "arena",
        "内存池",
        "批量释放",
        "性能"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-093-lesson",
          "title": "C 093：内存池/竞技场分配",
          "summary": "一次性申请大块，用完整体重置。",
          "concepts": [
            "arena",
            "内存池",
            "批量释放",
            "性能"
          ],
          "objective": "用一个连续缓冲实现批量分配与整体释放。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 052"
          ],
          "explain": "竞技场分配器先申请一大块内存，之后每次分配只是把偏移往后推，释放时不用逐个 free，而是整体重置。它适合生命周期一致的对象（如一次请求里解析出的所有节点），能显著减少 malloc 次数和碎片。代价是不能单独释放某个对象。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stddef.h>\n\ntypedef struct {\n    unsigned char buffer[256];\n    size_t offset;\n} Arena;\n\nvoid *arenaAlloc(Arena *a, size_t size) {\n    size_t aligned = (size + 7) & ~(size_t)7;\n    if (a->offset + aligned > sizeof(a->buffer)) return NULL;\n    void *p = a->buffer + a->offset;\n    a->offset += aligned;\n    return p;\n}\nvoid arenaReset(Arena *a) { a->offset = 0; }\n\nint main(void) {\n    Arena arena = {{0}, 0};\n    int *a = (int *)arenaAlloc(&arena, sizeof(int));\n    double *d = (double *)arenaAlloc(&arena, sizeof(double));\n    *a = 42;\n    *d = 3.5;\n    printf(\"a=%d d=%.1f used=%zu\\n\", *a, *d, arena.offset);\n    arenaReset(&arena);\n    printf(\"after reset used=%zu\\n\", arena.offset);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "a=42 d=3.5 used=16\nafter reset used=0\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "arena 里的对象生命周期一致，不能单独释放。",
            "分配要按对齐取整，否则未对齐访问可能出错。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "说明竞技场分配器适合和不适合的场景。",
              "hint": "想想对象生命周期和对齐。",
              "answer": "适合：一批生命周期相同、可整体释放的对象。不适合：需要单独释放或大小差异极大的对象。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-094",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 094：侵入式链表",
      "summary": "节点不需要单独分配，嵌在对象里。",
      "concepts": [
        "侵入式",
        "链表节点",
        "零额外分配",
        "container_of"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-094-lesson",
          "title": "C 094：侵入式链表",
          "summary": "节点不需要单独分配，嵌在对象里。",
          "concepts": [
            "侵入式",
            "链表节点",
            "零额外分配",
            "container_of"
          ],
          "objective": "把链表节点嵌进数据结构本身。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 064"
          ],
          "explain": "普通链表为每个元素额外分配一个节点；侵入式链表把链表节点直接放进业务结构体里，元素自身就是节点，因此没有额外分配。代价是需要从节点的地址反推回宿主结构体的地址，常用 offsetof 技巧（container_of 宏）实现。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stddef.h>\n\ntypedef struct Node {\n    struct Node *next;\n} Node;\n\ntypedef struct {\n    Node node;\n    int value;\n} Item;\n\n#define container_of(ptr, type, member) \\\n    ((type *)((char *)(ptr) - offsetof(type, member)))\n\nint main(void) {\n    Item items[3] = {{NULL, 10}, {NULL, 20}, {NULL, 30}};\n    items[0].node.next = &items[1].node;\n    items[1].node.next = &items[2].node;\n    for (Node *n = &items[0].node; n; n = n->next) {\n        Item *it = container_of(n, Item, node);\n        printf(\"%d \", it->value);\n    }\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "10 20 30 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "container_of 依赖 offsetof，结构体布局变化时要小心。",
            "侵入式链表的一个元素不能同时挂在多条链表上（除非多个节点）。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 Item 加第二个 node 字段，让它能同时挂两条链。",
              "hint": "在 struct 里加 Node node2; 分别串。",
              "answer": "typedef struct { Node node; Node node2; int value; } Item;"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-095",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 095：基准测试脚手架",
      "summary": "反复运行取平均，减少噪声。",
      "concepts": [
        "基准",
        "计时",
        "重复",
        "对比"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-095-lesson",
          "title": "C 095：基准测试脚手架",
          "summary": "反复运行取平均，减少噪声。",
          "concepts": [
            "基准",
            "计时",
            "重复",
            "对比"
          ],
          "objective": "写一个对比两种实现的基准脚手架。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 084"
          ],
          "explain": "可靠的基准要多次运行取平均，并用足够的迭代次数让时间可测。对比两种实现时，输入规模和时间测量方式必须一致。还要防止编译器把「没用到的计算」优化掉——把结果累加到一个外部可见的量里。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <time.h>\n\nlong sumLoop(int n) { long s = 0; for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) s += i; return s; }\nlong sumFormula(int n) { return (long)n * (n + 1) / 2; }\n\nint main(void) {\n    volatile long sink = 0;\n    clock_t s1 = clock();\n    for (int r = 0; r < 1000; r++) sink += sumLoop(10000);\n    clock_t e1 = clock();\n    clock_t s2 = clock();\n    for (int r = 0; r < 1000; r++) sink += sumFormula(10000);\n    clock_t e2 = clock();\n    printf(\"sink=%ld\\n\", sink);\n    printf(\"formula faster or equal=%d\\n\", (e2 - s2) <= (e1 - s1));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "sink=100010000000\nformula faster or equal=1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "结果被优化掉会让耗时接近 0，要用 volatile 接收。",
            "只跑一两次噪声太大，要重复多次。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "增加一个冒泡排序的基准并测量其耗时。",
              "hint": "生成随机数组后计时调用 bubble。",
              "answer": "clock_t s = clock();\nfor (int r = 0; r < 100; r++) { /* copy + bubble */ }\nclock_t e = clock();"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-096",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 096：状态机实现",
      "summary": "根据当前状态和输入决定下一步。",
      "concepts": [
        "状态机",
        "enum",
        "转移表",
        "解析"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-096-lesson",
          "title": "C 096：状态机实现",
          "summary": "根据当前状态和输入决定下一步。",
          "concepts": [
            "状态机",
            "enum",
            "转移表",
            "解析"
          ],
          "objective": "用状态机解析一个简单的数字串。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 046"
          ],
          "explain": "状态机把行为建模成「状态 + 输入 -> 新状态 + 动作」。它广泛用于词法分析、协议解析和输入校验。示例用状态机校验一个字符串是否是合法整数（可选符号后跟至少一位数字），用枚举表示状态、用 switch 处理转移。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\ntypedef enum { START, SIGN, DIGIT, ERROR, DONE } State;\n\nint main(void) {\n    const char *inputs[] = {\"123\", \"-45\", \"+0\", \"-\", \"12x\"};\n    for (int k = 0; k < 5; k++) {\n        State s = START;\n        for (const char *p = inputs[k]; *p && s != ERROR; p++) {\n            char c = *p;\n            switch (s) {\n                case START: s = (c == '+' || c == '-') ? SIGN : ((c >= '0' && c <= '9') ? DIGIT : ERROR); break;\n                case SIGN: s = (c >= '0' && c <= '9') ? DIGIT : ERROR; break;\n                case DIGIT: s = (c >= '0' && c <= '9') ? DIGIT : ERROR; break;\n                default: break;\n            }\n        }\n        int ok = (s == DIGIT) ? 1 : 0;\n        printf(\"%s -> %s\\n\", inputs[k], ok ? \"valid\" : \"invalid\");\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "123 -> valid\n-45 -> valid\n+0 -> valid\n- -> invalid\n12x -> invalid\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "漏判某一类输入会让状态机接受非法串。",
            "接受状态要明确：只有 DIGIT 结束才算合法。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "扩展状态机支持小数（允许一个小数点）。",
              "hint": "增加 DOT 状态，小数点只能出现一次。",
              "answer": "typedef enum { START, SIGN, DIGIT, DOT, ERROR, DONE } State;\n// DIGIT 遇到 '.' 转到 DOT，DOT 后必须是数字"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-097",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 097：接口设计——错误码与输出参数",
      "summary": "返回值报错误，结果从输出参数带出。",
      "concepts": [
        "错误码",
        "输出参数",
        "API 设计",
        "约定"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-097-lesson",
          "title": "C 097：接口设计——错误码与输出参数",
          "summary": "返回值报错误，结果从输出参数带出。",
          "concepts": [
            "错误码",
            "输出参数",
            "API 设计",
            "约定"
          ],
          "objective": "用统一错误码和输出参数设计函数接口。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 067"
          ],
          "explain": "一个稳健的 C 接口约定：函数返回错误码（0 成功，非 0 表示具体错误），真正的结果通过指针输出参数写回。这样调用方能区分「算出来的 0」和「出错了」。错误码用枚举集中定义，避免魔法数字。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\ntypedef enum { OK = 0, ERR_DIV_ZERO = 1, ERR_OVERFLOW = 2 } Err;\n\nErr safeDiv(int a, int b, int *out) {\n    if (b == 0) return ERR_DIV_ZERO;\n    *out = a / b;\n    return OK;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    int result = 0;\n    Err e = safeDiv(84, 2, &result);\n    printf(\"e=%d result=%d\\n\", e, result);\n    e = safeDiv(1, 0, &result);\n    printf(\"e=%d\\n\", e);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "e=0 result=42\ne=1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "出错时不要写输出参数，调用方要先看错误码再看结果。",
            "错误码用枚举命名，别用裸数字。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 safeDiv 增加溢出检查：a 为最小值且 b 为 -1 时返回 ERR_OVERFLOW。",
              "hint": "用 INT_MIN 判断。",
              "answer": "#include <limits.h>\nif (a == INT_MIN && b == -1) return ERR_OVERFLOW;"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-098",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 098：内存映射式解析",
      "summary": "不要用指针强转读未对齐数据。",
      "concepts": [
        "内存布局",
        "按字节访问",
        "类型双关",
        "memcpy"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-098-lesson",
          "title": "C 098：内存映射式解析",
          "summary": "不要用指针强转读未对齐数据。",
          "concepts": [
            "内存布局",
            "按字节访问",
            "类型双关",
            "memcpy"
          ],
          "objective": "安全地把字节缓冲区解释成整数。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 048"
          ],
          "explain": "从缓冲区里取出一个整数，直接 (int*)buf 强转可能在未对齐或严格别名下出错。稳妥做法是用 memcpy 把字节拷进一个对齐的整数变量。示例演示从字节数组按小端顺序拼出一个 32 位整数。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdint.h>\n#include <string.h>\n\nstatic uint32_t readLE(const unsigned char *p) {\n    uint32_t v = 0;\n    memcpy(&v, p, sizeof(v));\n    return v;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    unsigned char buf[4] = {0x78, 0x56, 0x34, 0x12};\n    uint32_t v = readLE(buf);\n    printf(\"value=0x%08X\\n\", v);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "value=0x12345678\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "指针强转读未对齐地址在部分平台会崩溃。",
            "字节序在不同机器上不同，跨平台要显式转换。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个把 16 位整数按小端写进缓冲区的函数。",
              "hint": "用 memcpy 把值写进 buf。",
              "answer": "void writeLE16(unsigned char *p, uint16_t v) { memcpy(p, &v, sizeof(v)); }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-099",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 099：综合练习——小型统计器",
      "summary": "跨多个中级知识点完成一个小工具。",
      "concepts": [
        "综合",
        "模块",
        "错误处理",
        "内存"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-099-lesson",
          "title": "C 099：综合练习——小型统计器",
          "summary": "跨多个中级知识点完成一个小工具。",
          "concepts": [
            "综合",
            "模块",
            "错误处理",
            "内存"
          ],
          "objective": "把句柄、动态数组、错误码组合成一个小型统计器。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 068",
            "C 097"
          ],
          "explain": "这个综合练习用一个句柄封装统计数据：add 往动态数组里追加数值，最后算平均、最大、最小。它把不透明指针、动态内存、错误码和遍历聚合串在一条链上，接近真实小工具的结构。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n\ntypedef struct Stats Stats;\nstruct Stats { double *data; int size; int capacity; };\n\nStats *statsCreate(int cap) {\n    Stats *s = (Stats *)malloc(sizeof(Stats));\n    s->data = (double *)malloc((size_t)cap * sizeof(double));\n    s->size = 0; s->capacity = cap;\n    return s;\n}\nvoid statsAdd(Stats *s, double v) {\n    if (s->size == s->capacity) {\n        s->capacity *= 2;\n        s->data = (double *)realloc(s->data, (size_t)s->capacity * sizeof(double));\n    }\n    s->data[s->size++] = v;\n}\ndouble statsMean(Stats *s) {\n    double sum = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < s->size; i++) sum += s->data[i];\n    return sum / s->size;\n}\ndouble statsMax(Stats *s) {\n    double m = s->data[0];\n    for (int i = 1; i < s->size; i++) if (s->data[i] > m) m = s->data[i];\n    return m;\n}\nvoid statsDestroy(Stats *s) { free(s->data); free(s); }\n\nint main(void) {\n    Stats *s = statsCreate(2);\n    double values[] = {12.0, 7.5, 9.0, 15.0, 4.5};\n    for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) statsAdd(s, values[i]);\n    printf(\"mean=%.2f\\n\", statsMean(s));\n    printf(\"max=%.1f\\n\", statsMax(s));\n    statsDestroy(s);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "mean=9.60\nmax=15.0\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "扩容后必须使用 realloc 返回的新指针。",
            "句柄内部的 data 也要在 destroy 里释放。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给统计器加一个 statsMin 函数。",
              "hint": "仿照 statsMax，比较改成 <。",
              "answer": "double statsMin(Stats *s) { double m = s->data[0]; for (int i = 1; i < s->size; i++) if (s->data[i] < m) m = s->data[i]; return m; }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-tutorial-100",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "C 100：结业项目——词频统计器",
      "summary": "把整门课的知识拼成一个可用的小工具。",
      "concepts": [
        "综合项目",
        "哈希表",
        "字符串",
        "排序"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c-tutorial-100-lesson",
          "title": "C 100：结业项目——词频统计器",
          "summary": "把整门课的知识拼成一个可用的小工具。",
          "concepts": [
            "综合项目",
            "哈希表",
            "字符串",
            "排序"
          ],
          "objective": "综合运用哈希、字符串与排序统计词频。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "C 090",
            "C 062"
          ],
          "explain": "结业项目把前面学的拼起来：按空白切分文本得到单词，用哈希表统计每个词出现次数，再按次数排序输出。示例硬编码一段文本以保证可重复运行，真实场景会从文件读入。这正是「学完能写出来的东西」。",
          "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <string.h>\n\ntypedef struct { char word[16]; int count; } WordCount;\n\nint main(void) {\n    const char *text = \"the cat the dog the bird cat\";\n    WordCount counts[16];\n    int n = 0;\n    char buf[16];\n    int bi = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; ; i++) {\n        char c = text[i];\n        if (c == ' ' || c == '\\0') {\n            buf[bi] = '\\0';\n            if (bi > 0) {\n                int found = -1;\n                for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) if (strcmp(counts[j].word, buf) == 0) found = j;\n                if (found < 0) { strcpy(counts[n].word, buf); counts[n].count = 1; n++; }\n                else counts[found].count++;\n            }\n            bi = 0;\n            if (c == '\\0') break;\n        } else if (bi < 15) {\n            buf[bi++] = c;\n        }\n    }\n    for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i++)\n        for (int j = 0; j < n - 1 - i; j++)\n            if (counts[j].count < counts[j + 1].count) {\n                WordCount t = counts[j]; counts[j] = counts[j + 1]; counts[j + 1] = t;\n            }\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) printf(\"%s=%d\\n\", counts[i].word, counts[i].count);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "the=3\ncat=2\ndog=1\nbird=1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "单词缓冲区要防溢出，bi 不能超过容量。",
            "排序按次数降序，相等次数的相对顺序取决于排序是否稳定。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "修改程序，只在次数 >= 2 时打印。",
              "hint": "打印前加 if (counts[i].count >= 2)。",
              "answer": "for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) if (counts[i].count >= 2) printf(\"%s=%d\\n\", counts[i].word, counts[i].count);"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
