      "id": "cpp-tutorial-004",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "标准输入：std::cin 读取数据",
      "summary": "用 >> 从标准输入读取整数，理解空白分隔与输入失败。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::cin",
        "operator>>",
        "空白分隔",
        "输入失败"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-004-lesson",
          "title": "标准输入：std::cin 读取数据",
          "summary": "用 >> 从标准输入读取整数，理解空白分隔与输入失败。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::cin",
            "operator>>",
            "空白分隔",
            "输入失败"
          ],
          "objective": "从标准输入读取多个值并计算，理解 >> 会自动跳过空白。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "第一个 C++ 程序"
          ],
          "explain": "std::cin 是标准输入流，>> 是流提取运算符，按目标类型解析输入并自动跳过前导空白。cin >> a >> b; 可以连续读取。读取失败（格式不符或到末尾）会使流进入失败状态，可用 if (cin >> x) 判断。本课程用项目根目录的 input.txt 作为标准输入。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nint main() {\n    int a = 0, b = 0;\n    if (std::cin >> a >> b) {\n        std::cout << a << \" + \" << b << \" = \" << a + b << \"\\n\";\n    } else {\n        std::cout << \"读取失败\\n\";\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "7 + 35 = 42\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "忘记判断读取是否成功，失败时会用旧值继续算。",
            "cin >> string 遇到空白就停，读整行要用 getline。",
            "方向易混：输入流用 >>。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把输入改成两个数，让程序输出它们的乘积。",
              "hint": "把 a + b 改成 a * b。",
              "answer": "改表达式为 a * b，输入 7 35 时输出 245。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-005",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "std::string 基础",
      "summary": "用 std::string 保存文本，进行拼接、取长度和下标访问。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::string",
        "size()",
        "operator+",
        "operator[]"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-005-lesson",
          "title": "std::string 基础",
          "summary": "用 std::string 保存文本，进行拼接、取长度和下标访问。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::string",
            "size()",
            "operator+",
            "operator[]"
          ],
          "objective": "创建并操作 std::string，完成拼接、长度与字符访问。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "变量与引用"
          ],
          "explain": "std::string 是标准库的字符串类型，自动管理内存，不必像 C 的 char[] 那样关心长度。size() 返回字符个数，+ 拼接，+= 追加，[] 按下标访问（不检查越界），at() 会检查并抛异常。它是本课程推荐的文本类型，替代裸 char 数组。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\nint main() {\n    std::string first = \"Hello\";\n    std::string second = \"World\";\n    std::string greeting = first + \", \" + second + \"!\";\n    std::cout << greeting << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"长度 \" << greeting.size() << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"首字符 \" << greeting[0] << \"\\n\";\n    greeting += \" 再见\";\n    std::cout << greeting << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "Hello, World!\n长度 13\n首字符 H\nHello, World! 再见\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "size() 返回无符号类型，与 int 比较时可能触发符号警告。",
            "[] 越界是未定义行为，需要检查时用 at()。",
            "\"a\" + \"b\" 是两个 const char*，不能相加；至少一边是 std::string。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 greeting.front() 和 greeting.back() 打印首尾字符。",
              "hint": "front()/back() 是 C++11 起的便捷成员。",
              "answer": "std::cout << greeting.front() << greeting.back();"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-006",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "std::vector：动态数组",
      "summary": "用 std::vector 保存数量可变的元素，完成增删与遍历。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::vector",
        "push_back",
        "size()",
        "下标"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-006-lesson",
          "title": "std::vector：动态数组",
          "summary": "用 std::vector 保存数量可变的元素，完成增删与遍历。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::vector",
            "push_back",
            "size()",
            "下标"
          ],
          "objective": "创建 vector、追加元素、按下标与遍历读取。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "auto 与类型推导"
          ],
          "explain": "std::vector 是会自动扩容的动态数组，是最常用的容器。push_back 在末尾追加，size() 返回元素个数，[] 随机访问，pop_back 删除末尾。它连续存储元素，因此也能与 C 风格接口对接。大括号初始化 {1, 2, 3} 直接给出初始元素。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<int> nums = {10, 20, 30};\n    nums.push_back(40);\n    std::cout << \"size=\" << nums.size() << \"\\n\";\n    int sum = 0;\n    for (std::size_t i = 0; i < nums.size(); ++i) sum += nums[i];\n    std::cout << \"sum=\" << sum << \"\\n\";\n    nums.pop_back();\n    std::cout << \"last=\" << nums.back() << \" size=\" << nums.size() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "size=4\nsum=100\nlast=30 size=3\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "扩容后原有元素的迭代器/引用可能失效。",
            "vector 下标不检查越界；需要检查用 at()。",
            "vector<bool> 是位压缩的特化，取地址行为与普通 vector 不同。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "在末尾再追加一个 50，打印新的 sum。",
              "hint": "push_back(50) 后重新求和。",
              "answer": "追加 50 后 sum=150。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-007",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "range-for：范围循环",
      "summary": "用 for (auto x : container) 遍历容器，避免手写下标。",
      "concepts": [
        "range-for",
        "auto&",
        "const auto&",
        "遍历"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-007-lesson",
          "title": "range-for：范围循环",
          "summary": "用 for (auto x : container) 遍历容器，避免手写下标。",
          "concepts": [
            "range-for",
            "auto&",
            "const auto&",
            "遍历"
          ],
          "objective": "用范围循环遍历 vector，并区分按值、按引用遍历。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::vector：动态数组"
          ],
          "explain": "for (auto x : v) 把每个元素拷贝到 x；for (auto& x : v) 直接引用元素，修改 x 会改到容器；for (const auto& x : v) 只读且不拷贝，是遍历大对象的最佳实践。范围循环可读性远高于手写下标，且不会越界。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<int> v = {1, 2, 3, 4};\n    for (int x : v) std::cout << x << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    for (int& x : v) x *= 10;\n    for (const auto& x : v) std::cout << x << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1 2 3 4 \n10 20 30 40 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "for (auto x : v) 想修改元素却写成了拷贝，改动不生效。",
            "遍历时修改容器大小（push_back/erase）会使迭代器失效。",
            "遍历字符串得到的是 char，不是 string。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用范围循环统计 v 中偶数的个数。",
              "hint": "for (const auto& x : v) if (x % 2 == 0) ++count;",
              "answer": "遍历累加偶数计数，10/20/30/40 中全是偶数，结果为 4。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
