      "id": "cpp-tutorial-008",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "函数与重载",
      "summary": "定义函数并利用重载让同名函数按参数类型/个数提供服务。",
      "concepts": [
        "函数",
        "重载",
        "参数",
        "返回值"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-008-lesson",
          "title": "函数与重载",
          "summary": "定义函数并利用重载让同名函数按参数类型/个数提供服务。",
          "concepts": [
            "函数",
            "重载",
            "参数",
            "返回值"
          ],
          "objective": "编写同名不同参数列表的函数并在调用时正确解析。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "变量与引用"
          ],
          "explain": "C++ 允许同名函数因为参数列表不同而共存，这叫重载。编译器按实参的类型和个数选择最匹配的那个。重载只能靠参数列表区分，不能只靠返回值类型。函数在使用前必须有声明或定义。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nint add(int a, int b) { return a + b; }\ndouble add(double a, double b) { return a + b; }\nint add(int a, int b, int c) { return a + b + c; }\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << add(2, 3) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << add(2.5, 3.5) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << add(1, 2, 3) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "5\n6\n6\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "只改返回值类型不能构成重载。",
            "add(2, 3.5) 会触发歧义或意外转换，注意实参类型。",
            "重载解析在存在隐式转换时可能出乎意料。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "再加一个重载 add(std::string, std::string) 拼接字符串。",
              "hint": "包含 <string>，返回 a + b。",
              "answer": "std::string add(std::string a, std::string b){return a+b;}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-009",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "默认参数",
      "summary": "给函数参数提供默认值，使调用者可以省略尾部的实参。",
      "concepts": [
        "默认参数",
        "声明与定义",
        "调用省略"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-009-lesson",
          "title": "默认参数",
          "summary": "给函数参数提供默认值，使调用者可以省略尾部的实参。",
          "concepts": [
            "默认参数",
            "声明与定义",
            "调用省略"
          ],
          "objective": "为函数定义默认参数并在调用时省略尾参。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "函数与重载"
          ],
          "explain": "函数的参数可以在声明处给默认值，调用时省略的实参取默认值。默认参数必须从右往左连续给出，不能中间空一个。默认值通常只在声明处写一次，同时写声明和定义要避免重复指定。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\nstd::string greet(const std::string& name,\n                  const std::string& prefix = \"你好\",\n                  const std::string& suffix = \"！\") {\n    return prefix + \"，\" + name + suffix;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << greet(\"小明\") << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << greet(\"小红\", \"早上好\") << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << greet(\"小刚\", \"嗨\", \"~\") << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "你好，小明！\n早上好，小红！\n嗨，小刚~\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "默认参数必须靠右连续，不能 greet(string a = \"x\", string b)。",
            "声明和定义同时写默认值会编译报错。",
            "默认参数与重载混用可能产生歧义调用。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把 suffix 的默认值换成 \"。\" 并只调用一次。",
              "hint": "改默认值即可。",
              "answer": "把 suffix 默认值改为 \"。\"，greet(\"小明\") 输出「你好，小明。」。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-010",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "命名空间",
      "summary": "用 namespace 分组名字，避免命名冲突并选择性使用 using。",
      "concepts": [
        "namespace",
        "作用域",
        "using 声明",
        "嵌套命名空间"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-010-lesson",
          "title": "命名空间",
          "summary": "用 namespace 分组名字，避免命名冲突并选择性使用 using。",
          "concepts": [
            "namespace",
            "作用域",
            "using 声明",
            "嵌套命名空间"
          ],
          "objective": "定义命名空间并用限定名和 using 访问其中的成员。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "函数与重载"
          ],
          "explain": "命名空间把相关的名字包在一起，用 :: 限定访问。标准库都在 std 里，所以写 std::cout。可以定义自己的命名空间来避免冲突。using ns::name; 只引入一个名字，比 using namespace ns; 更安全。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nnamespace math {\n    int square(int x) { return x * x; }\n    namespace detail {\n        int twice(int x) { return x * 2; }\n    }\n}\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << math::square(5) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << math::detail::twice(5) << \"\\n\";\n    using math::square;\n    std::cout << square(6) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "25\n10\n36\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "在头文件里写 using namespace std; 会污染所有包含者。",
            "命名空间里只声明不定义时，定义处也要用同样的限定名。",
            "匿名命名空间有内部链接，作用类似 static。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "在 math 里再加一个 cube 函数并调用。",
              "hint": "int cube(int x){return x*x*x;}",
              "answer": "math::cube(3) 输出 27。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-011",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "const 与 constexpr",
      "summary": "用 const 表达只读，用 constexpr 在编译期求值。",
      "concepts": [
        "const",
        "constexpr",
        "编译期常量",
        "只读"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-011-lesson",
          "title": "const 与 constexpr",
          "summary": "用 const 表达只读，用 constexpr 在编译期求值。",
          "concepts": [
            "const",
            "constexpr",
            "编译期常量",
            "只读"
          ],
          "objective": "区分 const 运行时常量与 constexpr 编译期常量。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "变量与引用"
          ],
          "explain": "const 表示对象初始化后不可修改，可以来自运行期变量。constexpr 要求表达式能在编译期求值，适合做数组大小、模板参数。凡是编译期就能定的常量优先用 constexpr，让编译器帮你算并优化。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nconstexpr int square(int x) { return x * x; }\n\nint main() {\n    const int runtimeValue = 6;\n    constexpr int compileValue = square(5);\n    int arr[square(3)] = {0};\n    std::cout << runtimeValue << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << compileValue << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << sizeof(arr) / sizeof(arr[0]) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "6\n25\n9\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "constexpr 函数在 C++11 里限制很多；C++14 起才宽松。",
            "const 对象不能用非 const 成员函数。",
            "把运行期才知道的值赋给 constexpr 会编译失败。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "加一个 constexpr int cube(int) 并用它作为数组长度。",
              "hint": "cube(2)=8，可作为 int arr[cube(2)]。",
              "answer": "int arr[cube(2)] 长度 8。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-012",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "条件与 switch",
      "summary": "用 if/else 链和 switch 做分支，理解 break 与 fallthrough。",
      "concepts": [
        "if",
        "else if",
        "switch",
        "break",
        "fallthrough"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-012-lesson",
          "title": "条件与 switch",
          "summary": "用 if/else 链和 switch 做分支，理解 break 与 fallthrough。",
          "concepts": [
            "if",
            "else if",
            "switch",
            "break",
            "fallthrough"
          ],
          "objective": "用 if/else 与 switch 实现多分支选择。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "变量与引用"
          ],
          "explain": "if/else if/else 从上到下短路匹配，条件为真的分支执行后其余跳过。switch 基于整数/枚举值跳转，每个 case 后要 break，否则会“穿透”执行下一个 case（有时这是有意为之）。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nint main() {\n    for (int grade = 0; grade < 5; ++grade) {\n        switch (grade) {\n            case 0: std::cout << \"zero \"; break;\n            case 1:\n            case 2: std::cout << \"small \"; break;\n            case 3: std::cout << \"medium \"; break;\n            default: std::cout << \"large \";\n        }\n    }\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "zero small small medium large \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "漏写 break 导致意外穿透。",
            "switch 的表达式必须是整型或枚举，不能是浮点/字符串。",
            "case 标签必须是编译期常量。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "故意去掉 case 3 的 break，观察输出变化。",
              "hint": "fallthrough 会继续执行 default。",
              "answer": "grade=3 时会输出 \"medium large\"，因为穿透到了 default。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-013",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "三种循环与 break/continue",
      "summary": "用 for、while、do-while 表达不同循环意图，并控制跳出与跳过。",
      "concepts": [
        "for",
        "while",
        "do-while",
        "break",
        "continue"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-013-lesson",
          "title": "三种循环与 break/continue",
          "summary": "用 for、while、do-while 表达不同循环意图，并控制跳出与跳过。",
          "concepts": [
            "for",
            "while",
            "do-while",
            "break",
            "continue"
          ],
          "objective": "根据是否已知次数、是否至少执行一次选择循环形式。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "条件与 switch"
          ],
          "explain": "for 适合次数已知，while 适合条件驱动，do-while 保证循环体至少执行一次。break 立即跳出整个循环，continue 跳过本次剩余部分进入下一轮。选择最贴合意图的循环形式，比一律用 for 更易读。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nint main() {\n    int sum = 0;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= 10; ++i) sum += i;\n    std::cout << \"sum=\" << sum << \"\\n\";\n\n    int n = 3;\n    while (n > 0) { std::cout << n << \" \"; --n; }\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n\n    int k = 0;\n    do { std::cout << k << \" \"; ++k; } while (k < 3);\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < 10; ++i) {\n        if (i == 5) break;\n        if (i % 2 == 0) continue;\n        std::cout << i << \" \";\n    }\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "sum=55\n3 2 1 \n0 1 2 \n1 3 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "do-while 结尾要有分号。",
            "while 条件里改动循环变量时容易写成死循环。",
            "break 只跳出最内层循环，多层要用标志或 goto。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 for 打印 1..20 中所有 3 的倍数。",
              "hint": "for (int i=3;i<=20;i+=3)",
              "answer": "输出 3 6 9 12 15 18。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-014",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "结构化绑定",
      "summary": "用 auto [a, b] = pair/tuple 一次解包多个值。",
      "concepts": [
        "结构化绑定",
        "std::pair",
        "std::tuple",
        "auto"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-014-lesson",
          "title": "结构化绑定",
          "summary": "用 auto [a, b] = pair/tuple 一次解包多个值。",
          "concepts": [
            "结构化绑定",
            "std::pair",
            "std::tuple",
            "auto"
          ],
          "objective": "用结构化绑定解包 pair 和 tuple，提升可读性。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "auto 与类型推导"
          ],
          "explain": "C++17 的结构化绑定让 auto [x, y] = 一个 pair/tuple 解包各元素到具名变量。它常用于遍历 map（auto& [key, value]）和返回多个值的函数。加 & 或 const& 可避免拷贝。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <tuple>\n\nstd::pair<std::string, int> makeRecord() {\n    return {\"apples\", 3};\n}\n\nint main() {\n    auto [name, count] = makeRecord();\n    std::cout << name << \"=\" << count << \"\\n\";\n\n    std::tuple<int, double, char> t = {1, 2.5, 'z'};\n    auto [a, b, c] = t;\n    std::cout << a << \" \" << b << \" \" << c << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "apples=3\n1 2.5 z\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "不加引用会拷贝，pair<string,string> 时开销明显。",
            "结构化绑定不能单独指定某个变量的类型。",
            "绑定后变量名是新的，不引用原对象的字段名。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个返回 pair<int,int> 的函数，用结构化绑定打印两者之和。",
              "hint": "auto [x, y] = f(); std::cout << x + y;",
              "answer": "返回 {3,4} 时输出 7。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-015",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "std::array：固定大小数组",
      "summary": "用 std::array 获得带 size() 与边界安全的定长数组。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::array",
        "size()",
        "at()",
        "定长容器"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-015-lesson",
          "title": "std::array：固定大小数组",
          "summary": "用 std::array 获得带 size() 与边界安全的定长数组。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::array",
            "size()",
            "at()",
            "定长容器"
          ],
          "objective": "用 std::array 替代 C 风格数组，获取大小和边界检查。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::vector：动态数组"
          ],
          "explain": "std::array<T, N> 是零开销封装的定长数组，大小是类型的一部分。它有 size()、at()（带边界检查）、front()/back()，也能用于范围循环。相比裸数组不会退化成指针，传参时保留大小信息。",
          "code": "#include <array>\n#include <iostream>\n\nint main() {\n    std::array<int, 5> a = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};\n    std::cout << \"size=\" << a.size() << \"\\n\";\n    int sum = 0;\n    for (int x : a) sum += x;\n    std::cout << \"sum=\" << sum << \"\\n\";\n    a[0] = 100;\n    std::cout << \"front=\" << a.front() << \" back=\" << a.back() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "size=5\nsum=15\nfront=100 back=5\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "std::array 不能像 vector 那样 push_back，大小固定。",
            "at() 越界会抛 std::out_of_range；[] 越界未定义。",
            "传参按引用传，避免拷贝整个数组。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把 a 排序后打印。",
              "hint": "#include <algorithm>，std::sort(a.begin(), a.end())。",
              "answer": "排序后 front=2，输出升序 2 3 4 5 100。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-016",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "std::pair 与 std::tuple",
      "summary": "用 pair/tuple 组合异构数据，用 get<> 访问元素。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::pair",
        "std::tuple",
        "std::get",
        "组合类型"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-016-lesson",
          "title": "std::pair 与 std::tuple",
          "summary": "用 pair/tuple 组合异构数据，用 get<> 访问元素。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::pair",
            "std::tuple",
            "std::get",
            "组合类型"
          ],
          "objective": "用 pair 和 tuple 保存并访问多个不同类型的值。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "结构化绑定"
          ],
          "explain": "std::pair<A,B> 保存两个值，用 .first/.second 访问；std::tuple<...> 保存任意多个值，用 std::get<i>(t) 访问。它们是轻量组合类型，常用于返回多个结果。结构化绑定让访问更可读。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <tuple>\n\nint main() {\n    std::pair<std::string, int> p = {\"age\", 18};\n    std::cout << p.first << \"=\" << p.second << \"\\n\";\n\n    std::tuple<int, std::string, double> t{1, \"pi\", 3.14};\n    std::cout << std::get<0>(t) << \" \" << std::get<1>(t) << \" \"\n              << std::get<2>(t) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"tuple size=\" << std::tuple_size<decltype(t)>::value << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "age=18\n1 pi 3.14\ntuple size=3\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "tuple 的 get 下标必须是编译期常量。",
            "pair 字段名固定为 first/second，语义靠约定。",
            "比较 pair/tuple 是逐元素字典序，注意顺序影响结果。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 std::get<1> 修改 tuple 中的字符串，再打印。",
              "hint": "get<1>(t) = \"e\";",
              "answer": "修改后 get<1>(t) 为 \"e\"。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-017",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "enum class：强类型枚举",
      "summary": "用 enum class 定义自带作用域、不隐式转换的枚举。",
      "concepts": [
        "enum class",
        "作用域",
        "底层类型",
        "类型安全"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-017-lesson",
          "title": "enum class：强类型枚举",
          "summary": "用 enum class 定义自带作用域、不隐式转换的枚举。",
          "concepts": [
            "enum class",
            "作用域",
            "底层类型",
            "类型安全"
          ],
          "objective": "定义 enum class 并通过限定名使用，理解其类型安全优势。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "命名空间"
          ],
          "explain": "enum class 的枚举值属于该枚举的作用域，必须写 Color::Red，不会隐式转换成 int，也不会与别的枚举冲突。这是相对 C 风格 enum 的主要优势。可以指定底层类型 enum class E : unsigned char，用于节省空间或对齐。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nenum class Color { Red, Green = 5, Blue };\n\nconst char* name(Color c) {\n    switch (c) {\n        case Color::Red: return \"red\";\n        case Color::Green: return \"green\";\n        case Color::Blue: return \"blue\";\n    }\n    return \"unknown\";\n}\n\nint main() {\n    Color c = Color::Blue;\n    std::cout << name(c) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << static_cast<int>(Color::Green) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "blue\n5\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "enum class 不能隐式转 int，要显式 static_cast。",
            "switch 覆盖所有枚举值时仍建议加 default 以防新增值。",
            "枚举值默认从 0 递增，显式赋值后可跳号。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给枚举加一个 Yellow 并让 name 支持它。",
              "hint": "在 switch 里添加 case Color::Yellow。",
              "answer": "添加 case 后 name(Color::Yellow) 返回 \"yellow\"。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-018",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "异常入门：throw/try/catch",
      "summary": "用异常把错误从发生点传播到处理点，替代返回码。",
      "concepts": [
        "throw",
        "try",
        "catch",
        "异常传播"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-018-lesson",
          "title": "异常入门：throw/try/catch",
          "summary": "用异常把错误从发生点传播到处理点，替代返回码。",
          "concepts": [
            "throw",
            "try",
            "catch",
            "异常传播"
          ],
          "objective": "抛出并捕获标准异常，理解异常相较返回码的传播方式。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "函数与重载"
          ],
          "explain": "异常把错误与正常流程分离：throw 抛出，沿调用栈向上传播，最近的匹配 catch 处理。标准库有 std::invalid_argument、std::out_of_range、std::runtime_error 等。catch (const std::exception& e) 可捕获任何标准异常。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <stdexcept>\n\ndouble safeDiv(double a, double b) {\n    if (b == 0) throw std::invalid_argument(\"除数不能为零\");\n    return a / b;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    try {\n        std::cout << safeDiv(10, 2) << \"\\n\";\n        std::cout << safeDiv(1, 0) << \"\\n\";\n    } catch (const std::exception& e) {\n        std::cout << \"捕获异常: \" << e.what() << \"\\n\";\n    }\n    std::cout << \"程序继续\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "5\n捕获异常: 除数不能为零\n程序继续\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "catch 顺序：派生类异常要写在基类前面。",
            "按引用捕获（catch const&），按值会切片。",
            "异常不是控制流，别用它做常规分支。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "在 catch 里再调用一次 safeDiv(4, 2) 打印结果。",
              "hint": "异常处理后可以继续正常调用。",
              "answer": "输出 2。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-019",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "多种异常与自定义异常",
      "summary": "用多个 catch 分支区分异常类型，并从 std::exception 派生自定义异常。",
      "concepts": [
        "多 catch",
        "what()",
        "自定义异常",
        "继承 std::exception"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-019-lesson",
          "title": "多种异常与自定义异常",
          "summary": "用多个 catch 分支区分异常类型，并从 std::exception 派生自定义异常。",
          "concepts": [
            "多 catch",
            "what()",
            "自定义异常",
            "继承 std::exception"
          ],
          "objective": "捕获不同类型异常并实现自己的异常类。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "异常入门：throw/try/catch"
          ],
          "explain": "一个 try 可跟多个 catch，按声明顺序匹配，规则是类型兼容（含基类）。自定义异常通常继承 std::runtime_error 并传消息，就能被 catch (const std::exception&) 捕获。捕获基类引用可以统一处理所有标准异常。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <stdexcept>\n#include <string>\n\nclass BalanceError : public std::runtime_error {\npublic:\n    explicit BalanceError(const std::string& msg) : std::runtime_error(msg) {}\n};\n\nvoid withdraw(int balance, int amount) {\n    if (amount > balance) throw BalanceError(\"余额不足\");\n    std::cout << \"取款成功 \" << amount << \"\\n\";\n}\n\nint main() {\n    try {\n        withdraw(100, 30);\n        withdraw(100, 200);\n    } catch (const std::invalid_argument& e) {\n        std::cout << \"参数错误: \" << e.what() << \"\\n\";\n    } catch (const std::exception& e) {\n        std::cout << \"业务错误: \" << e.what() << \"\\n\";\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "取款成功 30\n业务错误: 余额不足\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "自定义异常构造函数要传消息给基类。",
            "catch 顺序：更具体的类型写前面。",
            "不要 throw 裸指针，抛出对象或标准异常。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "再加一个 catch (const BalanceError&) 放在最前面，验证匹配。",
              "hint": "更具体的类型会被优先匹配。",
              "answer": "BalanceError 分支会先命中，输出自定义消息。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-020",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "头文件、inline 与编译链接",
      "summary": "把声明放进头文件、定义放进源文件，理解 inline 与 ODR。",
      "concepts": [
        "头文件",
        "inline",
        "ODR",
        "编译与链接"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-020-lesson",
          "title": "头文件、inline 与编译链接",
          "summary": "把声明放进头文件、定义放进源文件，理解 inline 与 ODR。",
          "concepts": [
            "头文件",
            "inline",
            "ODR",
            "编译与链接"
          ],
          "objective": "组织多文件 C++ 程序的思路，理解声明/定义分离。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "命名空间"
          ],
          "explain": "头文件放声明（函数原型、类定义、inline 函数、模板），源文件放定义。同一函数在多个翻译单元里定义会违反 ODR（单一定义规则）。inline 允许在头文件里定义函数而不违反 ODR。真实工程会拆成 utils.h + utils.cpp + main.cpp；内容模式要求示例单文件自包含，因此这里把三部分放在一个文件里说明结构。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\n// 相当于头文件里定义的 inline 函数\ninline int twice(int x) { return x * 2; }\ninline int thrice(int x) { return x * 3; }\n\n// 只声明，定义在后面（对应 .h 声明 + .cpp 定义）\nint combine(int a, int b);\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << combine(twice(5), thrice(5)) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n\nint combine(int a, int b) { return a + b; }\n",
          "output": "25\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "在头文件里定义非 inline 的普通函数，被多个 .cpp 包含会重复定义。",
            "头文件缺少 include guard 或 #pragma once 会重复展开。",
            "模板和 constexpr 函数默认可以放在头文件里。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把 combine 也改成 inline 并思考是否需要。",
              "hint": "单文件里 inline 影响不大，多翻译单元才关键。",
              "answer": "改成 inline 仍编译通过并输出 25；多文件时能避免重复定义。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
