      "id": "cpp-tutorial-021",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "cin 读字符串与 getline",
      "summary": "区分 >> 遇空白停止与 getline 读整行的行为。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::getline",
        "operator>>",
        "整行输入",
        "混合读取"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-021-lesson",
          "title": "cin 读字符串与 getline",
          "summary": "区分 >> 遇空白停止与 getline 读整行的行为。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::getline",
            "operator>>",
            "整行输入",
            "混合读取"
          ],
          "objective": "用 getline 读取含空格的整行，并处理与 >> 混用的残留换行。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "标准输入：std::cin 读取数据"
          ],
          "explain": "cin >> 以空白为分隔符，读不到空格；getline(cin, line) 读到换行为止，保留空格。两者混用时要小心：>> 读完后输入流里可能残留换行，导致随后的 getline 立刻返回空串，常用 cin.ignore() 清掉。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\nint main() {\n    std::string name;\n    int age = 0;\n    std::cin >> name >> age;\n    std::cin.ignore();  // 清掉行尾换行\n    std::string line;\n    std::getline(std::cin, line);\n    std::cout << name << \" (\" << age << \")\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"line: \" << line << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "Alice (25)\nline: Hello World\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            ">> 后直接 getline 会读到空行，需要先 ignore()。",
            "getline 读到文件末尾时返回的流为假，循环读取要判断。",
            "输入文件末尾没有换行时，最后一行也能被 getline 读出。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "去掉 cin.ignore() 运行，观察 line 输出变化。",
              "hint": "残留的换行会被 getline 立刻消费。",
              "answer": "line 变为空串，输出 \"line: \"。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
