      "id": "cpp-tutorial-022",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "文件流入门",
      "summary": "用 std::ifstream/ofstream 读写文本文件。",
      "concepts": [
        "ifstream",
        "ofstream",
        "文件读写",
        "RAII 关闭"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-022-lesson",
          "title": "文件流入门",
          "summary": "用 std::ifstream/ofstream 读写文本文件。",
          "concepts": [
            "ifstream",
            "ofstream",
            "文件读写",
            "RAII 关闭"
          ],
          "objective": "打开文件读取内容并写入另一个文件。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "cin 读字符串与 getline"
          ],
          "explain": "<fstream> 提供 ifstream（读）、ofstream（写）、fstream（读写）。文件流是 RAII 对象：离开作用域自动关闭。打开后要检查 is_open() 或直接用 if (file)。getline(file, line) 逐行读取。",
          "code": "#include <fstream>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\nint main() {\n    const char* path = \"sample.txt\";\n    {\n        std::ofstream out(path);\n        out << \"第一行\\n第二行\\n\";\n    }\n    std::ifstream in(path);\n    std::string line;\n    int count = 0;\n    while (std::getline(in, line)) {\n        ++count;\n        std::cout << count << \": \" << line << \"\\n\";\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1: 第一行\n2: 第二行\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "忘记检查文件是否成功打开就读取，会静默失败。",
            "文件流的析构会关闭文件；手动 close 后仍可再次 open。",
            "不同平台换行表示不同，跨平台读文本用文本模式。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把写入的内容改成三行，观察 count 变为 3。",
              "hint": "多加一条 out << \"...\\n\"。",
              "answer": "count 变为 3，逐行打印三行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
