      "id": "cpp-tutorial-023",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "std::optional 入门",
      "summary": "用 std::optional 表达“可能有值”，避免哨兵值和空指针。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::optional",
        "has_value",
        "value_or",
        "空值表示"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-023-lesson",
          "title": "std::optional 入门",
          "summary": "用 std::optional 表达“可能有值”，避免哨兵值和空指针。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::optional",
            "has_value",
            "value_or",
            "空值表示"
          ],
          "objective": "用 optional 返回可能缺失的结果并安全取值。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "异常入门：throw/try/catch"
          ],
          "explain": "std::optional<T> 要么持有 T，要么为空。它比用 -1 或 nullptr 表达“无值”更清晰、类型安全。has_value() 判断，value() 取值（空时抛 bad_optional_access），value_or(default) 给默认值，*opt 解引用。适合解析、查找这类可能失败的函数。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <optional>\n#include <string>\n\nstd::optional<int> parseInt(const std::string& s) {\n    try {\n        return std::stoi(s);\n    } catch (...) {\n        return std::nullopt;\n    }\n}\n\nint main() {\n    auto a = parseInt(\"42\");\n    auto b = parseInt(\"abc\");\n    std::cout << (a.has_value() ? std::to_string(*a) : \"none\") << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << (b.has_value() ? std::to_string(*b) : \"none\") << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << b.value_or(-1) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "42\nnone\n-1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "对空的 optional 调 value() 会抛异常，用 value_or 或先判断。",
            "optional<optional<T>> 嵌套一般没必要。",
            "optional 有额外一个 bool 的开销，别在热路径滥用。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 optional 写一个函数返回字符串长度，空串返回 nullopt。",
              "hint": "if (s.empty()) return std::nullopt;",
              "answer": "空串返回 nullopt，非空返回长度。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
