      "id": "cpp-tutorial-024",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "std::string_view 入门",
      "summary": "用 string_view 以零拷贝方式引用字符串片段。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::string_view",
        "零拷贝",
        "只读视图",
        "生命周期"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-024-lesson",
          "title": "std::string_view 入门",
          "summary": "用 string_view 以零拷贝方式引用字符串片段。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::string_view",
            "零拷贝",
            "只读视图",
            "生命周期"
          ],
          "objective": "用 string_view 做只读字符串参数，避免拷贝与临时 string。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::string 基础"
          ],
          "explain": "std::string_view 是对已有字符序列的只读视图，持有指针和长度，不拥有数据、不拷贝。它适合函数参数（可同时接受 string 和字面量）。关键约束：它不延长底层数据的生命周期，不能返回指向局部 string 的 view。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <string_view>\n\nstd::size_t countVowels(std::string_view s) {\n    std::size_t n = 0;\n    for (char c : s) {\n        if (c == 'a' || c == 'e' || c == 'i' || c == 'o' || c == 'u')\n            ++n;\n    }\n    return n;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    std::string word = \"hello\";\n    std::cout << countVowels(word) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << countVowels(\"beautiful\") << \"\\n\";\n    std::string_view sv = word;\n    sv.remove_prefix(1);\n    std::cout << sv << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "2\n5\nello\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "view 不拥有数据，底层 string 销毁后 view 悬空。",
            "string_view 不含结尾 \\0，传给 C 接口要小心。",
            "不要返回指向局部 std::string 的 string_view。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 sv.substr(0, 3) 打印前三个字符。",
              "hint": "substr 返回子 view。",
              "answer": "对 \"hello\" 输出 \"hel\"。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
