      "id": "cpp-tutorial-025",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "算法入门：sort/find/count",
      "summary": "用 <algorithm> 的 std::sort、std::find、std::count 处理序列。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::sort",
        "std::find",
        "std::count",
        "迭代器范围"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-025-lesson",
          "title": "算法入门：sort/find/count",
          "summary": "用 <algorithm> 的 std::sort、std::find、std::count 处理序列。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::sort",
            "std::find",
            "std::count",
            "迭代器范围"
          ],
          "objective": "对容器调用标准算法，理解 [begin, end) 范围约定。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::vector：动态数组"
          ],
          "explain": "<algorithm> 提供大量作用于迭代器区间的算法，约定是左闭右开 [first, last)。std::sort 排序，std::find 查找返回迭代器，std::count 统计出现次数。它们与容器解耦，vector、array、甚至裸数组都能用。",
          "code": "#include <algorithm>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<int> v = {5, 2, 9, 1, 9, 3};\n    std::sort(v.begin(), v.end());\n    for (int x : v) std::cout << x << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    auto it = std::find(v.begin(), v.end(), 9);\n    std::cout << \"found \" << *it << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"count 9 = \" << std::count(v.begin(), v.end(), 9) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1 2 3 5 9 9 \nfound 9\ncount 9 = 2\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "find 未找到返回 end()，解引用 end() 是未定义行为。",
            "sort 默认升序，降序用 std::greater<>{}。",
            "算法作用在迭代器范围，不检查容器大小是否匹配。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 std::sort 加 std::greater<int>{} 把 v 降序排列。",
              "hint": "std::sort(v.begin(), v.end(), std::greater<int>{});",
              "answer": "输出 9 9 5 3 2 1。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-026",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "lambda 入门",
      "summary": "用匿名函数对象捕获上下文，传给算法做比较或变换。",
      "concepts": [
        "lambda",
        "捕获列表",
        "按值/按引用捕获",
        "可调用对象"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-026-lesson",
          "title": "lambda 入门",
          "summary": "用匿名函数对象捕获上下文，传给算法做比较或变换。",
          "concepts": [
            "lambda",
            "捕获列表",
            "按值/按引用捕获",
            "可调用对象"
          ],
          "objective": "编写 lambda 并作为算法谓词使用，理解捕获方式。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "算法入门：sort/find/count"
          ],
          "explain": "lambda 是就地定义的可调用对象：[](参数){ 体 }。方括号是捕获列表：[x] 按值捕获，[&x] 按引用，[=] 全部按值，[&] 全部按引用。它常作为算法的谓词（比较、过滤）。捕获时要小心悬空引用（尤其异步/延迟调用）。",
          "code": "#include <algorithm>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<int> v = {3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6};\n    std::sort(v.begin(), v.end(), [](int a, int b) { return a > b; });\n    for (int x : v) std::cout << x << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n\n    int threshold = 4;\n    int above = std::count_if(v.begin(), v.end(),\n                              [threshold](int x) { return x > threshold; });\n    std::cout << \"above \" << threshold << \" = \" << above << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "9 6 5 4 3 2 1 1 \nabove 4 = 3\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "按引用捕获的变量若在 lambda 调用前销毁会悬空。",
            "mutable 才允许修改按值捕获的副本。",
            "捕获 this 时注意对象生命周期。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把阈值改成 5，观察 above 变化。",
              "hint": "只有 9 6 大于 5。",
              "answer": "above 5 = 2。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
