          "concepts": [
            "std::ranges",
            "ranges::sort",
            "视图初识",
            "C++20"
          ],
          "objective": "用 std::ranges:: 算法对容器整体操作。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "算法入门：sort/find/count"
          ],
          "explain": "C++20 的 <ranges> 让算法直接接收容器，std::ranges::sort(v) 取代 std::sort(v.begin(), v.end())。它还提供惰性视图（views）做管道式数据变换。ranges 算法更安全、更易读，是现代 C++ 的推荐写法。",
          "code": "#include <algorithm>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <ranges>\n#include <vector>\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<int> v = {5, 3, 8, 1, 4};\n    std::ranges::sort(v);\n    for (int x : v) std::cout << x << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    auto evens = v | std::views::filter([](int x) { return x % 2 == 0; });\n    for (int x : evens) std::cout << x << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1 3 4 5 8 \n4 8 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "ranges 需要 C++20 及支持它的编译器（WSL clang 18 / g++ 13 及 App 的 C++20 均可用）。",
            "视图是惰性的，绑定到临时容器会悬空。",
            "并非所有算法都有 ranges 版本，混合使用时要看头文件。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 views::transform 把每个元素平方后打印。",
              "hint": "v | std::views::transform([](int x){return x*x;})",
              "answer": "对 {1,3,4,5,8} 输出 1 9 16 25 64。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-028",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "编译期计算入门：constexpr 函数",
      "summary": "用 constexpr 在编译期算出结果，理解编译期与运行期的分界。",
      "concepts": [
        "constexpr 函数",
        "编译期求值",
        "static_assert",
        "常量表达式"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-028-lesson",
          "title": "编译期计算入门：constexpr 函数",
          "summary": "用 constexpr 在编译期算出结果，理解编译期与运行期的分界。",
          "concepts": [
            "constexpr 函数",
            "编译期求值",
            "static_assert",
            "常量表达式"
          ],
          "objective": "编写 constexpr 函数并用 static_assert 验证编译期结果。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "const 与 constexpr"
          ],
          "explain": "constexpr 函数在实参是常量表达式时可于编译期求值，否则退化为运行期。static_assert 在编译期检查条件，不满足直接编译失败。两者结合能把计算错误提前到编译期，是模板元编程的基础。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nconstexpr int factorial(int n) {\n    int r = 1;\n    for (int i = 2; i <= n; ++i) r *= i;\n    return r;\n}\n\nstatic_assert(factorial(5) == 120, \"5! 应为 120\");\n\nint main() {\n    constexpr int f6 = factorial(6);\n    std::cout << \"6! = \" << f6 << \"\\n\";\n    int n = 4;\n    std::cout << \"4! = \" << factorial(n) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "6! = 720\n4! = 24\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "constexpr 函数体内不能有未定义行为（如越界）。",
            "static_assert 的表达式必须是编译期常量。",
            "C++11 的 constexpr 函数限制为单条 return，C++14 起才宽松。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "加一条 static_assert(factorial(0) == 1) 验证边界。",
              "hint": "0! 定义为 1。",
              "answer": "编译通过，说明 0! 被正确算成 1。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-029",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "使用断言与调试",
      "summary": "用 assert 表达前置条件，理解发布构建下 NDEBUG 的影响。",
      "concepts": [
        "assert",
        "NDEBUG",
        "调试输出",
        "前置条件"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-029-lesson",
          "title": "使用断言与调试",
          "summary": "用 assert 表达前置条件，理解发布构建下 NDEBUG 的影响。",
          "concepts": [
            "assert",
            "NDEBUG",
            "调试输出",
            "前置条件"
          ],
          "objective": "用 assert 表达前置条件并在调试期捕获违规。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "条件与 switch"
          ],
          "explain": "assert(cond) 在条件为假时终止并打印位置，用于表达“绝不该发生”的前提。定义 NDEBUG 后 assert 会被移除，所以不要在里面写有副作用的表达式。断言是调试工具，面向用户的错误处理该用异常或返回值。",
          "code": "#include <cassert>\n#include <iostream>\n\nint divide(int a, int b) {\n    assert(b != 0 && \"除数不应为零\");\n    return a / b;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << divide(10, 2) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"断言通过\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "5\n断言通过\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "assert 里有副作用（如 ++i）会在发布版被消除，导致行为不一致。",
            "assert 不用于校验用户输入。",
            "NDEBUG 定义后 assert 变成空操作。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "在 main 里调用 divide(1, 0) 观察断言触发（预期失败）。",
              "hint": "断言失败会 abort，程序非零退出。",
              "answer": "断言触发并异常终止；本例保留合法调用以便通过。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
