      "id": "cpp-tutorial-030",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "位运算基础",
      "summary": "用与/或/异或/移位操作整数的二进制位。",
      "concepts": [
        "位运算",
        "移位",
        "掩码",
        "十六进制"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-030-lesson",
          "title": "位运算基础",
          "summary": "用与/或/异或/移位操作整数的二进制位。",
          "concepts": [
            "位运算",
            "移位",
            "掩码",
            "十六进制"
          ],
          "objective": "用位运算设置、清除、翻转和检查二进制位。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "const 与 constexpr"
          ],
          "explain": "& 按位与（掩码），| 按位或（置位），^ 按位异或（翻转/比较），~ 取反，<< >> 移位。常用十六进制 0x 表示位模式。对无符号数移位是逻辑移位；对有符号负数左移是未定义行为。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nint main() {\n    unsigned flags = 0b0000;\n    flags |= (1u << 2);      // 置第 2 位\n    flags |= (1u << 0);      // 置第 0 位\n    std::cout << \"flags=\" << flags << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"bit2 set? \" << ((flags >> 2) & 1u) << \"\\n\";\n    flags &= ~(1u << 0);     // 清第 0 位\n    std::cout << \"flags=\" << flags << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"xor=\" << (0xF0 ^ 0x0F) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "flags=5\nbit2 set? 1\nflags=4\nxor=255\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "对负数左移是未定义行为。",
            "移位数超过类型宽度是未定义行为。",
            "位运算优先级低于比较，写掩码时勤加括号。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "统计 flags 中置位的个数。",
              "hint": "while (x) { ++n; x &= x - 1; }",
              "answer": "对 flags=4 输出 1。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-031",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "数值格式化输出",
      "summary": "用 <iomanip> 控制宽度、精度、填充和对齐。",
      "concepts": [
        "iomanip",
        "setw",
        "setprecision",
        "fixed"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-031-lesson",
          "title": "数值格式化输出",
          "summary": "用 <iomanip> 控制宽度、精度、填充和对齐。",
          "concepts": [
            "iomanip",
            "setw",
            "setprecision",
            "fixed"
          ],
          "objective": "用操纵器控制浮点精度和列宽，生成整齐的表格输出。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::string 基础"
          ],
          "explain": "<iomanip> 提供 setw（下一个输出的最小宽度）、setfill（填充字符）、setprecision（有效/小数位数）、fixed（定点表示）、left/right（对齐）。setprecision 一次设置后持续生效，setw 只影响紧接着的一次输出。",
          "code": "#include <iomanip>\n#include <iostream>\n\nint main() {\n    double pi = 3.14159265;\n    std::cout << std::fixed << std::setprecision(2) << pi << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << std::setprecision(4) << pi << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << std::setw(8) << std::setfill('0') << 42 << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << std::left << std::setw(6) << std::setfill('.') << 7 << \"|\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "3.14\n3.1416\n00000042\n7.....|\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "setw 只作用于下一次输出，不复用。",
            "fixed 与 setprecision 组合控制小数位；不写 fixed 时是有效数字位。",
            "浮点输出在不同平台可能有细微差异，重要结果建议固定精度。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把 42 的宽度改成 10，观察补零数量变化。",
              "hint": "setw(10) 会补到 10 位。",
              "answer": "输出 0000000042。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-032",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "stringstream：字符串作为流",
      "summary": "用 std::stringstream 在字符串与类型之间转换、拼接文本。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::stringstream",
        "格式化到字符串",
        "解析字符串",
        "ostringstream"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-032-lesson",
          "title": "stringstream：字符串作为流",
          "summary": "用 std::stringstream 在字符串与类型之间转换、拼接文本。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::stringstream",
            "格式化到字符串",
            "解析字符串",
            "ostringstream"
          ],
          "objective": "用 stringstream 生成格式化字符串并从中解析多个值。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::string 基础"
          ],
          "explain": "<sstream> 的 std::ostringstream 像 cout 一样 << 但结果进入内存字符串，std::istringstream 像 cin 一样 >> 从字符串解析。它们避免手写 C 风格 sprintf，类型安全。std::stringstream 两者兼可。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <sstream>\n#include <string>\n\nint main() {\n    std::ostringstream oss;\n    oss << \"score=\" << 95 << \" level=\" << 3;\n    std::string text = oss.str();\n    std::cout << text << \"\\n\";\n\n    std::istringstream iss(\"12 34 56\");\n    int a = 0, b = 0, c = 0;\n    iss >> a >> b >> c;\n    std::cout << a + b + c << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "score=95 level=3\n102\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "重复使用同一个 stringstream 前要 clear() 并清空内容，否则残留状态。",
            "oss.str(\"\") 才能清空已写入内容。",
            "解析失败会设置 failbit，注意检查。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 istringstream 解析 \"3.5 4.5\"，打印它们之和。",
              "hint": "用 double 接收。",
              "answer": "输出 8。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-033",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "const 正确性入门",
      "summary": "把不该修改的参数和成员函数标为 const，让编译器守住约定。",
      "concepts": [
        "const 参数",
        "const 成员函数",
        "const 引用",
        "接口约束"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-033-lesson",
          "title": "const 正确性入门",
          "summary": "把不该修改的参数和成员函数标为 const，让编译器守住约定。",
          "concepts": [
            "const 参数",
            "const 成员函数",
            "const 引用",
            "接口约束"
          ],
          "objective": "用 const 引用参数和 const 成员函数表达只读语义。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::string 基础"
          ],
          "explain": "按 const 引用传参既避免拷贝又承诺不修改。const 成员函数表示不改变对象状态，const 对象只能调用 const 成员函数。const 正确性是 C++ 接口设计的基本功：它让“只读”成为类型系统可检查的契约。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\nstruct Rectangle {\n    double width;\n    double height;\n    double area() const { return width * height; }\n};\n\nvoid printArea(const Rectangle& r) {\n    // r.width = 1;  // 编译错误：const 引用不可修改\n    std::cout << \"area=\" << r.area() << \"\\n\";\n}\n\nint main() {\n    Rectangle r{3.0, 4.0};\n    printArea(r);\n    const Rectangle c{2.0, 5.0};\n    std::cout << c.area() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "area=12\n10\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "漏写成员函数的 const 会导致 const 对象无法调用它。",
            "const 引用可延长临时对象生命周期，但仍不能修改。",
            "const 不传播到指针指向的数据（const T* vs T* const）。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 Rectangle 加一个 const 成员函数 perimeter() 并调用。",
              "hint": "double perimeter() const { return 2 * (width + height); }",
              "answer": "r.perimeter() 输出 14。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-034",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "综合练习：学生成绩统计",
      "summary": "综合运用 vector、string、算法与格式化，完成一个小统计程序。",
      "concepts": [
        "综合",
        "vector",
        "struct",
        "算法",
        "格式化"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-034-lesson",
          "title": "综合练习：学生成绩统计",
          "summary": "综合运用 vector、string、算法与格式化，完成一个小统计程序。",
          "concepts": [
            "综合",
            "vector",
            "struct",
            "算法",
            "格式化"
          ],
          "objective": "把结构体、容器、算法与输出组合成一个完整的小程序。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "算法入门：sort/find/count",
            "数值格式化输出"
          ],
          "explain": "这一课把前面学的结构体、vector、范围循环、算法和定点输出组合起来：定义 Student、放入 vector、统计总分与平均分、找出最高分。综合练习的目标是体会“数据 + 算法 + 输出”的组织方式，而不是引入新语法。",
          "code": "#include <algorithm>\n#include <iomanip>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <vector>\n\nstruct Student {\n    std::string name;\n    int score;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<Student> students = {{\"小明\", 88}, {\"小红\", 95}, {\"小刚\", 72}};\n    int total = 0;\n    for (const auto& s : students) total += s.score;\n    auto best = std::max_element(\n        students.begin(), students.end(),\n        [](const Student& a, const Student& b) { return a.score < b.score; });\n    std::cout << \"人数 \" << students.size() << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"平均 \" << std::fixed << std::setprecision(1)\n              << static_cast<double>(total) / students.size() << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"最高 \" << best->name << \" \" << best->score << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "人数 3\n平均 85.0\n最高 小红 95\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "total / students.size() 是整数除法，要先转 double。",
            "max_element 返回迭代器，需解引用；空容器会返回 end()。",
            "结构体字段顺序与初始化列表必须一致。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "增加一名学生，观察平均分变化。",
              "hint": "在初始化列表里加一项即可。",
              "answer": "人数与平均分随之变化，最高分可能改变。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-035",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "类与封装",
      "summary": "用 class 定义对象，用访问控制隐藏实现细节。",
      "concepts": [
        "class",
        "封装",
        "private/public",
        "成员函数"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-035-lesson",
          "title": "类与封装",
          "summary": "用 class 定义对象，用访问控制隐藏实现细节。",
          "concepts": [
            "class",
            "封装",
            "private/public",
            "成员函数"
          ],
          "objective": "定义带私有数据和公有接口的类，理解封装的动机。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "const 正确性入门"
          ],
          "explain": "class 把数据和行为放在一起，默认成员是 private。把数据设为 private、只暴露必要的方法叫封装：外部只能通过接口改变状态，类的作者可以在不破坏调用方的前提下修改内部实现。struct 默认 public，语义上常用于纯数据聚合。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nclass Counter {\npublic:\n    void increment() { ++value_; }\n    int value() const { return value_; }\nprivate:\n    int value_ = 0;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Counter c;\n    c.increment();\n    c.increment();\n    std::cout << c.value() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "2\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "class 默认 private，忘记写 public: 会导致接口无法访问。",
            "成员变量命名常用尾下划线（value_）以区别参数。",
            "把观察方法标成 const，否则 const 对象无法调用。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 Counter 加一个 reset() 方法把值清零。",
              "hint": "void reset() { value_ = 0; }",
              "answer": "调用 reset() 后 value() 返回 0。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-036",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "构造函数",
      "summary": "用构造函数初始化对象，并理解重载构造函数与默认构造。",
      "concepts": [
        "构造函数",
        "重载构造",
        "默认构造",
        "explicit"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-036-lesson",
          "title": "构造函数",
          "summary": "用构造函数初始化对象，并理解重载构造函数与默认构造。",
          "concepts": [
            "构造函数",
            "重载构造",
            "默认构造",
            "explicit"
          ],
          "objective": "定义多个构造函数初始化为不同状态的对象。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "类与封装"
          ],
          "explain": "构造函数与类同名、无返回类型，在对象创建时运行。可以重载提供多种初始化方式。没有显式构造函数时编译器生成默认构造。单参数构造函数加 explicit 可阻止意外的隐式转换。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\nclass Point {\npublic:\n    Point() : x_(0), y_(0) {}\n    Point(int x, int y) : x_(x), y_(y) {}\n    explicit Point(int v) : x_(v), y_(v) {}\n    void print() const { std::cout << \"(\" << x_ << \",\" << y_ << \")\\n\"; }\nprivate:\n    int x_;\n    int y_;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Point a;\n    Point b(3, 4);\n    Point c(5);\n    a.print();\n    b.print();\n    c.print();\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "(0,0)\n(3,4)\n(5,5)\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "构造函数不能声明返回类型。",
            "未初始化的内置类型成员是垃圾值，务必初始化。",
            "explicit 只对单参数构造有意义，但建议默认加上。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 Point 再加一个构造函数接受字符串 \"x,y\"。",
              "hint": "解析字符串后委托给 (int,int) 构造。",
              "answer": "新增构造后 Point p(\"1,2\") 打印 (1,2)。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-037",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "成员初始化列表",
      "summary": "用初始化列表在构造时直接初始化成员，理解与赋值的区别。",
      "concepts": [
        "成员初始化列表",
        "初始化顺序",
        "const 成员",
        "引用成员"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-037-lesson",
          "title": "成员初始化列表",
          "summary": "用初始化列表在构造时直接初始化成员，理解与赋值的区别。",
          "concepts": [
            "成员初始化列表",
            "初始化顺序",
            "const 成员",
            "引用成员"
          ],
          "objective": "用成员初始化列表初始化 const、引用和无默认构造的成员。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "构造函数"
          ],
          "explain": "构造函数冒号后的初始化列表在进入函数体前初始化成员。对 const 成员、引用成员、没有默认构造的类类型成员，必须用初始化列表，在函数体里“赋值”为时已晚。成员按声明顺序初始化，与列表书写顺序无关。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\nclass Config {\npublic:\n    Config(std::string name, int id)\n        : name_(std::move(name)), id_(id), tag_(id_ * 10) {}\n    void print() const {\n        std::cout << name_ << \" \" << id_ << \" \" << tag_ << \"\\n\";\n    }\nprivate:\n    std::string name_;\n    int id_;\n    const int tag_;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Config c(\"server\", 7);\n    c.print();\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "server 7 70\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "const/引用成员必须在初始化列表里初始化。",
            "成员初始化顺序由声明顺序决定，别依赖列表顺序。",
            "用初始化列表而非函数体赋值可避免先默认构造再赋值。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把 tag_ 的初始化改成依赖 name_ 的长度。",
              "hint": "tag_(static_cast<int>(name_.size()))",
              "answer": "对 \"server\"（6 个字符）tag_ 变为 6。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-038",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "析构函数与 RAII",
      "summary": "用析构函数在对象销毁时释放资源，理解 RAII 是 C++ 资源管理的核心。",
      "concepts": [
        "析构函数",
        "RAII",
        "确定性析构",
        "作用域"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-038-lesson",
          "title": "析构函数与 RAII",
          "summary": "用析构函数在对象销毁时释放资源，理解 RAII 是 C++ 资源管理的核心。",
          "concepts": [
            "析构函数",
            "RAII",
            "确定性析构",
            "作用域"
          ],
          "objective": "编写析构函数并在作用域结束或异常时自动释放资源。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "成员初始化列表"
          ],
          "explain": "析构函数 ~ClassName() 在对象生命周期结束时自动调用，即使因异常离开作用域也会调用。RAII（资源获取即初始化）把资源绑定到对象生命周期：构造时获取、析构时释放，从而无需手写清理代码、也不会漏掉。智能指针和文件流都是 RAII 的例子。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nclass Tracer {\npublic:\n    explicit Tracer(const char* name) : name_(name) {\n        std::cout << \"创建 \" << name_ << \"\\n\";\n    }\n    ~Tracer() { std::cout << \"销毁 \" << name_ << \"\\n\"; }\nprivate:\n    const char* name_;\n};\n\nvoid scope() {\n    Tracer inner(\"inner\");\n}\n\nint main() {\n    Tracer outer(\"outer\");\n    scope();\n    std::cout << \"main 结束前\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "创建 outer\n创建 inner\n销毁 inner\nmain 结束前\n销毁 outer\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "析构函数不抛出异常；抛异常可能导致 terminate。",
            "多态基类需要虚析构函数（见后续课程）。",
            "按值返回局部对象时，移动/拷贝省略会影响析构次数，别依赖具体次数。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "再加一层嵌套作用域，观察析构顺序。",
              "hint": "析构按创建的反序进行。",
              "answer": "内层对象先销毁，外层后销毁。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-039",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "拷贝语义",
      "summary": "理解拷贝构造与拷贝赋值的默认行为，以及在什么情况下需要自定义。",
      "concepts": [
        "拷贝构造",
        "拷贝赋值",
        "深拷贝",
        "资源所有权"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-039-lesson",
          "title": "拷贝语义",
          "summary": "理解拷贝构造与拷贝赋值的默认行为，以及在什么情况下需要自定义。",
          "concepts": [
            "拷贝构造",
            "拷贝赋值",
            "深拷贝",
            "资源所有权"
          ],
          "objective": "识别浅拷贝的陷阱并实现深拷贝。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "析构函数与 RAII"
          ],
          "explain": "编译器默认的拷贝是逐成员浅拷贝：若成员是裸指针，两个对象会指向同一块内存，析构时重复释放。拥有资源的类需要自定义拷贝构造/拷贝赋值做深拷贝，或者干脆禁用拷贝、改用移动。",
          "code": "#include <cstring>\n#include <iostream>\n\nclass Buffer {\npublic:\n    explicit Buffer(const char* text) {\n        size_ = std::strlen(text);\n        data_ = new char[size_ + 1];\n        std::memcpy(data_, text, size_ + 1);\n    }\n    Buffer(const Buffer& other) {  // 深拷贝\n        size_ = other.size_;\n        data_ = new char[size_ + 1];\n        std::memcpy(data_, other.data_, size_ + 1);\n    }\n    ~Buffer() { delete[] data_; }\n    std::size_t size() const { return size_; }\n    const char* c_str() const { return data_; }\nprivate:\n    char* data_ = nullptr;\n    std::size_t size_ = 0;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Buffer a(\"hello\");\n    Buffer b = a;\n    b.c_str();\n    std::cout << a.c_str() << \" \" << a.size() << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << b.c_str() << \" \" << b.size() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "hello 5\nhello 5\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "默认浅拷贝会导致同一资源被释放两次（double free）。",
            "自定义拷贝后别忘了拷贝赋值和析构（三者通常一起定义）。",
            "能用智能指针/容器就不手写裸指针管理。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 Buffer 加一个拷贝赋值运算符 operator=。",
              "hint": "注意自赋值与先分配再拷贝的顺序。",
              "answer": "实现后 b = a 能安全复制内容。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-040",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "移动语义",
      "summary": "用移动构造/移动赋值从临时对象窃取资源，避免不必要的深拷贝。",
      "concepts": [
        "移动构造",
        "移动赋值",
        "std::move",
        "右值引用"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-040-lesson",
          "title": "移动语义",
          "summary": "用移动构造/移动赋值从临时对象窃取资源，避免不必要的深拷贝。",
          "concepts": [
            "移动构造",
            "移动赋值",
            "std::move",
            "右值引用"
          ],
          "objective": "实现移动构造与移动赋值，理解何时被调用。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "拷贝语义"
          ],
          "explain": "移动构造接收右值引用 T&&，把源对象的资源“偷”过来，再把源置空，因此比深拷贝便宜。std::move 把一个左值标记成可移动的右值。移动后源对象仍可析构、可赋值，但值未指定。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <utility>\n\nclass Box {\npublic:\n    explicit Box(std::string name) : name_(std::move(name)) {}\n    Box(Box&& other) noexcept : name_(std::move(other.name_)) {\n        other.name_ = \"(moved)\";\n        std::cout << \"移动构造\\n\";\n    }\n    const std::string& name() const { return name_; }\nprivate:\n    std::string name_;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Box a(\"alice\");\n    Box b(std::move(a));\n    std::cout << \"b=\" << b.name() << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"a=\" << a.name() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "移动构造\nb=alice\na=(moved)\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "移动后不要再使用源对象的值。",
            "移动操作尽量标 noexcept，容器扩容时才会优先选移动。",
            "对 const 对象用 std::move 会退化成拷贝。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "加一个移动赋值 operator=(Box&&) 并观察输出。",
              "hint": "先释放自身资源，再窃取对方资源。",
              "answer": "实现后赋值会打印自定义标记。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-041",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "三/五/零法则",
      "summary": "理解拷贝、移动、析构之间的依赖，优先选择“零法则”。",
      "concepts": [
        "三法则",
        "五法则",
        "零法则",
        "特殊成员函数"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-041-lesson",
          "title": "三/五/零法则",
          "summary": "理解拷贝、移动、析构之间的依赖，优先选择“零法则”。",
          "concepts": [
            "三法则",
            "五法则",
            "零法则",
            "特殊成员函数"
          ],
          "objective": "判断什么类需要自定义特殊成员函数，什么时候什么都不写。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "移动语义"
          ],
          "explain": "三法则：自定义析构、拷贝构造、拷贝赋值中的任一个，通常三个都要定义。五法则另加移动构造与移动赋值。零法则：如果类只由能自我管理的成员（string、vector、智能指针）组成，就不写任何特殊成员函数，让编译器生成正确的版本。现代 C++ 优先用零法则。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <vector>\n\n// 零法则：成员都能自我管理，不需要手写任何特殊成员函数\nclass Team {\npublic:\n    explicit Team(std::string name) : name_(std::move(name)) {}\n    void add(const std::string& member) { members_.push_back(member); }\n    std::size_t size() const { return members_.size(); }\n    const std::string& name() const { return name_; }\nprivate:\n    std::string name_;\n    std::vector<std::string> members_;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Team t(\"core\");\n    t.add(\"alice\");\n    t.add(\"bob\");\n    Team copy = t;  // 编译器生成的拷贝正确工作\n    std::cout << copy.name() << \" \" << copy.size() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "core 2\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "只要写了析构，编译器就不再生成移动操作（会退化为拷贝）。",
            "手写特殊成员函数时容易漏掉某一个，用 = default / = delete 明确意图。",
            "能用零法则就别手写三/五法则。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 Team 显式写 Team(const Team&) = default; 观察是否仍正确。",
              "hint": "default 让编译器生成，与零法则等价。",
              "answer": "显式 default 后行为不变，仍能正确拷贝。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-042",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "运算符重载",
      "summary": "为自定义类型重载算术与比较运算符，让类型像内置类型一样自然使用。",
      "concepts": [
        "operator+",
        "operator==",
        "成员 vs 非成员",
        "返回值"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-042-lesson",
          "title": "运算符重载",
          "summary": "为自定义类型重载算术与比较运算符，让类型像内置类型一样自然使用。",
          "concepts": [
            "operator+",
            "operator==",
            "成员 vs 非成员",
            "返回值"
          ],
          "objective": "为值类型重载 + 和 == 运算符。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "类与封装"
          ],
          "explain": "运算符重载让自定义类型参与自然表达式。成员函数形式左侧是 *this，非成员（friend）形式两侧对等。== 常与 != 配套。不要滥用重载，语义要符合直觉（+ 应是某种加法/拼接）。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nstruct Vec2 {\n    double x;\n    double y;\n    Vec2 operator+(const Vec2& o) const { return {x + o.x, y + o.y}; }\n    bool operator==(const Vec2& o) const { return x == o.x && y == o.y; }\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Vec2 a{1.0, 2.0};\n    Vec2 b{3.0, 4.0};\n    Vec2 c = a + b;\n    std::cout << c.x << \",\" << c.y << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << (a == b) << \" \" << (a == a) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "4,6\n0 1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "重载不应改变运算符的优先级或结合性。",
            "== 与 != 要成对定义以保持一致。",
            "能作为非成员的运算符尽量写成非成员，支持左侧隐式转换。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "加一个 operator- 计算差向量。",
              "hint": "返回 {x - o.x, y - o.y}。",
              "answer": "a - b 得到 (-2,-2)。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-043",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "operator<< 输出自定义类型",
      "summary": "重载 << 让自定义类型可直接用 std::cout 打印。",
      "concepts": [
        "operator<<",
        "std::ostream",
        "friend",
        "链式输出"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-043-lesson",
          "title": "operator<< 输出自定义类型",
          "summary": "重载 << 让自定义类型可直接用 std::cout 打印。",
          "concepts": [
            "operator<<",
            "std::ostream",
            "friend",
            "链式输出"
          ],
          "objective": "为自定义类型实现 operator<< 以支持流式打印。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "运算符重载"
          ],
          "explain": "operator<< 必须写成非成员（友元），因为左操作数是 std::ostream。它返回 std::ostream& 以支持链式 std::cout << a << b。把打印逻辑集中在一处，避免到处手写字段格式化。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\nstruct Point {\n    int x;\n    int y;\n};\n\nstd::ostream& operator<<(std::ostream& os, const Point& p) {\n    return os << \"(\" << p.x << \", \" << p.y << \")\";\n}\n\nint main() {\n    Point a{1, 2};\n    Point b{3, 4};\n    std::cout << a << \" -> \" << b << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "(1, 2) -> (3, 4)\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "写成成员函数会导致 cout << p 无法编译（左操作数顺序错误）。",
            "要返回 ostream& 才能链式输出。",
            "输出格式要与解析保持一致，方便回读。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把格式改成 \"x=1,y=2\"。",
              "hint": "调整函数体内的输出。",
              "answer": "输出变为 x=1,y=2。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-044",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "继承",
      "summary": "用继承表达“是一种”关系，派生子类复用并扩展基类。",
      "concepts": [
        "继承",
        "public 继承",
        "基类/派生类",
        "is-a"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-044-lesson",
          "title": "继承",
          "summary": "用继承表达“是一种”关系，派生子类复用并扩展基类。",
          "concepts": [
            "继承",
            "public 继承",
            "基类/派生类",
            "is-a"
          ],
          "objective": "定义基类与派生类，访问基类的公有和保护成员。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "类与封装"
          ],
          "explain": "public 继承表示 is-a：派生类拥有基类的全部成员，并能访问 public/protected 成员。派生类构造函数通过初始化列表调用基类构造。继承用于复用共同接口和实现，不要为了复用实现而滥用继承（优先组合）。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\nclass Animal {\npublic:\n    explicit Animal(std::string name) : name_(std::move(name)) {}\n    const std::string& name() const { return name_; }\nprotected:\n    std::string describe() const { return \"动物 \" + name_; }\nprivate:\n    std::string name_;\n};\n\nclass Dog : public Animal {\npublic:\n    explicit Dog(std::string name) : Animal(std::move(name)) {}\n    void speak() const { std::cout << describe() << \" 汪\\n\"; }\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Dog d(\"旺财\");\n    std::cout << d.name() << \"\\n\";\n    d.speak();\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "旺财\n动物 旺财 汪\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "基类私有成员派生类不可见，需要 protected 或接口。",
            "派生类构造必须在初始化列表调用合适的基类构造。",
            "基类析构不是 virtual 时，通过基类指针删除派生对象是未定义行为。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "再派生一个 Cat 类并实现 speak 输出“喵”。",
              "hint": "仿照 Dog 写即可。",
              "answer": "Cat c(\"咪咪\"); c.speak() 输出「动物 咪咪 喵」。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-045",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "虚函数与动态派发",
      "summary": "用 virtual 让通过基类指针/引用调用时执行派生类的实现。",
      "concepts": [
        "virtual",
        "override",
        "动态派发",
        "多态"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-045-lesson",
          "title": "虚函数与动态派发",
          "summary": "用 virtual 让通过基类指针/引用调用时执行派生类的实现。",
          "concepts": [
            "virtual",
            "override",
            "动态派发",
            "多态"
          ],
          "objective": "用虚函数实现运行期多态。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "继承"
          ],
          "explain": "把基类函数标为 virtual，用基类指针或引用调用时会根据对象的实际类型分派到派生类实现，这叫动态派发/多态。派生类用 override 显式表明覆盖，编译器会检查签名是否匹配，避免“以为覆盖了其实没有”。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <memory>\n#include <vector>\n\nclass Shape {\npublic:\n    virtual ~Shape() = default;\n    virtual double area() const = 0;\n    virtual const char* name() const = 0;\n};\n\nclass Circle : public Shape {\npublic:\n    explicit Circle(double r) : r_(r) {}\n    double area() const override { return 3.14159 * r_ * r_; }\n    const char* name() const override { return \"circle\"; }\nprivate:\n    double r_;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<std::unique_ptr<Shape>> shapes;\n    shapes.push_back(std::make_unique<Circle>(1.0));\n    for (const auto& s : shapes) {\n        std::cout << s->name() << \" \" << s->area() << \"\\n\";\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "circle 3.14159\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "忘记 virtual 会静态绑定，得到基类实现。",
            "覆盖时签名必须完全一致，否则是隐藏而非覆盖；用 override 让编译器把关。",
            "基类作为多态使用时，析构函数必须是 virtual。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "再加一个 Square 派生类并放进容器。",
              "hint": "实现 area/name。",
              "answer": "输出会多一行 square 及其面积。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-046",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "抽象类与接口",
      "summary": "用纯虚函数定义只有接口没有实现的抽象基类。",
      "concepts": [
        "纯虚函数",
        "抽象类",
        "接口",
        "= 0"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-046-lesson",
          "title": "抽象类与接口",
          "summary": "用纯虚函数定义只有接口没有实现的抽象基类。",
          "concepts": [
            "纯虚函数",
            "抽象类",
            "接口",
            "= 0"
          ],
          "objective": "定义抽象基类并用它作为接口约束实现者。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "虚函数与动态派发"
          ],
          "explain": "含纯虚函数（= 0）的类是抽象类，不能实例化，只能作为接口被继承。派生类必须实现所有纯虚函数才能实例化。接口把“能做什么”与“怎么做”分离，是依赖倒置的基础。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <memory>\n\nclass Logger {\npublic:\n    virtual ~Logger() = default;\n    virtual void log(const char* msg) = 0;\n};\n\nclass ConsoleLogger : public Logger {\npublic:\n    void log(const char* msg) override { std::cout << \"[console] \" << msg << \"\\n\"; }\n};\n\nclass FileLogger : public Logger {\npublic:\n    void log(const char* msg) override { std::cout << \"[file] \" << msg << \"\\n\"; }\n};\n\nvoid useLogger(Logger& logger) { logger.log(\"hello\"); }\n\nint main() {\n    ConsoleLogger c;\n    FileLogger f;\n    useLogger(c);\n    useLogger(f);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "[console] hello\n[file] hello\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "抽象类不能实例化，但可以有数据成员和普通函数。",
            "接口应保持小而稳定，改动会波及所有实现者。",
            "按引用/指针接收接口，不要按值（会切片）。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "再加一个 NullLogger，log 什么都不做。",
              "hint": "空实现即可（Null Object 模式）。",
              "answer": "useLogger(nullLogger) 不产生输出。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-047",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "虚析构函数",
      "summary": "多态基类的析构函数应为 virtual，避免只析构基类子对象。",
      "concepts": [
        "虚析构",
        "delete 语义",
        "多态删除",
        "资源泄漏"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-047-lesson",
          "title": "虚析构函数",
          "summary": "多态基类的析构函数应为 virtual，避免只析构基类子对象。",
          "concepts": [
            "虚析构",
            "delete 语义",
            "多态删除",
            "资源泄漏"
          ],
          "objective": "理解为什么多态基类需要虚析构函数。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "抽象类与接口"
          ],
          "explain": "当用基类指针 delete 派生对象时，如果基类析构不是 virtual，只会调用基类析构，派生类的清理被跳过（未定义行为/资源泄漏）。把基类析构设为 virtual 会按实际类型调用正确的析构。只要类可能被多态使用，就给它虚析构。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nclass Base {\npublic:\n    virtual ~Base() { std::cout << \"~Base\\n\"; }\n};\n\nclass Derived : public Base {\npublic:\n    ~Derived() override { std::cout << \"~Derived\\n\"; }\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Base* p = new Derived();\n    delete p;  // 虚析构：先 ~Derived 再 ~Base\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "~Derived\n~Base\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "基类析构非 virtual 时多态删除只析构基类子对象。",
            "不要从没有虚析构的类（如 std::string）公开继承并多态删除。",
            "虚析构会引入 vptr 开销，纯数据类不需要。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把基类析构的 virtual 去掉，观察输出变化。",
              "hint": "去掉后只输出 ~Base。",
              "answer": "只析构基类，派生类清理被跳过。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-048",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "unique_ptr：独占所有权",
      "summary": "用 std::unique_ptr 表达独占所有权，自动释放、不可拷贝可移动。",
      "concepts": [
        "unique_ptr",
        "make_unique",
        "所有权",
        "move"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-048-lesson",
          "title": "unique_ptr：独占所有权",
          "summary": "用 std::unique_ptr 表达独占所有权，自动释放、不可拷贝可移动。",
          "concepts": [
            "unique_ptr",
            "make_unique",
            "所有权",
            "move"
          ],
          "objective": "用 unique_ptr 管理动态对象并转移所有权。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "虚析构函数"
          ],
          "explain": "std::unique_ptr<T> 独占一块动态资源，离开作用域自动 delete；不能拷贝，只能 move 转移所有权。std::make_unique 更安全（异常安全、少写类型）。它替代裸 new/delete，是默认的堆对象管理方式。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <memory>\n\nstruct Resource {\n    explicit Resource(int id) : id(id) { std::cout << \"acquire \" << id << \"\\n\"; }\n    ~Resource() { std::cout << \"release \" << id << \"\\n\"; }\n    int id;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    auto a = std::make_unique<Resource>(1);\n    std::cout << a->id << \"\\n\";\n    auto b = std::move(a);  // 所有权转移\n    std::cout << (a == nullptr) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << b->id << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "acquire 1\n1\n1\n1\nrelease 1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "unique_ptr 不能拷贝，转移所有权要用 std::move。",
            "转移后原指针为 null，解引用是未定义行为。",
            "优先 make_unique 而非 new。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把 a 转移给 b 后打印 a == nullptr 的结果。",
              "hint": "a 在 move 后为空。",
              "answer": "输出 1，表示 a 已不拥有资源。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-049",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "shared_ptr 与 weak_ptr",
      "summary": "用 shared_ptr 共享所有权，用 weak_ptr 打破循环引用。",
      "concepts": [
        "shared_ptr",
        "weak_ptr",
        "引用计数",
        "循环引用"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-049-lesson",
          "title": "shared_ptr 与 weak_ptr",
          "summary": "用 shared_ptr 共享所有权，用 weak_ptr 打破循环引用。",
          "concepts": [
            "shared_ptr",
            "weak_ptr",
            "引用计数",
            "循环引用"
          ],
          "objective": "用 shared_ptr 共享对象并观察引用计数，用 weak_ptr 观测不持有。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "unique_ptr：独占所有权"
          ],
          "explain": "std::shared_ptr<T> 用引用计数共享所有权，最后一个 shared_ptr 销毁时释放对象。std::weak_ptr 指向 shared_ptr 管理的对象但不增加计数，用于打破循环引用或做缓存。shared_ptr 有计数开销，能用 unique_ptr 就别用 shared_ptr。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <memory>\n\nint main() {\n    auto a = std::make_shared<int>(42);\n    std::cout << \"count=\" << a.use_count() << \"\\n\";\n    {\n        auto b = a;\n        std::cout << \"count=\" << a.use_count() << \"\\n\";\n    }\n    std::cout << \"count=\" << a.use_count() << \"\\n\";\n    std::weak_ptr<int> w = a;\n    if (auto locked = w.lock()) {\n        std::cout << \"locked=\" << *locked << \"\\n\";\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "count=1\ncount=2\ncount=1\nlocked=42\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "两个对象互相用 shared_ptr 会导致循环引用、永不释放，改用 weak_ptr。",
            "weak_ptr 使用前要 lock() 检查对象是否还活着。",
            "不要用同一个裸指针构造两个独立的 shared_ptr（会双重释放）。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "复制一个 shared_ptr 到新变量，观察 use_count 变化。",
              "hint": "auto c = a; 会让计数加一。",
              "answer": "计数从 1 变为 2，c 销毁后回到 1。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-050",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "算法：transform 与 accumulate",
      "summary": "用 std::transform 映射元素、std::accumulate 归约序列。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::transform",
        "std::accumulate",
        "map/reduce",
        "初始值"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-050-lesson",
          "title": "算法：transform 与 accumulate",
          "summary": "用 std::transform 映射元素、std::accumulate 归约序列。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::transform",
            "std::accumulate",
            "map/reduce",
            "初始值"
          ],
          "objective": "用 transform 做映射、accumulate 做归约。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "lambda 入门"
          ],
          "explain": "std::transform 把输入区间每个元素经函数映射到输出区间；std::accumulate（在 <numeric>）用一个初值和二元操作把区间归约成单值。两者是 map/reduce 的原型，配合 lambda 表达力很强。",
          "code": "#include <algorithm>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <numeric>\n#include <vector>\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<int> v = {1, 2, 3, 4};\n    std::vector<int> squared(v.size());\n    std::transform(v.begin(), v.end(), squared.begin(),\n                   [](int x) { return x * x; });\n    for (int x : squared) std::cout << x << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    int sum = std::accumulate(v.begin(), v.end(), 0);\n    std::cout << \"sum=\" << sum << \"\\n\";\n    int product = std::accumulate(v.begin(), v.end(), 1,\n                                  [](int a, int b) { return a * b; });\n    std::cout << \"product=\" << product << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1 4 9 16 \nsum=10\nproduct=24\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "accumulate 的初值类型决定返回类型，用 0 累加 double 会被截断。",
            "transform 的输出区间必须足够大，或配合 back_inserter。",
            "accumulate 是顺序的；并行归约要用 reduce。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 accumulate 从空字符串起拼接所有数字的字符串表示。",
              "hint": "初值为 std::string{}，二元操作用 + 转字符串。",
              "answer": "得到 \"1234\"。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-051",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "谓词与函数对象",
      "summary": "用仿函数（重载 operator()）作为可配置的谓词传给算法。",
      "concepts": [
        "仿函数",
        "operator()",
        "谓词",
        "状态"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-051-lesson",
          "title": "谓词与函数对象",
          "summary": "用仿函数（重载 operator()）作为可配置的谓词传给算法。",
          "concepts": [
            "仿函数",
            "operator()",
            "谓词",
            "状态"
          ],
          "objective": "实现带状态的函数对象并作为谓词使用。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "算法：transform 与 accumulate"
          ],
          "explain": "仿函数是重载了 operator() 的类，像函数一样调用，但可以携带状态。相比普通函数指针，它能保存配置（如阈值）。lambda 本质上是编译器生成的仿函数。标准库中 std::greater<>、std::less<> 就是仿函数。",
          "code": "#include <algorithm>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n\nstruct Above {\n    int threshold;\n    bool operator()(int x) const { return x > threshold; }\n};\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<int> v = {3, 7, 1, 9, 4};\n    int n = std::count_if(v.begin(), v.end(), Above{5});\n    std::cout << \"above 5: \" << n << \"\\n\";\n    std::sort(v.begin(), v.end(), std::greater<int>{});\n    for (int x : v) std::cout << x << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "above 5: 2\n9 7 4 3 1 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "谓词应无副作用，标准库可能按任意次数、任意顺序调用它。",
            "operator() 通常标 const，否则某些算法无法使用。",
            "lambda 更简洁时优先用 lambda。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用仿函数把 v 按与 5 的距离升序排序。",
              "hint": "仿函数返回 |a-5| < |b-5|。",
              "answer": "结果为 4 3 7 9 1（按距离 1,2,2,4,4 的稳定顺序）。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-052",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "lambda 捕获详解",
      "summary": "区分按值与按引用捕获、mutable、以及初始化捕获。",
      "concepts": [
        "捕获列表",
        "mutable",
        "初始化捕获",
        "生命周期"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-052-lesson",
          "title": "lambda 捕获详解",
          "summary": "区分按值与按引用捕获、mutable、以及初始化捕获。",
          "concepts": [
            "捕获列表",
            "mutable",
            "初始化捕获",
            "生命周期"
          ],
          "objective": "按需要选择捕获方式并解释各自效果。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "谓词与函数对象"
          ],
          "explain": "按值捕获 [x] 拷贝一份快照，按引用捕获 [&x] 共享变量。mutable 允许修改按值捕获的副本（默认 lambda 调用运算符是 const）。初始化捕获 [y = x + 1] 可在捕获时计算新值，用于移动捕获或改名。",
          "code": "#include <algorithm>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n\nint main() {\n    int total = 0;\n    std::vector<int> v = {1, 2, 3};\n    std::for_each(v.begin(), v.end(), [&total](int x) { total += x; });\n    std::cout << \"total=\" << total << \"\\n\";\n\n    int counter = 0;\n    auto bump = [counter]() mutable { return ++counter; };\n    std::cout << bump() << \" \" << bump() << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"outer=\" << counter << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "total=6\n1 2\nouter=0\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "按值捕获默认不可改，要改副本需 mutable。",
            "按引用捕获的变量必须在 lambda 调用时仍然存活。",
            "[=] / [&] 省事但容易捕获过多或误捕获 this，显式更安全。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用初始化捕获 [sum = 0] 写一个累加器 lambda。",
              "hint": "mutable 才能改 sum。",
              "answer": "多次调用后返回累计结果，不污染外部变量。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-053",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "std::function：类型擦除的可调用对象",
      "summary": "用 std::function 统一保存函数指针、lambda 和仿函数。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::function",
        "类型擦除",
        "回调",
        "可调用"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-053-lesson",
          "title": "std::function：类型擦除的可调用对象",
          "summary": "用 std::function 统一保存函数指针、lambda 和仿函数。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::function",
            "类型擦除",
            "回调",
            "可调用"
          ],
          "objective": "用 std::function 存储并调用不同类型的可调用对象。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "lambda 捕获详解"
          ],
          "explain": "std::function<R(Args...)> 是能保存任意可调用对象（函数指针、lambda、仿函数）的统一包装，代价是可能的间接调用与分配开销。它适合回调表、事件分发等需要存储不同类型可调用对象的场景。",
          "code": "#include <functional>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n\nint square(int x) { return x * x; }\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<std::function<int(int)>> ops;\n    ops.push_back(square);\n    ops.push_back([](int x) { return x + 1; });\n    ops.push_back([](int x) { return x * 2; });\n    for (const auto& op : ops) std::cout << op(5) << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "25 6 10 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "std::function 可能分配内存，性能敏感路径优先用模板或函数指针。",
            "空的 std::function 调用会抛 std::bad_function_call。",
            "捕获大对象时注意拷贝开销，必要时捕获 shared_ptr。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把 ops 里所有函数依次作用在 5 上并求和。",
              "hint": "遍历累加 op(5)。",
              "answer": "25 + 6 + 10 = 41。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-054",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "函数模板",
      "summary": "用模板让一个函数适配多种类型，理解实例化与类型推导。",
      "concepts": [
        "template",
        "类型参数",
        "实例化",
        "类型推导"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-054-lesson",
          "title": "函数模板",
          "summary": "用模板让一个函数适配多种类型，理解实例化与类型推导。",
          "concepts": [
            "template",
            "类型参数",
            "实例化",
            "类型推导"
          ],
          "objective": "编写函数模板并在不同类型上实例化。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "函数与重载"
          ],
          "explain": "template <typename T> 声明类型参数，编译器在调用处按实参推导 T 并生成具体版本（实例化）。模板是编译期多态，零运行开销，但会导致代码膨胀。它能替代成堆的重复重载。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nT maxOf(T a, T b) { return a > b ? a : b; }\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << maxOf(3, 7) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << maxOf(2.5, 1.5) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << maxOf(std::string(\"apple\"), std::string(\"pear\")) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "7\n2.5\npear\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "两个实参类型不同会推导失败（maxOf(3, 2.5)），需显式指定或统一类型。",
            "模板定义通常要放在头文件里，否则链接不到。",
            "模板错误信息较长，尽力写清约束（C++20 的 concepts）。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个模板 clamp(x, lo, hi) 返回夹在区间内的值。",
              "hint": "用两次比较。",
              "answer": "clamp(10, 0, 5) 返回 5。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-055",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "类模板",
      "summary": "用类模板实现类型通用的容器，理解实例化与模板参数。",
      "concepts": [
        "类模板",
        "template 参数",
        "实例化",
        "通用容器"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-055-lesson",
          "title": "类模板",
          "summary": "用类模板实现类型通用的容器，理解实例化与模板参数。",
          "concepts": [
            "类模板",
            "template 参数",
            "实例化",
            "通用容器"
          ],
          "objective": "定义一个类模板并实例化为不同类型。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "函数模板"
          ],
          "explain": "类模板把类型作为参数，实例化成具体类。std::vector<int> 与 std::vector<double>是两个不同的类型。模板成员函数在使用时才实例化，这允许同一模板在不同类型上具备不同的可用接口。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nclass Pair {\npublic:\n    Pair(T first, T second) : first_(first), second_(second) {}\n    T maxValue() const { return first_ > second_ ? first_ : second_; }\n    void print() const {\n        std::cout << first_ << \" & \" << second_ << \"\\n\";\n    }\nprivate:\n    T first_;\n    T second_;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Pair<int> p(3, 9);\n    p.print();\n    std::cout << p.maxValue() << \"\\n\";\n    Pair<double> q(2.5, 1.5);\n    q.print();\n    std::cout << q.maxValue() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "3 & 9\n9\n2.5 & 1.5\n2.5\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "类模板定义要放在头文件，否则实例化时找不到。",
            "模板参数多时可给默认值，如 template <typename T = int>。",
            "模板实例化错误往往在实例化点而非定义点报出。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 Pair 加一个 sum() 成员返回两值之和。",
              "hint": "返回 first_ + second_。",
              "answer": "Pair<int>(3,9).sum() 返回 12。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-056",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "模板特化",
      "summary": "为特定类型提供模板的专门实现，理解全特化与偏特化。",
      "concepts": [
        "全特化",
        "偏特化",
        "模板匹配",
        "定制行为"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-056-lesson",
          "title": "模板特化",
          "summary": "为特定类型提供模板的专门实现，理解全特化与偏特化。",
          "concepts": [
            "全特化",
            "偏特化",
            "模板匹配",
            "定制行为"
          ],
          "objective": "为一个通用模板提供特定类型的特化版本。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "类模板"
          ],
          "explain": "模板特化让某个具体类型走专用实现。全特化 template <> 指定所有参数；偏特化只固定部分参数（类模板可用）。特化常用于优化特定类型或为指针类型提供不同语义。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nstruct TypeName { static const char* get() { return \"unknown\"; } };\n\ntemplate <>\nstruct TypeName<int> { static const char* get() { return \"int\"; } };\n\ntemplate <>\nstruct TypeName<double> { static const char* get() { return \"double\"; } };\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << TypeName<int>::get() << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << TypeName<double>::get() << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << TypeName<std::string>::get() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "int\ndouble\nunknown\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "全特化要写 template <> 且列全所有模板参数。",
            "函数模板不支持偏特化，只能用重载或 if constexpr 替代。",
            "特化必须在被使用前可见。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "为 TypeName<char> 加一个特化返回 \"char\"。",
              "hint": "仿照 int 的写法。",
              "answer": "TypeName<char>::get() 返回 \"char\"。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-057",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "迭代器基础",
      "summary": "用迭代器遍历容器，理解 begin/end 与解引用、前进。",
      "concepts": [
        "迭代器",
        "begin/end",
        "解引用",
        "++"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-057-lesson",
          "title": "迭代器基础",
          "summary": "用迭代器遍历容器，理解 begin/end 与解引用、前进。",
          "concepts": [
            "迭代器",
            "begin/end",
            "解引用",
            "++"
          ],
          "objective": "用迭代器遍历并修改容器元素。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::vector：动态数组"
          ],
          "explain": "迭代器是容器与算法之间的桥梁：它像指针一样支持 *（取值）、++（前进）、==（比较）。begin() 指向首元素，end() 指向尾后位置（不指向元素）。半开区间 [begin, end) 是标准库的统一约定。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<int> v = {10, 20, 30};\n    for (auto it = v.begin(); it != v.end(); ++it) {\n        *it += 1;\n    }\n    for (auto it = v.begin(); it != v.end(); ++it) {\n        std::cout << *it << \" \";\n    }\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    auto it = v.begin();\n    std::cout << *(it + 1) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "11 21 31 \n21\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "解引用 end() 是未定义行为。",
            "改动容器（插入/删除）后原有迭代器可能失效。",
            "不同容器的迭代器能力不同（随机访问 vs 前向）。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用迭代器找出 v 中值为 21 的元素位置。",
              "hint": "遍历比较 *it == 21。",
              "answer": "在第二个位置（索引 1）。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-058",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "迭代器类别",
      "summary": "区分输入、前向、双向、随机访问迭代器的能力差异。",
      "concepts": [
        "迭代器类别",
        "随机访问",
        "双向",
        "算法约束"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-058-lesson",
          "title": "迭代器类别",
          "summary": "区分输入、前向、双向、随机访问迭代器的能力差异。",
          "concepts": [
            "迭代器类别",
            "随机访问",
            "双向",
            "算法约束"
          ],
          "objective": "说明不同容器提供的迭代器能力以及算法的要求。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "迭代器基础"
          ],
          "explain": "迭代器按能力分级：输入/输出（单遍）、前向（多遍）、双向（可 --）、随机访问（可 +n、-、<）。算法要求特定类别，例如 std::sort 需要随机访问，所以 std::list 不能用它（list 只提供双向迭代器）。",
          "code": "#include <forward_list>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <list>\n#include <vector>\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<int> v = {1, 2, 3};\n    std::list<int> l = {4, 5, 6};\n    std::forward_list<int> f = {7, 8, 9};\n    std::cout << v[1] << \"\\n\";           // 随机访问\n    auto lit = l.begin();\n    ++lit; --lit;                          // 双向\n    std::cout << *lit << \"\\n\";\n    int sum = 0;\n    for (int x : f) sum += x;               // 前向遍历\n    std::cout << sum << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "2\n4\n24\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "对 list/forward_list 用 std::sort 会编译失败，它们有成员 sort。",
            "vector 迭代器是随机访问，可直接 it + n。",
            "算法要求的迭代器类别不够会编译报错，看错误信息里的类别提示。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "尝试对 std::list 调用 std::sort，观察编译错误。",
              "hint": "改为调用 list 的成员 sort()。",
              "answer": "std::sort(l.begin(), l.end()) 编译失败，应写 l.sort()。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-059",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "std::map：有序键值表",
      "summary": "用 std::map 存储键值对，按键有序、查找对数时间。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::map",
        "键值对",
        "operator[]",
        "find"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-059-lesson",
          "title": "std::map：有序键值表",
          "summary": "用 std::map 存储键值对，按键有序、查找对数时间。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::map",
            "键值对",
            "operator[]",
            "find"
          ],
          "objective": "插入、查找、遍历 map，理解其有序性与 O(log n)。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "结构化绑定"
          ],
          "explain": "std::map<K,V> 是按键有序的红黑树，查找/插入 O(log n)。[] 会插入默认值（键不存在时），count/find 用于只查询。遍历时按 key 升序，配合结构化绑定 auto& [k, v] 很简洁。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <map>\n#include <string>\n\nint main() {\n    std::map<std::string, int> ages;\n    ages[\"alice\"] = 30;\n    ages[\"bob\"] = 25;\n    ages[\"carol\"] = 28;\n    std::cout << \"alice=\" << ages[\"alice\"] << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"count bob=\" << ages.count(\"bob\") << \"\\n\";\n    for (const auto& [name, age] : ages) {\n        std::cout << name << \":\" << age << \" \";\n    }\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "alice=30\ncount bob=1\nalice:30 bob:25 carol:28 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "ages[key] 在键不存在时会插入默认值，只查询用 find/count。",
            "map 的 key 必须可比较（有 operator<）。",
            "需要哈希性能时用 unordered_map。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 find 判断 \"dave\" 是否存在并打印结果。",
              "hint": "ages.find(\"dave\") == ages.end() 表示不存在。",
              "answer": "打印 1（表示不存在）。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-060",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "std::unordered_map：哈希表",
      "summary": "用无序哈希表获得平均 O(1) 的键值查找。",
      "concepts": [
        "unordered_map",
        "哈希",
        "平均 O(1)",
        "桶"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-060-lesson",
          "title": "std::unordered_map：哈希表",
          "summary": "用无序哈希表获得平均 O(1) 的键值查找。",
          "concepts": [
            "unordered_map",
            "哈希",
            "平均 O(1)",
            "桶"
          ],
          "objective": "用 unordered_map 做高频键值查询。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::map：有序键值表"
          ],
          "explain": "std::unordered_map 用哈希表实现，平均 O(1) 查找，但无序、最坏 O(n)。键需要 std::hash 特化与 operator==。不需要有序遍历时，它通常比 map 更快。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <unordered_map>\n\nint main() {\n    std::unordered_map<std::string, int> freq;\n    for (const char* w : {\"a\", \"b\", \"a\", \"c\", \"a\"}) ++freq[w];\n    std::cout << \"a=\" << freq[\"a\"] << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"size=\" << freq.size() << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"has b=\" << (freq.count(\"b\") > 0) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "a=3\nsize=3\nhas b=1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "unordered_map 遍历顺序不确定，不要依赖它。",
            "哈希冲突严重时退化为 O(n)，必要时调整桶数或换哈希。",
            "自定义类型作 key 需提供 std::hash 特化。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "统计输入中每个单词出现的次数（用 freq 输出 a/b/c）。",
              "hint": "遍历 map 打印 k:v。",
              "answer": "a=3 b=1 c=1（顺序不限）。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-061",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "std::set 与 unordered_set",
      "summary": "用 set 去重并保持有序，用 unordered_set 获得最快成员查询。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::set",
        "unordered_set",
        "去重",
        "成员查询"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-061-lesson",
          "title": "std::set 与 unordered_set",
          "summary": "用 set 去重并保持有序，用 unordered_set 获得最快成员查询。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::set",
            "unordered_set",
            "去重",
            "成员查询"
          ],
          "objective": "用 set/unordered_set 去重与查询成员。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::unordered_map：哈希表"
          ],
          "explain": "std::set 是按键有序、元素唯一的树，insert 返回是否新插入；unordered_set 是哈希版本，平均 O(1) 查询但无序。它们天然去重，适合“是否出现过”这类判断。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <set>\n#include <vector>\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<int> nums = {3, 1, 3, 2, 1};\n    std::set<int> unique;\n    for (int x : nums) unique.insert(x);\n    std::cout << \"unique=\" << unique.size() << \"\\n\";\n    for (int x : unique) std::cout << x << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"has 2=\" << (unique.count(2) > 0) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "unique=3\n1 2 3 \nhas 2=1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "set 元素不可就地修改（会破坏有序性），要先删再插。",
            "insert 返回 pair<iterator,bool>，bool 表示是否新插入。",
            "只判断存在性优先用 unordered_set。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 set 求两个数组的交集。",
              "hint": "把第一个放 set，遍历第二个查 count。",
              "answer": "打印同时出现在两个数组里的元素。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-062",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "std::deque：双端队列",
      "summary": "用 deque 在两端高效增删，理解与 vector 的取舍。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::deque",
        "push_front",
        "push_back",
        "分段存储"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-062-lesson",
          "title": "std::deque：双端队列",
          "summary": "用 deque 在两端高效增删，理解与 vector 的取舍。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::deque",
            "push_front",
            "push_back",
            "分段存储"
          ],
          "objective": "用 deque 在两端增删并随机访问。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::vector：动态数组"
          ],
          "explain": "std::deque 支持在两端 O(1) 增删并随机访问，内部是分段连续存储。它不像 vector 那样要求整体连续，因此 front 插入便宜，但内存局部性略差。需要双端操作时选 deque，只在一端增长优先 vector。",
          "code": "#include <deque>\n#include <iostream>\n\nint main() {\n    std::deque<int> d;\n    d.push_back(2);\n    d.push_back(3);\n    d.push_front(1);\n    for (int x : d) std::cout << x << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"front=\" << d.front() << \" back=\" << d.back() << \"\\n\";\n    d.pop_front();\n    std::cout << \"size=\" << d.size() << \" front=\" << d.front() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1 2 3 \nfront=1 back=3\nsize=2 front=2\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "deque 不保证整体连续，不能传给需要连续数组的 C 接口。",
            "中间插入仍是 O(n)。",
            "迭代器在两端增删时也可能失效。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 deque 模拟队列：push_back 入队、pop_front 出队。",
              "hint": "FIFO：从尾进、从头出。",
              "answer": "依次出队顺序与入队一致。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-063",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "std::list：双向链表",
      "summary": "用 list 在任意位置 O(1) 插入删除，理解链表与数组的取舍。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::list",
        "双向链表",
        "splice",
        "迭代器稳定性"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-063-lesson",
          "title": "std::list：双向链表",
          "summary": "用 list 在任意位置 O(1) 插入删除，理解链表与数组的取舍。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::list",
            "双向链表",
            "splice",
            "迭代器稳定性"
          ],
          "objective": "用 list 做频繁中间插入删除，理解其访问代价。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "迭代器类别"
          ],
          "explain": "std::list 是双向链表，插入/删除是 O(1) 且不使其他元素迭代器失效，但随机访问是 O(n)、内存局部性差。它有成员 sort()/splice()，因为通用算法需要随机访问迭代器。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <list>\n\nint main() {\n    std::list<int> l = {3, 1, 2};\n    l.sort();\n    l.push_front(0);\n    auto it = l.begin();\n    ++it;\n    l.insert(it, 9);\n    for (int x : l) std::cout << x << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    l.remove(9);\n    std::cout << \"size=\" << l.size() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "0 9 1 2 3 \nsize=4\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "list 没有随机访问，不能用 std::sort，要用成员 sort()。",
            "中间插入快但每次都要遍历定位，整体未必比 vector 快。",
            "缓存不友好，大序列上 vector 往往更快。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 splice 把一个 list 的元素移动到另一个 list。",
              "hint": "dest.splice(pos, src)。",
              "answer": "src 变空，dest 包含合并后的元素。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-064",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "std::stack 与 std::queue",
      "summary": "用容器适配器获得栈（LIFO）与队列（FIFO）接口。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::stack",
        "std::queue",
        "容器适配器",
        "LIFO/FIFO"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-064-lesson",
          "title": "std::stack 与 std::queue",
          "summary": "用容器适配器获得栈（LIFO）与队列（FIFO）接口。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::stack",
            "std::queue",
            "容器适配器",
            "LIFO/FIFO"
          ],
          "objective": "用 stack 和 queue 实现基本的数据结构操作。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::deque：双端队列"
          ],
          "explain": "std::stack 和 std::queue 是容器适配器：它们包装底层容器（默认 deque）只暴露受限接口。stack 是后进先出，push/pop/top；queue 是先进先出，push/pop/front/back。适配器让意图明确、避免误用。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <queue>\n#include <stack>\n\nint main() {\n    std::stack<int> s;\n    s.push(1); s.push(2); s.push(3);\n    std::cout << \"stack:\";\n    while (!s.empty()) { std::cout << \" \" << s.top(); s.pop(); }\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n\n    std::queue<int> q;\n    q.push(1); q.push(2); q.push(3);\n    std::cout << \"queue:\";\n    while (!q.empty()) { std::cout << \" \" << q.front(); q.pop(); }\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "stack: 3 2 1\nqueue: 1 2 3\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "空的 stack/queue 上调用 top/front/pop 是未定义行为，先判 empty。",
            "stack/queue 不支持遍历，只暴露顶端。",
            "需要优先队列用 std::priority_queue。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 stack 判断一个字符串的括号是否匹配。",
              "hint": "遇左括号入栈，遇右括号弹出。",
              "answer": "匹配则最后栈为空。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-065",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "std::variant",
      "summary": "用 std::variant 表达“多种类型之一”，类型安全地替代 union。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::variant",
        "std::get",
        "std::visit",
        "代数数据类型"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-065-lesson",
          "title": "std::variant",
          "summary": "用 std::variant 表达“多种类型之一”，类型安全地替代 union。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::variant",
            "std::get",
            "std::visit",
            "代数数据类型"
          ],
          "objective": "用 variant 保存不同类型并安全访问。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::optional 入门"
          ],
          "explain": "std::variant<A,B,...> 任一时刻持有其中一种类型，比裸 union 安全（会正确构造析构）。std::get<T>/get<index> 取值（类型不符抛异常），std::visit 用访问者统一处理所有分支。它适合“结果可能是错误或值”这类场景。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <variant>\n\nint main() {\n    std::variant<int, std::string> v;\n    v = 42;\n    std::cout << std::get<int>(v) << \"\\n\";\n    v = std::string(\"hello\");\n    std::cout << std::get<std::string>(v) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"index=\" << v.index() << \"\\n\";\n    std::visit([](const auto& x) { std::cout << \"visit:\" << x << \"\\n\"; }, v);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "42\nhello\nindex=1\nvisit:hello\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "std::get 用了错误的类型会抛 std::bad_variant_access。",
            "variant 默认构造第一个可默认构造的类型，注意别访问错。",
            "std::visit 的访问者要能处理所有备选类型。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 std::holds_alternative 判断当前持有哪种类型。",
              "hint": "holds_alternative<int>(v)。",
              "answer": "字符串时返回 false。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-066",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "stringstream 格式化与解析",
      "summary": "综合用 stringstream 做表格化文本生成与字段解析。",
      "concepts": [
        "stringstream",
        "格式化",
        "解析",
        "分隔符"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-066-lesson",
          "title": "stringstream 格式化与解析",
          "summary": "综合用 stringstream 做表格化文本生成与字段解析。",
          "concepts": [
            "stringstream",
            "格式化",
            "解析",
            "分隔符"
          ],
          "objective": "用 stringstream 生成带分隔符的记录并重新解析。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "stringstream：字符串作为流"
          ],
          "explain": "stringstream 既能组装文本记录，也能按分隔符解析。生成 CSV 风格行时用 << 拼接；解析时用 getline(ss, field, ',') 按逗号切分。它避免了手写字符串切分的边界错误。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <sstream>\n#include <string>\n#include <vector>\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<std::pair<std::string, int>> data = {{\"apple\", 3}, {\"pear\", 5}};\n    std::ostringstream csv;\n    for (const auto& [name, count] : data) csv << name << \",\" << count << \";\";\n    std::string text = csv.str();\n    std::cout << text << \"\\n\";\n\n    std::istringstream in(text);\n    std::string record;\n    int total = 0;\n    while (std::getline(in, record, ';')) {\n        if (record.empty()) continue;\n        std::istringstream rs(record);\n        std::string name, countStr;\n        std::getline(rs, name, ',');\n        std::getline(rs, countStr, ',');\n        total += std::stoi(countStr);\n    }\n    std::cout << \"total=\" << total << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "apple,3;pear,5;\ntotal=8\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "getline 的第三个参数是分隔符；末尾分隔符会产生空记录。",
            "std::stoi 解析失败会抛异常，健壮代码要捕获。",
            "重复用 stringstream 要 clear() 重置状态。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给数据再加一条记录，观察 total 变化。",
              "hint": "在初始化列表里加一项。",
              "answer": "total 增加对应数值。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-067",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "std::error_code 错误处理",
      "summary": "用 error_code 表达可预期的失败，避免异常与哨兵值。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::error_code",
        "错误码",
        "异常 vs 错误码",
        "可预期错误"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-067-lesson",
          "title": "std::error_code 错误处理",
          "summary": "用 error_code 表达可预期的失败，避免异常与哨兵值。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::error_code",
            "错误码",
            "异常 vs 错误码",
            "可预期错误"
          ],
          "objective": "用 error_code 返回可预期的失败并检查。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "多种异常与自定义异常"
          ],
          "explain": "std::error_code 携带错误码和类别，适合“打开文件失败”这类可预期、调用方需要就地处理的错误。异常适合无法就地处理的错误。两者并不互斥：标准库部分接口同时提供 error_code 重载。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <system_error>\n\nstd::error_code divide(int a, int b, int& out) {\n    if (b == 0) return std::make_error_code(std::errc::invalid_argument);\n    out = a / b;\n    return {};\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int result = 0;\n    if (auto ec = divide(10, 2, result)) {\n        std::cout << \"error: \" << ec.message() << \"\\n\";\n    } else {\n        std::cout << \"result=\" << result << \"\\n\";\n    }\n    if (auto ec = divide(1, 0, result)) {\n        std::cout << \"error: \" << ec.message() << \"\\n\";\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "result=5\nerror: Invalid argument\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "error_code 为 0/false 表示成功，注意判断方向。",
            "别把可预期错误也抛异常，反之亦然。",
            "ec.message() 的文本随平台/本地化变化，别依赖精确文本。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个 parse 函数用 error_code 报告非法输入。",
              "hint": "失败返回 errc::invalid_argument。",
              "answer": "合法输入写入 out 并返回空 error_code。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-068",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "const 正确性进阶",
      "summary": "用 mutable、const 重载、返回 const 引用精确表达只读与惰性缓存。",
      "concepts": [
        "mutable",
        "const 重载",
        "const 返回值",
        "惰性求值"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-068-lesson",
          "title": "const 正确性进阶",
          "summary": "用 mutable、const 重载、返回 const 引用精确表达只读与惰性缓存。",
          "concepts": [
            "mutable",
            "const 重载",
            "const 返回值",
            "惰性求值"
          ],
          "objective": "用 mutable 做惰性缓存，用 const 重载区分读写。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "虚函数与动态派发"
          ],
          "explain": "mutable 成员可在 const 成员函数里修改，常用于缓存/计数这类不改变“逻辑状态”的实现细节。operator[] 可同时提供 const（只读）与非 const（可写）重载，const 对象走只读版本。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\nclass Word {\npublic:\n    explicit Word(std::string text) : text_(std::move(text)) {}\n    std::size_t size() const {\n        if (cachedSize_ == 0) {\n            cachedSize_ = text_.size();  // mutable 缓存\n        }\n        return cachedSize_;\n    }\nprivate:\n    std::string text_;\n    mutable std::size_t cachedSize_ = 0;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    const Word w(\"hello\");\n    std::cout << w.size() << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << w.size() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "5\n5\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "mutable 是给实现细节用的，别用它绕过 const 语义去改逻辑状态。",
            "mutable 在多线程下可能引入数据竞争。",
            "返回 const 引用时要确保对象在调用者使用期间存活。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把缓存改成统计 size() 被调用次数并打印。",
              "hint": "用 mutable 计数器。",
              "answer": "第二次调用后计数为 2。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-069",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "类型转换：static_cast 与 dynamic_cast",
      "summary": "用 static_cast 做编译期已知的转换，用 dynamic_cast 做多态下的安全向下转换。",
      "concepts": [
        "static_cast",
        "dynamic_cast",
        "向下转换",
        "RTTI"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-069-lesson",
          "title": "类型转换：static_cast 与 dynamic_cast",
          "summary": "用 static_cast 做编译期已知的转换，用 dynamic_cast 做多态下的安全向下转换。",
          "concepts": [
            "static_cast",
            "dynamic_cast",
            "向下转换",
            "RTTI"
          ],
          "objective": "用 static_cast 与 dynamic_cast 做正确的类型转换。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "虚析构函数"
          ],
          "explain": "static_cast 用于相关类型间的编译期转换（数值、上行转换），不做运行期检查。dynamic_cast 在多态类型间做运行期检查的向下/交叉转换，失败对指针返回 nullptr、对引用抛 bad_cast。C 风格强制转换不安全，应避免。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nclass Base {\npublic:\n    virtual ~Base() = default;\n};\nclass Derived : public Base {\npublic:\n    void hello() const { std::cout << \"derived\\n\"; }\n};\n\nint main() {\n    double d = 3.9;\n    int i = static_cast<int>(d);\n    std::cout << i << \"\\n\";\n    Base* b = new Derived();\n    if (auto* p = dynamic_cast<Derived*>(b)) {\n        p->hello();\n    }\n    Base* plain = new Base();\n    std::cout << (dynamic_cast<Derived*>(plain) == nullptr) << \"\\n\";\n    delete b;\n    delete plain;\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "3\nderived\n1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "static_cast 向下转换不做检查，转错类型是未定义行为。",
            "dynamic_cast 需要基类至少有一个虚函数（多态类型）。",
            "reinterpret_cast 最危险，除底层字节操作外尽量别用。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把 static_cast<int>(3.9) 换成 static_cast<int>(3.2) 观察结果。",
              "hint": "static_cast 对数值是截断而非四舍五入。",
              "answer": "输出 3。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-070",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "friend 与封装边界",
      "summary": "用 friend 有选择地授权访问，理解它不破坏封装而是显式化耦合。",
      "concepts": [
        "friend",
        "访问控制",
        "运算符友元",
        "耦合"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-070-lesson",
          "title": "friend 与封装边界",
          "summary": "用 friend 有选择地授权访问，理解它不破坏封装而是显式化耦合。",
          "concepts": [
            "friend",
            "访问控制",
            "运算符友元",
            "耦合"
          ],
          "objective": "用 friend 让非成员函数或类访问私有成员。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "类与封装"
          ],
          "explain": "friend 声明授予某个函数或类访问私有成员的权限。它常用于让非成员的operator<< 访问私有字段。friend 是白名单式授权，比把所有成员设为 public 更精确；但过度使用会暴露实现，慎用。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nclass Account {\npublic:\n    explicit Account(int balance) : balance_(balance) {}\n    friend bool richer(const Account& a, const Account& b);\nprivate:\n    int balance_;\n};\n\nbool richer(const Account& a, const Account& b) {\n    return a.balance_ > b.balance_;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    Account a(100);\n    Account b(200);\n    std::cout << richer(a, b) << \" \" << richer(b, a) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "0 1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "friend 不是双向的，也不是传递的。",
            "能通过公有接口表达就别用 friend。",
            "friend 声明要写在使用前。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "让 richer 返回两者余额之和，观察需要哪些访问权限。",
              "hint": "同一 friend 声明即可访问双方私有字段。",
              "answer": "需要访问两个对象的 balance_，friend 已授权。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-071",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "RAII 与作用域守卫",
      "summary": "用 RAII 对象管理任意资源，实现自动清理与作用域守卫。",
      "concepts": [
        "RAII",
        "作用域守卫",
        "资源管理",
        "异常安全"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-071-lesson",
          "title": "RAII 与作用域守卫",
          "summary": "用 RAII 对象管理任意资源，实现自动清理与作用域守卫。",
          "concepts": [
            "RAII",
            "作用域守卫",
            "资源管理",
            "异常安全"
          ],
          "objective": "用一个 RAII 守卫对象在作用域结束时执行清理。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "析构函数与 RAII"
          ],
          "explain": "RAII 不止用于内存：文件句柄、锁、临时状态都可以交给析构函数管理。作用域守卫（scope guard）在构造时记录一个收尾动作、析构时执行它，即使中途 return 或抛异常也能保证清理，是异常安全的基石。",
          "code": "#include <functional>\n#include <iostream>\n\nclass ScopeGuard {\npublic:\n    explicit ScopeGuard(std::function<void()> action) : action_(std::move(action)) {}\n    ~ScopeGuard() { if (action_) action_(); }\n    ScopeGuard(const ScopeGuard&) = delete;\n    ScopeGuard& operator=(const ScopeGuard&) = delete;\nprivate:\n    std::function<void()> action_;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << \"enter\\n\";\n    ScopeGuard guard([] { std::cout << \"cleanup\\n\"; });\n    std::cout << \"working\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "enter\nworking\ncleanup\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "守卫不可拷贝（否则清理会执行多次），用引用/移动传递。",
            "析构里不要抛异常。",
            "需要“取消”语义时提供 release()。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "在 guard 之后提前 return，观察 cleanup 是否仍执行。",
              "hint": "析构在作用域退出时总会运行。",
              "answer": "仍会输出 cleanup。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-072",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "自定义迭代器",
      "summary": "为自定义容器实现迭代器，使其能配合范围循环与标准算法。",
      "concepts": [
        "迭代器",
        "begin/end",
        "范围循环",
        "算法兼容"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-072-lesson",
          "title": "自定义迭代器",
          "summary": "为自定义容器实现迭代器，使其能配合范围循环与标准算法。",
          "concepts": [
            "迭代器",
            "begin/end",
            "范围循环",
            "算法兼容"
          ],
          "objective": "为一个简单容器实现最小迭代器并用于范围循环。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "迭代器基础"
          ],
          "explain": "一个最小迭代器需要支持 *（解引用）、++（前进）、== / !=（比较）。有了 begin()/end() 返回迭代器，自定义容器就能用于范围循环和标准算法。完整实现还要提供迭代器类别别名以兼容更多算法。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\nclass Range {\npublic:\n    class iterator {\n    public:\n        explicit iterator(int v) : value_(v) {}\n        int operator*() const { return value_; }\n        iterator& operator++() { ++value_; return *this; }\n        bool operator!=(const iterator& o) const { return value_ != o.value_; }\n    private:\n        int value_;\n    };\n    explicit Range(int n) : n_(n) {}\n    iterator begin() const { return iterator(0); }\n    iterator end() const { return iterator(n_); }\nprivate:\n    int n_;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    int sum = 0;\n    for (int x : Range(5)) sum += x;\n    std::cout << \"sum=\" << sum << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "sum=10\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "迭代器要能被标准库识别需要提供迭代器类别（iterator_category）。",
            "end() 迭代器不能解引用。",
            "范围循环需要 begin()/end() 返回的迭代器类型一致。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "让 Range 支持步长参数 Range(start, end, step)。",
              "hint": "迭代器 ++ 时加 step。",
              "answer": "Range(0,10,2) 遍历 0 2 4 6 8。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-073",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "用断言做单元测试",
      "summary": "用简单断言组织可运行的单元测试，建立回归保护。",
      "concepts": [
        "单元测试",
        "断言",
        "回归",
        "测试驱动"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-073-lesson",
          "title": "用断言做单元测试",
          "summary": "用简单断言组织可运行的单元测试，建立回归保护。",
          "concepts": [
            "单元测试",
            "断言",
            "回归",
            "测试驱动"
          ],
          "objective": "为函数编写一组断言式测试并在主程序里运行。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "使用断言与调试"
          ],
          "explain": "在缺少测试框架时，可以用断言组织最小单元测试：为每个被测函数写若干边界用例，用 assert 校验，全部通过则程序正常结束、返回 0。这能在重构时快速发现问题。真实项目会引入 Catch2/GoogleTest。",
          "code": "#include <cassert>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n\nint fibonacci(int n) {\n    if (n < 2) return n;\n    int a = 0, b = 1;\n    for (int i = 2; i <= n; ++i) { int c = a + b; a = b; b = c; }\n    return b;\n}\n\nvoid runTests() {\n    assert(fibonacci(0) == 0);\n    assert(fibonacci(1) == 1);\n    assert(fibonacci(10) == 55);\n}\n\nint main() {\n    runTests();\n    std::cout << \"all tests passed\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "all tests passed\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "assert 在 NDEBUG 下被移除，正式测试要用专门的框架。",
            "断言里不要写有副作用的表达式。",
            "测试要覆盖边界值（0、1、负数）而非只有典型值。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "为 fibonacci 增加一个边界测试 fibonacci(2) == 1。",
              "hint": "加一条 assert。",
              "answer": "断言通过，程序仍输出 all tests passed。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
