      "id": "cpp-tutorial-074",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "编译与构建入门",
      "summary": "理解编译、汇编、链接的流程与常见构建错误。",
      "concepts": [
        "编译流程",
        "链接",
        "符号",
        "头文件依赖"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-074-lesson",
          "title": "编译与构建入门",
          "summary": "理解编译、汇编、链接的流程与常见构建错误。",
          "concepts": [
            "编译流程",
            "链接",
            "符号",
            "头文件依赖"
          ],
          "objective": "解释一次编译链接的各个阶段与典型错误来源。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "头文件、inline 与编译链接"
          ],
          "explain": "C++ 构建分预处理、编译、汇编、链接四步。常见错误：预处理阶段找不到头文件；编译阶段语法/类型错误；链接阶段“undefined reference”（缺定义）或“multiple definition”（重复定义）。理解阶段能快速定位错误性质。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\n// 声明（通常来自头文件）\nint compute(int x);\n\n// 定义（通常来自另一个 .cpp）\nint compute(int x) { return x * 2; }\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << compute(21) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "42\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "只声明未定义会在链接期报 undefined reference。",
            "在头文件里定义非 inline 函数会导致 multiple definition。",
            "编译通过但链接失败通常意味着符号缺失或重复。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "删除 compute 的定义，观察链接错误。",
              "hint": "只留声明会报 undefined reference to compute(int)。",
              "answer": "链接失败，提示 undefined reference。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-075",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "综合练习：库存管理",
      "summary": "综合运用类、容器、算法与错误处理完成一个小型库存系统。",
      "concepts": [
        "综合",
        "类设计",
        "map",
        "算法"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-075-lesson",
          "title": "综合练习：库存管理",
          "summary": "综合运用类、容器、算法与错误处理完成一个小型库存系统。",
          "concepts": [
            "综合",
            "类设计",
            "map",
            "算法"
          ],
          "objective": "把类、容器、算法与错误处理组合成一个小型系统。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::map：有序键值表",
            "std::optional 入门"
          ],
          "explain": "这一课把类封装、unordered_map 统计、optional 表达缺失、算法与格式化输出组合起来：实现一个库存，支持入库、出库（余额不足返回失败）、查询与汇总。它体现“数据 + 操作 + 明确失败”的中等规模设计思路。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <optional>\n#include <string>\n#include <unordered_map>\n\nclass Inventory {\npublic:\n    void add(const std::string& item, int count) { items_[item] += count; }\n    std::optional<int> remove(const std::string& item, int count) {\n        auto it = items_.find(item);\n        if (it == items_.end() || it->second < count) return std::nullopt;\n        it->second -= count;\n        return it->second;\n    }\n    int total() const {\n        int sum = 0;\n        for (const auto& [item, count] : items_) sum += count;\n        return sum;\n    }\nprivate:\n    std::unordered_map<std::string, int> items_;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Inventory inv;\n    inv.add(\"apple\", 10);\n    inv.add(\"pear\", 5);\n    if (auto left = inv.remove(\"apple\", 3)) {\n        std::cout << \"apple left \" << *left << \"\\n\";\n    }\n    if (!inv.remove(\"pear\", 100)) {\n        std::cout << \"pear insufficient\\n\";\n    }\n    std::cout << \"total=\" << inv.total() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "apple left 7\npear insufficient\ntotal=12\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "remove 返回 optional 让“不足”与“数量”都用同一通道表达。",
            "unordered_map 遍历无序，需要稳定顺序时用 map。",
            "整数计数溢出在真实系统中要额外处理。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "增加一种商品并实现按名称查询剩余数量。",
              "hint": "加一个 count(item) 返回 optional<int>。",
              "answer": "查询存在的商品返回数量，不存在返回 nullopt。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
