      "id": "cpp-tutorial-076",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "类型特征 type_traits",
      "summary": "用 <type_traits> 在编译期查询和变换类型。",
      "concepts": [
        "type_traits",
        "is_integral",
        "enable_if",
        "编译期分支"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-076-lesson",
          "title": "类型特征 type_traits",
          "summary": "用 <type_traits> 在编译期查询和变换类型。",
          "concepts": [
            "type_traits",
            "is_integral",
            "enable_if",
            "编译期分支"
          ],
          "objective": "用类型特征在编译期做类型判断与条件实例化。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "模板特化"
          ],
          "explain": "<type_traits> 提供 is_integral、is_floating_point、is_same、remove_reference 等编译期类型查询与变换。它们配合 if constexpr 或 SFINAE 实现按类型选择实现。类型特征是模板元编程与泛型库的基础设施。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <type_traits>\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nvoid describe() {\n    if constexpr (std::is_integral_v<T>) {\n        std::cout << \"integral\\n\";\n    } else if constexpr (std::is_floating_point_v<T>) {\n        std::cout << \"floating point\\n\";\n    } else {\n        std::cout << \"other\\n\";\n    }\n}\n\nint main() {\n    describe<int>();\n    describe<double>();\n    describe<char*>();\n    std::cout << std::is_same_v<int, int> << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "integral\nfloating point\nother\n1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "if constexpr 是编译期分支，未选中分支也会被解析但不会实例化。",
            "用 _v 后缀变体（is_integral_v）更简洁。",
            "类型特征是编译期常量，不要用运行期 if。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 std::remove_reference_t<int&> 打印类型是否与 int 相同。",
              "hint": "配合 std::is_same_v。",
              "answer": "is_same_v<remove_reference_t<int&>, int> 为 1。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-077",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "可变参数模板与折叠表达式",
      "summary": "用可变参数模板接受任意数量参数，用折叠表达式统一处理。",
      "concepts": [
        "可变参数模板",
        "parameter pack",
        "折叠表达式",
        "C++17"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-077-lesson",
          "title": "可变参数模板与折叠表达式",
          "summary": "用可变参数模板接受任意数量参数，用折叠表达式统一处理。",
          "concepts": [
            "可变参数模板",
            "parameter pack",
            "折叠表达式",
            "C++17"
          ],
          "objective": "编写可变参数函数并用折叠表达式求和。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "类型特征 type_traits"
          ],
          "explain": "模板参数包（typename... Ts）和函数参数包（Ts... args）让函数接受任意数量参数。C++17 的折叠表达式 (args + ...) 把包展开为连续的运算符序列，简洁地实现求和、打印等聚合。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\ntemplate <typename... Ts>\nauto sum(Ts... args) { return (args + ...); }\n\ntemplate <typename... Ts>\nvoid printAll(const Ts&... args) {\n    ((std::cout << args << \" \"), ...);\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n}\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << sum(1, 2, 3, 4) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << sum(1.5, 2.5) << \"\\n\";\n    printAll(\"a\", 1, 2.5);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "10\n4\na 1 2.5 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "空参数包时折叠表达式需要初值（0 + ... + args）。",
            "折叠的运算符优先级与结合性要看清左折/右折。",
            "混用不同类型时推导出的返回类型可能出乎意料。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "写一个 countArgs() 返回参数个数。",
              "hint": "return sizeof...(Ts);",
              "answer": "countArgs(1,2,3) 返回 3。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-078",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "concepts：C++20 约束",
      "summary": "用 concept 为模板参数声明语义约束，得到清晰的编译错误。",
      "concepts": [
        "concept",
        "requires",
        "C++20",
        "约束"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-078-lesson",
          "title": "concepts：C++20 约束",
          "summary": "用 concept 为模板参数声明语义约束，得到清晰的编译错误。",
          "concepts": [
            "concept",
            "requires",
            "C++20",
            "约束"
          ],
          "objective": "定义 concept 并约束模板参数。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "可变参数模板与折叠表达式"
          ],
          "explain": "C++20 的 concept 为一组类型要求命名，既能约束模板参数、又能在错误信息里给出人类可读的约束名。std::integral、std::floating_point 等标准 concept 可直接使用。它是取代笨重 SFINAE 的现代方式。",
          "code": "#include <concepts>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\ntemplate <std::integral T>\nT twice(T x) { return x * 2; }\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nconcept Printable = requires(T x) { std::cout << x; };\n\ntemplate <Printable T>\nvoid show(const T& x) { std::cout << x << \"\\n\"; }\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << twice(21) << \"\\n\";\n    show(42);\n    show(std::string(\"hi\"));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "42\n42\nhi\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "concept 需要 C++20 及支持它的编译器（WSL clang 18 / g++ 13 可用）。",
            "requires 表达式只检查表达式是否合法，不检查语义。",
            "约束越精确，错误信息越友好，但可复用性可能下降。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "定义 concept Addable，约束两种类型可相加。",
              "hint": "requires(T a, U b) { a + b; }",
              "answer": "Addable<int,double> 满足，Addable<int,void*> 不满足。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-079",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "requires 子句与重载选择",
      "summary": "用 requires 子句让重载按类型能力自动选择。",
      "concepts": [
        "requires 子句",
        "重载解析",
        "约束偏序",
        "能力选择"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-079-lesson",
          "title": "requires 子句与重载选择",
          "summary": "用 requires 子句让重载按类型能力自动选择。",
          "concepts": [
            "requires 子句",
            "重载解析",
            "约束偏序",
            "能力选择"
          ],
          "objective": "用 requires 子句实现按能力分派的重载。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "concepts：C++20 约束"
          ],
          "explain": "requires 子句跟在模板后约束该重载何时可用。多个重载都可行时，编译器选择约束更强（更特化）的那个，这叫约束偏序。它让“能加就用加法、否则用拼接”这类分派变得声明式。",
          "code": "#include <concepts>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nrequires std::integral<T>\nT combine(T a, T b) { return a + b; }\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nrequires (!std::integral<T>)\nT combine(const T& a, const T& b) { return a + b; }\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << combine(3, 4) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << combine(std::string(\"foo\"), std::string(\"bar\")) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "7\nfoobar\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "requires 子句里的表达式必须只依赖模板参数。",
            "多个重载都不满足或都同样特化会产生歧义。",
            "约束应表达语义意图，而不只是语法可用。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "再加一个针对浮点的 combine 实现并观察选择。",
              "hint": "requires std::floating_point<T>。",
              "answer": "浮点调用会命中浮点重载。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-080",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "完美转发",
      "summary": "用转发引用与 std::forward 保持实参的值类别与常量性。",
      "concepts": [
        "转发引用",
        "std::forward",
        "值类别",
        "包装函数"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-080-lesson",
          "title": "完美转发",
          "summary": "用转发引用与 std::forward 保持实参的值类别与常量性。",
          "concepts": [
            "转发引用",
            "std::forward",
            "值类别",
            "包装函数"
          ],
          "objective": "编写把实参原样转发给下层函数的包装函数。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "requires 子句与重载选择"
          ],
          "explain": "T&& 在模板推导中成为转发引用：传左值时 T 推导为左值引用，传右值时推导为非引用。std::forward<T>(arg) 按原值类别转发，左值仍为左值、右值仍为右值，从而让被包装函数正确选择拷贝或移动。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <utility>\n\nvoid sink(const std::string& s) { std::cout << \"copy: \" << s << \"\\n\"; }\nvoid sink(std::string&& s) { std::cout << \"move: \" << s << \"\\n\"; }\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nvoid wrapper(T&& arg) { sink(std::forward<T>(arg)); }\n\nint main() {\n    std::string a = \"hello\";\n    wrapper(a);\n    wrapper(std::string(\"world\"));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "copy: hello\nmove: world\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "转发引用要求形如 T&& 且 T 是推导出来的模板参数。",
            "转发后不要再用被移动的对象。",
            "std::forward 与 std::move 不同：前者保留值类别，后者强制右值。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 wrapper 包装一个只接 const& 的函数，观察是否仍能编译。",
              "hint": "转发会保持左值性。",
              "answer": "能编译，const& 版本被选中。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-081",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "值类别：左值与右值",
      "summary": "区分 lvalue/xvalue/prvalue，理解移动与绑定的前提。",
      "concepts": [
        "值类别",
        "lvalue",
        "rvalue",
        "decltype"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-081-lesson",
          "title": "值类别：左值与右值",
          "summary": "区分 lvalue/xvalue/prvalue，理解移动与绑定的前提。",
          "concepts": [
            "值类别",
            "lvalue",
            "rvalue",
            "decltype"
          ],
          "objective": "判断表达式的值类别并解释移动发生的条件。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "完美转发"
          ],
          "explain": "值类别刻画表达式的“身份”和“可移动性”：左值有名字、可取地址；右值（纯右值/将亡值）通常是临时或即将销毁的对象。移动只在绑定到右值时发生。理解值类别是看懂移动/转发/重载选择的关键。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <type_traits>\n#include <utility>\n\nint main() {\n    int a = 1;\n    std::cout << std::is_lvalue_reference_v<decltype((a))> << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << std::is_rvalue_reference_v<decltype((std::move(a)))> << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << std::is_lvalue_reference_v<decltype((1 + 2))> << \"\\n\";\n    int&& r = 5;\n    std::cout << r << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1\n1\n0\n5\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "具名的右值引用变量本身是左值（r 可被取地址）。",
            "decltype((x)) 与 decltype(x) 不同：前者是引用类型。",
            "返回局部变量的 std::move 会阻止拷贝省略，反而更慢。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "打印 decltype((std::move(a))) 是否与 int&& 相同。",
              "hint": "用 is_same_v。",
              "answer": "is_same_v<decltype((std::move(a))), int&&> 为 1。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-082",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "SFINAE 到 concepts 的演进",
      "summary": "理解 SFINAE 的历史做法，以及 concepts 如何取代它。",
      "concepts": [
        "SFINAE",
        "enable_if",
        "替换失败",
        "演化"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-082-lesson",
          "title": "SFINAE 到 concepts 的演进",
          "summary": "理解 SFINAE 的历史做法，以及 concepts 如何取代它。",
          "concepts": [
            "SFINAE",
            "enable_if",
            "替换失败",
            "演化"
          ],
          "objective": "解释 SFINAE 原理并对比 concepts 的可读性优势。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "值类别：左值与右值"
          ],
          "explain": "SFINAE（替换失败并非错误）允许通过让某些模板在参数不满足时“无声失败”来筛选重载，典型是 std::enable_if。它强大但难以阅读与调试。concepts 用声明式约束表达同样意图，错误信息清晰得多，是 C++20 的推荐做法。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <type_traits>\n\n// 老式 SFINAE：只有整型才启用\ntemplate <typename T>\nstd::enable_if_t<std::is_integral_v<T>, T> oldDouble(T x) { return x * 2; }\n\n// 现代 concepts 等价写法（见前几课）\ntemplate <typename T>\nrequires std::is_integral_v<T>\nT newDouble(T x) { return x * 2; }\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << oldDouble(5) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << newDouble(5) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "10\n10\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "SFINAE 只在“直接上下文”的替换失败中生效，函数体内的错误仍是硬错误。",
            "enable_if 的写法难读，新代码优先用 concepts。",
            "不要把 SFINAE 用在只想做运行期判断的地方。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 oldDouble 传一个 double，观察编译错误信息。",
              "hint": "SFINAE 会让重载被移除，报“没有匹配的重载”。",
              "answer": "编译器报找不到匹配函数，错误信息不如 concept 清晰。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-083",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "CRTP：奇异递归模板模式",
      "summary": "用派生类把自己作为模板参数传给基类，实现静态多态。",
      "concepts": [
        "CRTP",
        "静态多态",
        "混入",
        "编译期分派"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-083-lesson",
          "title": "CRTP：奇异递归模板模式",
          "summary": "用派生类把自己作为模板参数传给基类，实现静态多态。",
          "concepts": [
            "CRTP",
            "静态多态",
            "混入",
            "编译期分派"
          ],
          "objective": "用 CRTP 让基类调用派生类的实现而无需虚函数。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "SFINAE 到 concepts 的演进"
          ],
          "explain": "CRTP 让 Derived 继承 Base<Derived>，基类通过 static_cast<Derived*>(this) 调用派生实现。没有虚函数、没有运行期开销，是编译期多态。常用于接口注入、计数等混入（mixin）。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n\ntemplate <typename Derived>\nclass Shape {\npublic:\n    double area() const { return static_cast<const Derived*>(this)->areaImpl(); }\n};\n\nclass Square : public Shape<Square> {\npublic:\n    explicit Square(double s) : side_(s) {}\n    double areaImpl() const { return side_ * side_; }\nprivate:\n    double side_;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Square s(3.0);\n    std::cout << s.area() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "9\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "CRTP 是编译期绑定，不能通过基类指针多态使用。",
            "派生类名必须在实例化时已知，因此不能跨翻译单元拆分得过于随意。",
            "areaImpl 需要 public 或基类为 friend。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "再加一个 Circle 派生类，验证 CRTP 静态分派。",
              "hint": "实现 areaImpl 返回 πr²。",
              "answer": "Circle(1).area() 约为 3.14159。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-084",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "策略式设计",
      "summary": "把行为抽象成策略模板参数，在编译期组合出不同变体。",
      "concepts": [
        "策略模式",
        "模板参数",
        "零开销抽象",
        "组合"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-084-lesson",
          "title": "策略式设计",
          "summary": "把行为抽象成策略模板参数，在编译期组合出不同变体。",
          "concepts": [
            "策略模式",
            "模板参数",
            "零开销抽象",
            "组合"
          ],
          "objective": "用策略模板参数在编译期选择算法。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "CRTP：奇异递归模板模式"
          ],
          "explain": "策略式设计把可替换的行为（如比较、舍入、日志）作为模板参数传入，编译器为每种组合生成专用代码，没有运行期分支或虚调用开销。它是标准库（如容器的比较器、分配器）使用的核心手法。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n\nstruct Ascending { static bool before(int a, int b) { return a < b; } };\nstruct Descending { static bool before(int a, int b) { return a > b; } };\n\ntemplate <typename Order>\nvoid sortAndPrint(std::vector<int> v) {\n    for (std::size_t i = 0; i + 1 < v.size(); ++i)\n        for (std::size_t j = 0; j + 1 < v.size() - i; ++j)\n            if (Order::before(v[j + 1], v[j])) std::swap(v[j], v[j + 1]);\n    for (int x : v) std::cout << x << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n}\n\nint main() {\n    sortAndPrint<Ascending>({3, 1, 2});\n    sortAndPrint<Descending>({3, 1, 2});\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1 2 3 \n3 2 1 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "策略组合会带来代码膨胀（每种组合一份实例）。",
            "策略接口应尽量小且无状态。",
            "运行期才决定策略时应改用虚函数或多态。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "加一个按绝对值排序的策略。",
              "hint": "before 比较 abs 值。",
              "answer": "{-3,1,2} 按绝对值排为 1 2 -3。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-085",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "类型擦除",
      "summary": "用统一接口隐藏具体类型，保留运行期灵活性。",
      "concepts": [
        "类型擦除",
        "概念建模",
        "多态包装",
        "std::function 原理"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-085-lesson",
          "title": "类型擦除",
          "summary": "用统一接口隐藏具体类型，保留运行期灵活性。",
          "concepts": [
            "类型擦除",
            "概念建模",
            "多态包装",
            "std::function 原理"
          ],
          "objective": "手写一个简单的类型擦除容器，理解 std::function 的内部原理。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "策略式设计"
          ],
          "explain": "类型擦除把“不同类型但接口一致”的对象包装到统一类型后面，通常结合虚函数与模板构造：模板构造函数把具体类型存进内部多态对象。std::function、std::any 都是这个套路。它用一点运行期开销换取灵活性。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <memory>\n#include <string>\n\nclass AnyPrinter {\npublic:\n    template <typename T>\n    explicit AnyPrinter(T value)\n        : impl_(std::make_unique<Model<T>>(std::move(value))) {}\n    void print() const { impl_->print(); }\nprivate:\n    struct Concept {\n        virtual ~Concept() = default;\n        virtual void print() const = 0;\n    };\n    template <typename T>\n    struct Model : Concept {\n        explicit Model(T v) : value_(std::move(v)) {}\n        void print() const override { std::cout << value_ << \"\\n\"; }\n        T value_;\n    };\n    std::unique_ptr<Concept> impl_;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    AnyPrinter a(42);\n    AnyPrinter b(std::string(\"hi\"));\n    a.print();\n    b.print();\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "42\nhi\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "类型擦除引入间接调用与可能的堆分配。",
            "Model 可能被拷贝，注意大对象用移动。",
            "接口（Concept）要覆盖所有需要擦除的操作。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 AnyPrinter 加一个描述长度的 name() 方法。",
              "hint": "在 Concept 里加虚函数，Model 里实现。",
              "answer": "不同 Value 返回各自的长度描述。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-086",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "自定义分配器",
      "summary": "为容器提供自定义内存分配策略，观察分配次数。",
      "concepts": [
        "allocator",
        "内存分配",
        "allocate/deallocate",
        "计数"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-086-lesson",
          "title": "自定义分配器",
          "summary": "为容器提供自定义内存分配策略，观察分配次数。",
          "concepts": [
            "allocator",
            "内存分配",
            "allocate/deallocate",
            "计数"
          ],
          "objective": "写一个记录分配次数的简单分配器并用于容器。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "类型擦除"
          ],
          "explain": "分配器把“如何获取内存”从容器中分离。容器通过 allocator_traits 调用allocate/deallocate。自定义分配器可用于内存池、统计、对齐等。现代分配器只需提供 value_type、allocate、deallocate 和相等比较。",
          "code": "#include <cstddef>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <memory>\n#include <vector>\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nstruct CountingAllocator {\n    using value_type = T;\n    CountingAllocator() = default;\n    template <typename U>\n    CountingAllocator(const CountingAllocator<U>&) {}\n    T* allocate(std::size_t n) {\n        ++allocations;\n        return static_cast<T*>(::operator new(n * sizeof(T)));\n    }\n    void deallocate(T* p, std::size_t) { ::operator delete(p); }\n    static inline int allocations = 0;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<int, CountingAllocator<int>> v;\n    for (int i = 0; i < 100; ++i) v.push_back(i);\n    std::cout << \"size=\" << v.size() << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"allocations>0=\" << (CountingAllocator<int>::allocations > 0) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "size=100\nallocations>0=1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "分配器要满足 allocator_traits 的要求（含相等比较、rebind）。",
            "allocate 返回的未初始化内存要用 placement new 构造对象。",
            "分配器在容器间要能比较是否等价。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "预留容量后观察分配次数是否减少。",
              "hint": "使用 v.reserve(100)。",
              "answer": "reserve 后分配次数降为 1 次。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-087",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "std::span：非拥有视图",
      "summary": "用 std::span 以零拷贝方式表示连续区间，替代指针+长度。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::span",
        "非拥有视图",
        "连续内存",
        "C++20"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-087-lesson",
          "title": "std::span：非拥有视图",
          "summary": "用 std::span 以零拷贝方式表示连续区间，替代指针+长度。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::span",
            "非拥有视图",
            "连续内存",
            "C++20"
          ],
          "objective": "用 span 传递数组/容器的一部分而不拷贝。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "自定义分配器"
          ],
          "explain": "std::span<T> 是对连续内存的非拥有视图，等价于“指针 + 长度”的安全封装。它能统一接收数组、vector、array 的片段，函数签名更清晰、也不丢长度。它是 C++20 引入的 view 类型之一。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <span>\n#include <vector>\n\nint sum(std::span<const int> data) {\n    int total = 0;\n    for (int x : data) total += x;\n    return total;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int raw[] = {1, 2, 3};\n    std::vector<int> v = {4, 5, 6, 7};\n    std::cout << sum(raw) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << sum(v) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << sum(std::span(v).subspan(1, 2)) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "6\n22\n11\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "span 不拥有数据，底层容器销毁后悬空。",
            "span 只适用于连续内存（list 不能用）。",
            "span 的 size 不检查，越界访问是未定义行为。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 span 只对 v 的前两个元素求和。",
              "hint": "std::span(v).first(2)。",
              "answer": "返回 9。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-088",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "ranges 管道",
      "summary": "用 views 组合出惰性、可读的数据变换管道。",
      "concepts": [
        "views",
        "管道",
        "惰性求值",
        "filter/transform/take"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-088-lesson",
          "title": "ranges 管道",
          "summary": "用 views 组合出惰性、可读的数据变换管道。",
          "concepts": [
            "views",
            "管道",
            "惰性求值",
            "filter/transform/take"
          ],
          "objective": "用 views 管道筛选、变换并取前 N 个元素。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::span：非拥有视图"
          ],
          "explain": "ranges views 是惰性的、可组合的视图：filter 筛选、transform 变换、take 取前 N 个，用 | 连接成管道。每个元素只有在被遍历时才计算，避免中间容器。它让数据处理像写查询一样声明式。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <ranges>\n#include <vector>\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<int> v = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6};\n    auto pipeline = v\n        | std::views::filter([](int x) { return x % 2 == 0; })\n        | std::views::transform([](int x) { return x * x; });\n    for (int x : pipeline) std::cout << x << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    for (int x : pipeline | std::views::take(2)) std::cout << x << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "4 16 36 \n4 16 \n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "view 不拥有数据，绑定的容器必须比 view 活得久。",
            "view 每次遍历都会重新计算（除非缓存），注意性能。",
            "C++20 的 views 支持需要较新的标准库（WSL clang 18 / g++ 13 可用）。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "改成奇数并取平方，打印前三个。",
              "hint": "filter x%2!=0，再 take(3)。",
              "answer": "输出 1 9 25。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-089",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "三路比较运算符 <=>",
      "summary": "用 C++20 的三路比较自动获得一致的 <、>、<=、>=、== 语义。",
      "concepts": [
        "operator<=>",
        "三路比较",
        "C++20",
        "比较一致性"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-089-lesson",
          "title": "三路比较运算符 <=>",
          "summary": "用 C++20 的三路比较自动获得一致的 <、>、<=、>=、== 语义。",
          "concepts": [
            "operator<=>",
            "三路比较",
            "C++20",
            "比较一致性"
          ],
          "objective": "用 <=> 为一个类型定义完整且一致的比较语义。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "ranges 管道"
          ],
          "explain": "C++20 的三路比较运算符 <=>（spaceship）一次定义就能让编译器推导出==、!=、<、<=、>、>= 的关系。返回 std::strong_ordering 表达“小于/相等/大于”。它消除了手写六个比较运算符容易产生的不一致。\n附：C++20 也引入了协程（co_await/co_yield）作为无栈协程机制，但协程需要完整的 promise 类型与较新的标准库支持，跨 libstdc++/libc++ 实现差异较大，因此本课的配套示例选用可稳定运行的三路比较，协程仅作概念介绍。",
          "code": "#include <compare>\n#include <iostream>\n\nstruct Version {\n    int major;\n    int minor;\n    auto operator<=>(const Version&) const = default;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Version a{1, 2};\n    Version b{1, 3};\n    std::cout << (a < b) << \" \" << (a == b) << \" \" << (a > b) << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << (a <=> b == 0) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1 0 0\n0\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "auto operator<=>() = default 会逐成员比较，要求成员都可比较。",
            "浮点成员用 default 比较会得到 weak_ordering，与 NaN 语义有关。",
            "需要自定义时返回类型要用 std::strong_ordering/partial_ordering。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "再加一个 patch 字段，观察比较仍自动正确。",
              "hint": "default 的三路比较会依次比较 major、minor、patch。",
              "answer": "新增字段后比较仍按声明顺序生效。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-090",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "std::thread 与 join",
      "summary": "用 std::thread 启动并发任务，用 join 等待其结束。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::thread",
        "join",
        "并发",
        "确定性输出"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-090-lesson",
          "title": "std::thread 与 join",
          "summary": "用 std::thread 启动并发任务，用 join 等待其结束。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::thread",
            "join",
            "并发",
            "确定性输出"
          ],
          "objective": "启动线程处理独立任务并正确 join。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "三路比较运算符 <=>"
          ],
          "explain": "std::thread 构造时启动一个新线程执行可调用对象。主线程必须 join（等待）或 detach 线程，否则析构时若仍可 join 会 terminate。本课让每个线程把结果写入自己的槽位，最后主线程汇总，从而输出确定。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <thread>\n#include <vector>\n\nint main() {\n    const int n = 4;\n    std::vector<int> results(n, 0);\n    std::vector<std::thread> workers;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {\n        workers.emplace_back([i, &results] { results[i] = (i + 1) * (i + 1); });\n    }\n    for (auto& t : workers) t.join();\n    int sum = 0;\n    for (int x : results) sum += x;\n    std::cout << \"sum=\" << sum << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "sum=30\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "忘记 join/detach 会在析构时 terminate。",
            "多个线程写同一变量要同步，否则数据竞争是未定义行为。",
            "本课用“每个线程写自己的下标”避免竞争，得到确定结果。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把 n 改成 5，观察 sum。",
              "hint": "sum = 1²+2²+3²+4²+5²。",
              "answer": "sum=55。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-091",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "互斥量与条件变量",
      "summary": "用 mutex 保护共享数据，用 condition_variable 协调线程节奏。",
      "concepts": [
        "mutex",
        "lock_guard",
        "condition_variable",
        "生产者消费者"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-091-lesson",
          "title": "互斥量与条件变量",
          "summary": "用 mutex 保护共享数据，用 condition_variable 协调线程节奏。",
          "concepts": [
            "mutex",
            "lock_guard",
            "condition_variable",
            "生产者消费者"
          ],
          "objective": "用锁保护共享计数器，用条件变量等待条件成立。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "std::thread 与 join"
          ],
          "explain": "std::mutex 保证同一时刻只有一个线程进入临界区；lock_guard/unique_lock 用 RAII 自动加解锁。condition_variable 让线程在条件不满足时休眠、条件满足时被唤醒，是生产者-消费者模型的基础。",
          "code": "#include <condition_variable>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <mutex>\n#include <queue>\n#include <thread>\n\nint main() {\n    std::mutex m;\n    std::condition_variable cv;\n    std::queue<int> q;\n    bool done = false;\n    int total = 0;\n\n    std::thread producer([&] {\n        for (int i = 1; i <= 5; ++i) {\n            {\n                std::lock_guard<std::mutex> lock(m);\n                q.push(i);\n            }\n            cv.notify_one();\n        }\n        {\n            std::lock_guard<std::mutex> lock(m);\n            done = true;\n        }\n        cv.notify_one();\n    });\n\n    std::thread consumer([&] {\n        while (true) {\n            std::unique_lock<std::mutex> lock(m);\n            cv.wait(lock, [&] { return !q.empty() || done; });\n            if (q.empty() && done) break;\n            total += q.front();\n            q.pop();\n        }\n    });\n\n    producer.join();\n    consumer.join();\n    std::cout << \"total=\" << total << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "total=15\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "条件变量的 wait 必须带谓词，避免虚假唤醒。",
            "notify 时不必持锁（可以持，但通常在临界区外）。",
            "忘记在 done 后也 notify 会让消费者永久等待。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把生产者的范围改成 1..10，观察 total。",
              "hint": "sum(1..10)=55。",
              "answer": "total=55。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-092",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "原子操作与内存序",
      "summary": "用 std::atomic 做无数据竞争的计数，理解常见内存序。",
      "concepts": [
        "std::atomic",
        "memory_order",
        "无锁",
        "数据竞争"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-092-lesson",
          "title": "原子操作与内存序",
          "summary": "用 std::atomic 做无数据竞争的计数，理解常见内存序。",
          "concepts": [
            "std::atomic",
            "memory_order",
            "无锁",
            "数据竞争"
          ],
          "objective": "用 atomic 实现线程安全计数并解释 relaxed 的用途。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "互斥量与条件变量"
          ],
          "explain": "std::atomic<T> 提供原子读写，避免数据竞争。fetch_add 是原子的读改写。memory_order_relaxed 只保证原子性、不规定顺序，适合独立计数；默认 seq_cst 最强也最慢。正确选择内存序需要理解 happens-before。",
          "code": "#include <atomic>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <thread>\n#include <vector>\n\nint main() {\n    std::atomic<int> counter{0};\n    std::vector<std::thread> workers;\n    for (int t = 0; t < 4; ++t) {\n        workers.emplace_back([&counter] {\n            for (int i = 0; i < 1000; ++i)\n                counter.fetch_add(1, std::memory_order_relaxed);\n        });\n    }\n    for (auto& w : workers) w.join();\n    std::cout << \"counter=\" << counter.load() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "counter=4000\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "atomic 只保护它自己的读写，组合操作仍需锁或 CAS。",
            "relaxed 不提供同步，别用它保护有依赖关系的数据。",
            "用普通 int 让多线程自增是数据竞争，结果不可预期。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把 relaxed 改成 memory_order_seq_cst，观察结果是否仍为 4000。",
              "hint": "更强的内存序同样保证正确计数，只是更慢。",
              "answer": "结果仍为 4000。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-093",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "内存模型与数据竞争",
      "summary": "理解 C++ 内存模型中的 happens-before 与数据竞争定义。",
      "concepts": [
        "内存模型",
        "happens-before",
        "数据竞争",
        "同步"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-093-lesson",
          "title": "内存模型与数据竞争",
          "summary": "理解 C++ 内存模型中的 happens-before 与数据竞争定义。",
          "concepts": [
            "内存模型",
            "happens-before",
            "数据竞争",
            "同步"
          ],
          "objective": "解释什么构成数据竞争，以及如何用同步建立顺序。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "原子操作与内存序"
          ],
          "explain": "只要两个线程并发访问同一内存、至少一个是写、且没有同步建立 happens-before，就是数据竞争，属于未定义行为。锁、原子、join 都能建立 happens-before。本课用累加并 join 的方式演示“有顺序则结果确定”。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <thread>\n\nint main() {\n    int data = 0;\n    std::thread writer([&data] { data = 42; });\n    writer.join();  // join 建立 happens-before：写发生在读之前\n    std::cout << \"data=\" << data << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "data=42\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "没有同步的并发读写是未定义行为，可能“看起来正常”却出错。",
            "join 保证线程的写对 join 之后的读可见。",
            "volatile 不是同步手段。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "去掉 join 直接读 data，说明为什么危险。",
              "hint": "线程可能尚未写完就读，且无 happens-before。",
              "answer": "构成数据竞争，结果不可预期，且可能崩溃。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-094",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "异常安全保证",
      "summary": "区分基本/强/不抛异常保证，用 RAII 与 copy-and-swap 实现强保证。",
      "concepts": [
        "异常安全",
        "基本保证",
        "强保证",
        "copy-and-swap"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-094-lesson",
          "title": "异常安全保证",
          "summary": "区分基本/强/不抛异常保证，用 RAII 与 copy-and-swap 实现强保证。",
          "concepts": [
            "异常安全",
            "基本保证",
            "强保证",
            "copy-and-swap"
          ],
          "objective": "用 copy-and-swap 让赋值具备强异常安全。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "RAII 与作用域守卫"
          ],
          "explain": "异常安全分三级：不抛异常（noexcept）、强保证（失败则回滚到原状态）、基本保证（无泄漏但状态可能改变）。copy-and-swap 先做出副本，成功后再原子地交换，从而得到强保证。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <utility>\n\nclass Config {\npublic:\n    explicit Config(std::string name) : name_(std::move(name)) {}\n    Config& operator=(Config other) {  // 传值：先拷贝\n        swap(other);                   // 交换：不抛\n        return *this;\n    }\n    void swap(Config& other) noexcept { std::swap(name_, other.name_); }\n    const std::string& name() const { return name_; }\nprivate:\n    std::string name_;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Config a(\"first\");\n    Config b(\"second\");\n    a = b;\n    std::cout << a.name() << \" \" << b.name() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "second second\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "copy-and-swap 的形参按值接收，依赖拷贝构造的成功。",
            "swap 要标 noexcept，否则强保证打折扣。",
            "所有资源都应交给 RAII 对象，才能避免泄漏。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 Config 加一个 noexcept 的移动构造。",
              "hint": "Config(Config&&) noexcept = default;",
              "answer": "移动被标记 noexcept 后容器扩容会优先移动。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-095",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "noexcept 与移动特征",
      "summary": "用 noexcept 表达不抛保证，影响容器是否优先移动元素。",
      "concepts": [
        "noexcept",
        "move_if_noexcept",
        "类型特征",
        "扩容"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-095-lesson",
          "title": "noexcept 与移动特征",
          "summary": "用 noexcept 表达不抛保证，影响容器是否优先移动元素。",
          "concepts": [
            "noexcept",
            "move_if_noexcept",
            "类型特征",
            "扩容"
          ],
          "objective": "解释 noexcept 如何影响 vector 扩容时的拷贝/移动选择。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "异常安全保证"
          ],
          "explain": "vector 扩容需要把旧元素搬到新内存。若元素的移动构造是 noexcept，就用移动；否则为强异常安全会退回拷贝（move_if_noexcept）。给移动操作标 noexcept 能让容器扩容更高效。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <type_traits>\n#include <utility>\n\nstruct Safe {\n    Safe() = default;\n    Safe(Safe&&) noexcept {}\n};\nstruct Unsafe {\n    Unsafe() = default;\n    Unsafe(Unsafe&&) {}  // 未标 noexcept\n};\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << std::is_nothrow_move_constructible_v<Safe> << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << std::is_nothrow_move_constructible_v<Unsafe> << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "1\n0\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "析构函数默认是 noexcept 的，不要在里面抛异常。",
            "noexcept 一旦承诺，违反会直接 terminate。",
            "移动构造/赋值/swap 都应尽量 noexcept。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "给 Unsafe 的移动构造加上 noexcept，观察输出。",
              "hint": "加 noexcept 后特征变为 1。",
              "answer": "is_nothrow_move_constructible_v<Unsafe> 变为 1。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-096",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "基准测试与性能测量",
      "summary": "用 std::chrono 测量代码耗时，建立可比较的基准。",
      "concepts": [
        "chrono",
        "基准测试",
        "steady_clock",
        "测量"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-096-lesson",
          "title": "基准测试与性能测量",
          "summary": "用 std::chrono 测量代码耗时，建立可比较的基准。",
          "concepts": [
            "chrono",
            "基准测试",
            "steady_clock",
            "测量"
          ],
          "objective": "用 steady_clock 测量一段计算的耗时并打印。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "noexcept 与移动特征"
          ],
          "explain": "性能优化前先测量。std::chrono::steady_clock 是单调时钟，适合测耗时。测量应重复多次、注意编译器优化（用 volatile 或累计结果避免被优化掉）。本课测一段求和循环的耗时，输出只断言“大于等于 0”，避免依赖机器速度。",
          "code": "#include <chrono>\n#include <cstdint>\n#include <iostream>\n\nint main() {\n    using clock = std::chrono::steady_clock;\n    const auto start = clock::now();\n    std::uint64_t sum = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < 1000000; ++i) sum += static_cast<std::uint64_t>(i);\n    const auto end = clock::now();\n    const auto micros =\n        std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::microseconds>(end - start).count();\n    std::cout << \"sum=\" << sum << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"measured=\" << (micros >= 0) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "sum=499999500000\nmeasured=1\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "高精度计时用 steady_clock，不要用 system_clock（可能被调整）。",
            "不要把耗时数值写进断言，机器不同结果不同。",
            "编译器可能优化掉无用的计算，累加结果要用起来。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "把循环次数改成 2000000，观察 sum 与测量结果。",
              "hint": "sum(0..1999999)。",
              "answer": "sum 相应增大，measured=1 保持成立。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-097",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "编译期计算进阶",
      "summary": "用 constexpr/模板在编译期完成可组合的计算与查表。",
      "concepts": [
        "constexpr",
        "编译期查表",
        "consteval",
        "零运行开销"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-097-lesson",
          "title": "编译期计算进阶",
          "summary": "用 constexpr/模板在编译期完成可组合的计算与查表。",
          "concepts": [
            "constexpr",
            "编译期查表",
            "consteval",
            "零运行开销"
          ],
          "objective": "在编译期生成一张表并用于运行期查询。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "基准测试与性能测量"
          ],
          "explain": "把计算放到编译期能消除运行期开销：用 constexpr 函数生成数组、用 static_assert 验证结果。C++20 的 consteval 强制表达式必须在编译期求值。编译期查表适合三角函数近似、CRC 表、单位的换算因子等。",
          "code": "#include <array>\n#include <iostream>\n\nconstexpr std::array<int, 6> makeSquares() {\n    std::array<int, 6> a{};\n    for (std::size_t i = 0; i < a.size(); ++i) a[i] = static_cast<int>(i * i);\n    return a;\n}\n\nconstexpr auto kSquares = makeSquares();\nstatic_assert(kSquares[3] == 9);\n\nconsteval int compileOnly(int x) { return x + 1; }\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << kSquares[5] << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << compileOnly(41) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "25\n42\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "constexpr 数组会被放进只读数据段，别试图在运行期修改。",
            "consteval 函数的所有调用都必须在编译期。",
            "编译期计算受编译期步数/内存限制，别生成过大的表。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "用 constexpr 生成一张 2 的幂表并打印第 10 项。",
              "hint": "1 << i 生成 2^i。",
              "answer": "第 10 项为 1024。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-098",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "编译期多态与运行期多态对比",
      "summary": "对比模板（编译期）与虚函数（运行期）多态的适用场景与取舍。",
      "concepts": [
        "编译期多态",
        "运行期多态",
        "性能",
        "灵活性"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-098-lesson",
          "title": "编译期多态与运行期多态对比",
          "summary": "对比模板（编译期）与虚函数（运行期）多态的适用场景与取舍。",
          "concepts": [
            "编译期多态",
            "运行期多态",
            "性能",
            "灵活性"
          ],
          "objective": "根据是否需要运行期替换来选择多态方式。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "编译期计算进阶"
          ],
          "explain": "编译期多态（模板/CRTP/concepts）零运行开销、可内联，但类型必须在编译期确定、会增大二进制。运行期多态（虚函数）能在运行期替换实现、接口稳定，但有间接调用开销。库设计常在性能敏感处用编译期多态、在插件/扩展点用运行期多态。",
          "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <memory>\n#include <vector>\n\n// 运行期多态：可在运行期选择实现\nstruct Operation {\n    virtual ~Operation() = default;\n    virtual int apply(int x) const = 0;\n};\nstruct Double : Operation {\n    int apply(int x) const override { return x * 2; }\n};\nstruct Square : Operation {\n    int apply(int x) const override { return x * x; }\n};\n\n// 编译期多态：零开销、可内联（函数对象而非类层次）\nstruct DoubleOp { int operator()(int x) const { return x * 2; } };\nstruct SquareOp { int operator()(int x) const { return x * x; } };\n\ntemplate <typename Op>\nint applyStatic(int x) { return Op{}(x); }\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<std::unique_ptr<Operation>> ops;\n    ops.push_back(std::make_unique<Double>());\n    ops.push_back(std::make_unique<Square>());\n    for (const auto& op : ops) std::cout << op->apply(5) << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    std::cout << applyStatic<DoubleOp>(5) << \" \" << applyStatic<SquareOp>(5) << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "10 25 \n10 25\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "运行期多态需要指针/引用，按值会切片。",
            "编译期多态无法用同构容器存放不同类型。",
            "性能问题要先测量（见基准测试课）再决定抽象方式。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "再加一个运行期实现 Triple，比较两种多态的写法差异。",
              "hint": "运行期加一个派生类，编译期加一个函数对象。",
              "answer": "两种方式都能实现 ×3，运行期通过派生类、编译期通过函数对象。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-099",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "泛型算法与自定义投影",
      "summary": "用投影（projection）让算法作用在对象的关键字段上。",
      "concepts": [
        "投影",
        "ranges 算法",
        "排序/查找",
        "成员指针"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-099-lesson",
          "title": "泛型算法与自定义投影",
          "summary": "用投影（projection）让算法作用在对象的关键字段上。",
          "concepts": [
            "投影",
            "ranges 算法",
            "排序/查找",
            "成员指针"
          ],
          "objective": "用投影按对象字段排序与查找。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "编译期多态与运行期多态对比"
          ],
          "explain": "C++20 的 ranges 算法支持投影参数：把每个元素先经投影映射，再参与比较。投影可以是 lambda 或成员指针（&T::field）。它避免了为每个字段写不同的比较器，让按字段排序/查找变得简洁。",
          "code": "#include <algorithm>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <ranges>\n#include <string>\n#include <vector>\n\nstruct Employee {\n    std::string name;\n    int salary;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<Employee> staff = {{\"alice\", 5000}, {\"bob\", 3500}, {\"carol\", 7000}};\n    std::ranges::sort(staff, std::less{}, &Employee::salary);\n    for (const auto& e : staff) std::cout << e.name << \":\" << e.salary << \" \";\n    std::cout << \"\\n\";\n    auto it = std::ranges::find(staff, std::string(\"carol\"), &Employee::name);\n    std::cout << \"found \" << it->salary << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "bob:3500 alice:5000 carol:7000 \nfound 7000\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "投影只在 ranges 算法上可用，经典 std::sort 没有该参数。",
            "find 用投影时第二参要与投影结果类型匹配。",
            "多字段排序要组合投影或自定义比较器。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "按 name 字母序排序并打印。",
              "hint": "投影改成 &Employee::name。",
              "answer": "输出 alice bob carol 的顺序。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp-tutorial-100",
      "language": "cpp",
      "type": "cpp",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "综合项目：小型表达式解释器",
      "summary": "综合运用继承、智能指针、variant、多态与递归下降，实现四则运算解释器。",
      "concepts": [
        "综合",
        "递归下降",
        "多态",
        "智能指针",
        "解析"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "cpp-tutorial-100-lesson",
          "title": "综合项目：小型表达式解释器",
          "summary": "综合运用继承、智能指针、variant、多态与递归下降，实现四则运算解释器。",
          "concepts": [
            "综合",
            "递归下降",
            "多态",
            "智能指针",
            "解析"
          ],
          "objective": "把多态、智能指针与递归组合成一个可运行的表达式求值器。",
          "prerequisites": [
            "编译期多态与运行期多态对比",
            "泛型算法与自定义投影"
          ],
          "explain": "这一课把前面所学综合成一个能求值 \"1+2*3\" 的小解释器：用抽象基类 Expr 表示节点，Num/Add/Mul 派生类各自求值，用 unique_ptr 管理节点所有权，用递归下降解析表达式并处理运算符优先级。它体现了“抽象 + 所有权 + 递归”的完整工程思路。",
          "code": "#include <cctype>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <memory>\n#include <string>\n\nstruct Expr {\n    virtual ~Expr() = default;\n    virtual int eval() const = 0;\n};\nstruct Num : Expr {\n    explicit Num(int v) : value(v) {}\n    int eval() const override { return value; }\n    int value;\n};\nstruct Add : Expr {\n    Add(std::unique_ptr<Expr> l, std::unique_ptr<Expr> r)\n        : left(std::move(l)), right(std::move(r)) {}\n    int eval() const override { return left->eval() + right->eval(); }\n    std::unique_ptr<Expr> left, right;\n};\nstruct Mul : Expr {\n    Mul(std::unique_ptr<Expr> l, std::unique_ptr<Expr> r)\n        : left(std::move(l)), right(std::move(r)) {}\n    int eval() const override { return left->eval() * right->eval(); }\n    std::unique_ptr<Expr> left, right;\n};\n\nclass Parser {\npublic:\n    explicit Parser(const std::string& text) : s_(text) {}\n    std::unique_ptr<Expr> parse() { return parseAdd(); }\nprivate:\n    std::unique_ptr<Expr> parseAdd() {\n        auto node = parseMul();\n        while (peek() == '+') { ++pos_; node = std::make_unique<Add>(std::move(node), parseMul()); }\n        return node;\n    }\n    std::unique_ptr<Expr> parseMul() {\n        auto node = parseAtom();\n        while (peek() == '*') { ++pos_; node = std::make_unique<Mul>(std::move(node), parseAtom()); }\n        return node;\n    }\n    std::unique_ptr<Expr> parseAtom() {\n        if (peek() == '(') {\n            ++pos_;\n            auto node = parseAdd();\n            ++pos_;  // skip )\n            return node;\n        }\n        int value = 0;\n        while (std::isdigit(static_cast<unsigned char>(peek()))) {\n            value = value * 10 + (s_[pos_++] - '0');\n        }\n        return std::make_unique<Num>(value);\n    }\n    char peek() const { return pos_ < s_.size() ? s_[pos_] : '\\0'; }\n    std::string s_;\n    std::size_t pos_ = 0;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Parser p(\"1+2*3\");\n    std::cout << p.parse()->eval() << \"\\n\";\n    Parser q(\"(1+2)*3\");\n    std::cout << q.parse()->eval() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
          "output": "7\n9\n",
          "pitfalls": [
            "运算符优先级靠递归层级表达（Add 调用 Mul 调用 Atom）。",
            "节点用 unique_ptr 独占所有权，move 转移避免拷贝。",
            "本示例不处理负数、空格与错误输入，真实解析器需要更完整的错误处理。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "让解析器支持减法 '-'，注意左结合。",
              "hint": "在 parseAdd 里增加对 '-' 的分支，并新增 Sub 节点。",
              "answer": "解析 \"5-2-1\" 得到 2（左结合）。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
