          "explain": "子类用 extends 继承父类，获得其字段与方法，可覆盖方法改变行为。子类构造器第一句用 super(...) 调用父类构造器。",
          "code": "public class Main {\n    static class Animal {\n        final String name;\n\n        Animal(String name) {\n            this.name = name;\n        }\n\n        String sound() {\n            return \"...\";\n        }\n    }\n\n    static class Cat extends Animal {\n        Cat(String name) {\n            super(name);\n        }\n\n        @Override\n        String sound() {\n            return \"喵\";\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Cat cat = new Cat(\"咪咪\");\n        System.out.println(cat.name + \": \" + cat.sound());\n    }\n}",
          "output": "咪咪: 喵",
          "pitfalls": [
            "子类构造器未显式调用 super 时，会先调用父类无参构造器。",
            "@Override 写错方法签名会报错，正好用于校验。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
