          "id": "java-tutorial-020-lesson",
          "title": "Java 020：多态与动态绑定",
          "summary": "父类引用指向子类对象，运行时选择实际实现。",
          "concepts": [
            "多态",
            "向上转型",
            "动态绑定"
          ],
          "objective": "能用父类类型统一处理不同子类对象。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "父类引用可以指向子类对象；调用被覆盖的方法时，运行时按实际对象类型执行。这让代码依赖抽象而不依赖具体实现。",
          "code": "import java.util.List;\n\npublic class Main {\n    interface Shape {\n        double area();\n    }\n\n    static class Circle implements Shape {\n        final double r;\n\n        Circle(double r) {\n            this.r = r;\n        }\n\n        @Override\n        public double area() {\n            return 3.14159 * r * r;\n        }\n    }\n\n    static class Square implements Shape {\n        final double side;\n\n        Square(double side) {\n            this.side = side;\n        }\n\n        @Override\n        public double area() {\n            return side * side;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        List<Shape> shapes = List.of(new Square(2), new Circle(1));\n        for (Shape shape : shapes) {\n            System.out.println(\"area=\" + shape.area());\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "output": "area=4.0\narea=3.14159",
          "pitfalls": [
            "多态只作用于方法，不作用于字段。",
            "静态方法不参与动态绑定。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "运行示例，观察输出，然后修改程序让结果体现一个新的输入。",
