      "title": "Java 026：equals 与 hashCode",
      "summary": "重写 equals/hashCode 让基于内容的对象可正确比较与查找。",
      "concepts": [
        "equals",
        "hashCode",
        "契约"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI Java 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-09",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "java-tutorial-026-lesson",
          "title": "Java 026：equals 与 hashCode",
          "summary": "重写 equals/hashCode 让基于内容的对象可正确比较与查找。",
          "concepts": [
            "equals",
            "hashCode",
            "契约"
          ],
          "objective": "能手写一致的 equals 与 hashCode。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "默认 equals 比较引用。按内容比较要重写 equals，且必须同时重写 hashCode，保证相等对象哈希一致，才能在 HashMap/HashSet 中正确工作。",
          "code": "import java.util.Objects;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static class Money {\n        final int amount;\n\n        Money(int amount) {\n            this.amount = amount;\n        }\n\n        @Override\n        public boolean equals(Object other) {\n            if (this == other) {\n                return true;\n            }\n            if (!(other instanceof Money money)) {\n                return false;\n            }\n            return amount == money.amount;\n        }\n\n        @Override\n        public int hashCode() {\n            return Objects.hash(amount);\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Money a = new Money(10);\n        Money b = new Money(10);\n        System.out.println(\"equals=\" + a.equals(b));\n        System.out.println(\"hashSame=\" + (a.hashCode() == b.hashCode()));\n    }\n}",
          "output": "equals=true\nhashSame=true",
          "pitfalls": [
            "重写 equals 不重写 hashCode 会导致哈希集合出错。",
            "equals 参数类型是 Object，别写成具体类型。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "运行示例，观察输出，然后修改程序让结果体现一个新的输入。",
              "hint": "改动示例中的常量或数据，重新编译运行，确认输出随之改变。",
              "answer": "把 equals 相关的一处取值改成你自己的数据后重新运行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
