          "summary": "基本类型与包装类型的转换，以及缓存陷阱。",
          "concepts": [
            "包装类",
            "自动装箱",
            "缓存"
          ],
          "objective": "能解释自动装箱/拆箱并避免 Integer 比较陷阱。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "int 与 Integer 自动互相转换。较小的 Integer（-128..127）会复用缓存对象，所以 == 可能在范围内为 true、超出为 false；比较值要用 equals。",
          "code": "public class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Integer a = 100;\n        Integer b = 100;\n        System.out.println(\"small == \" + (a == b));\n        Integer c = 200;\n        Integer d = 200;\n        System.out.println(\"large == \" + (c == d));\n        System.out.println(\"large equals \" + c.equals(d));\n    }\n}",
          "output": "small == true\nlarge == false\nlarge equals true",
          "pitfalls": [
            "用 == 比较包装类型值会出错，用 equals。",
            "对 null 的包装类型拆箱会抛 NPE。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
