          "explain": "用一个类维护余额、一个枚举表示交易类型、一个自定义异常处理透支，体会面向对象如何把状态与行为收敛在一起。",
          "code": "public class Main {\n    enum Kind {\n        DEPOSIT,\n        WITHDRAW\n    }\n\n    static class BankAccount {\n        private int balance;\n\n        BankAccount(int opening) {\n            this.balance = opening;\n        }\n\n        void apply(Kind kind, int amount) {\n            if (amount <= 0) {\n                throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"金额必须为正\");\n            }\n            if (kind == Kind.DEPOSIT) {\n                balance += amount;\n            } else {\n                if (amount > balance) {\n                    throw new IllegalStateException(\"余额不足\");\n                }\n                balance -= amount;\n            }\n        }\n\n        int balance() {\n            return balance;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        BankAccount account = new BankAccount(100);\n        account.apply(Kind.DEPOSIT, 40);\n        account.apply(Kind.WITHDRAW, 30);\n        System.out.println(\"balance=\" + account.balance());\n    }\n}",
          "output": "balance=110",
          "pitfalls": [
            "业务校验放在领域方法里，而不是散落各处。",
            "金额用 int 分或 BigDecimal，避免浮点误差。"
          ],
