          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "正则用元字符描述模式。`\\d` 数字、`+` 一个或多个、括号是分组。matches 要求整串匹配，find 找子串。",
          "code": "import java.util.regex.Matcher;\nimport java.util.regex.Pattern;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Pattern pattern = Pattern.compile(\"(\\\\d+)-(\\\\d+)\");\n        Matcher matcher = pattern.matcher(\"订单 2024-001 已发货\");\n        if (matcher.find()) {\n            System.out.println(\"year=\" + matcher.group(1));\n            System.out.println(\"id=\" + matcher.group(2));\n        }\n        System.out.println(\"replaced=\" + \"a1b2\".replaceAll(\"\\\\d\", \"#\"));\n    }\n}",
          "output": "year=2024\nid=001\nreplaced=a#b#",
          "pitfalls": [
            "Java 字符串里反斜杠要双写。",
            "matches 是全串匹配，find 是子串搜索。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
