          ],
          "objective": "能用 BigDecimal 做精确加减乘除并指定舍入。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "double 有二进制浮点误差（0.1 + 0.2 != 0.3）。金额用 BigDecimal，用字符串构造，除法必须指定精度和舍入模式。",
          "code": "import java.math.BigDecimal;\nimport java.math.RoundingMode;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        BigDecimal a = new BigDecimal(\"0.1\");\n        BigDecimal b = new BigDecimal(\"0.2\");\n        System.out.println(\"sum=\" + a.add(b));\n        BigDecimal price = new BigDecimal(\"19.99\");\n        BigDecimal qty = new BigDecimal(3);\n        System.out.println(\"total=\" + price.multiply(qty));\n        System.out.println(\"div=\" + new BigDecimal(\"10\").divide(new BigDecimal(3), 2, RoundingMode.HALF_UP));\n    }\n}",
          "output": "sum=0.3\ntotal=59.97\ndiv=3.33",
          "pitfalls": [
            "用 double 构造 BigDecimal 会带入误差，要用字符串。",
            "divide 不指定精度可能抛 ArithmeticException。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
