          ],
          "objective": "能用 Set 去重并计算交集/并集。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "Set 不允许重复元素，HashSet 按哈希存储，add 重复元素返回 false。retainAll/AddAll 可实现交集/并集。",
          "code": "import java.util.HashSet;\nimport java.util.Set;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Set<String> tags = new HashSet<>();\n        System.out.println(\"added1=\" + tags.add(\"java\"));\n        System.out.println(\"added2=\" + tags.add(\"java\"));\n        tags.add(\"spring\");\n        System.out.println(\"size=\" + tags.size());\n\n        Set<String> other = new HashSet<>(Set.of(\"java\", \"sql\"));\n        Set<String> common = new HashSet<>(tags);\n        common.retainAll(other);\n        System.out.println(\"common=\" + common);\n    }\n}",
          "output": "added1=true\nadded2=false\nsize=2\ncommon=[java]",
          "pitfalls": [
            "自定义对象去重要正确重写 equals/hashCode。",
            "set.add 返回 boolean，不要当 void 用。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "运行示例，观察输出，然后修改程序让结果体现一个新的输入。",
