    {
      "id": "java-tutorial-038",
      "language": "java",
      "type": "java",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "Java 038：HashMap 键值映射",
      "summary": "用 Map 存取键值对与遍历技巧。",
      "concepts": [
        "Map",
        "HashMap",
        "TreeMap",
        "entrySet"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI Java 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-09",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "java-tutorial-038-lesson",
          "title": "Java 038：HashMap 键值映射",
          "summary": "用 Map 存取键值对与遍历技巧。",
          "concepts": [
            "Map",
            "HashMap",
            "TreeMap",
            "entrySet"
          ],
          "objective": "能用 Map 统计频次并按稳定顺序遍历键值。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "Map 保存键到值的映射，键唯一。put/get/getOrDefault/computeIfAbsent 是常用方法，遍历用 entrySet。HashMap 不保证顺序，需要有序输出时用 TreeMap。",
          "code": "import java.util.HashMap;\nimport java.util.Map;\nimport java.util.TreeMap;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Map<String, Integer> count = new HashMap<>();\n        for (String word : new String[] {\"a\", \"b\", \"a\", \"a\"}) {\n            count.put(word, count.getOrDefault(word, 0) + 1);\n        }\n        System.out.println(\"a=\" + count.get(\"a\"));\n        System.out.println(\"missing=\" + count.getOrDefault(\"z\", 0));\n        // TreeMap 按 key 排序，保证输出顺序稳定，不依赖 HashMap 的哈希顺序。\n        for (Map.Entry<String, Integer> entry : new TreeMap<>(count).entrySet()) {\n            System.out.println(entry.getKey() + \"->\" + entry.getValue());\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "output": "a=3\nmissing=0\na->3\nb->1",
          "pitfalls": [
            "HashMap 不保证遍历顺序，要稳定顺序用 TreeMap 或先排序。",
            "get 缺失键返回 null，Integer 拆箱可能 NPE。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
