          ],
          "objective": "能实现 Comparable 并用 Comparator 做多级排序。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "Comparable 定义类的自然顺序（compareTo）；Comparator 是外部比较器，可写多套排序规则并链式组合。",
          "code": "import java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.Comparator;\nimport java.util.List;\n\npublic class Main {\n    record Person(String name, int age) {}\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        List<Person> people = new ArrayList<>(List.of(\n            new Person(\"甲\", 30),\n            new Person(\"乙\", 25),\n            new Person(\"丙\", 30)));\n        people.sort(Comparator.comparingInt(Person::age).thenComparing(Person::name));\n        System.out.println(people);\n    }\n}",
          "output": "[Person[name=乙, age=25], Person[name=丙, age=30], Person[name=甲, age=30]]",
          "pitfalls": [
            "compareTo 返回负/零/正表示小于/等于/大于。",
            "排序会修改 List 顺序，需要保留原顺序时先复制。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
