          "id": "java-tutorial-043-lesson",
          "title": "Java 043：迭代器与增强 for",
          "summary": "Iterator 的遍历与安全删除。",
          "concepts": [
            "Iterator",
            "遍历",
            "remove"
          ],
          "objective": "能用 Iterator 遍历并在循环中安全删除元素。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "增强 for 底层就是 Iterator。需要在遍历时删除元素时要显式使用 Iterator.remove，否则会并发修改异常。",
          "code": "import java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.Iterator;\nimport java.util.List;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        List<Integer> numbers = new ArrayList<>(List.of(1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6));\n        Iterator<Integer> it = numbers.iterator();\n        while (it.hasNext()) {\n            if (it.next() % 2 == 0) {\n                it.remove();\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.println(numbers);\n    }\n}",
          "output": "[1, 3, 5]",
          "pitfalls": [
            "直接 list.remove 会在遍历时抛异常。",
            "next 每次前进一步，别重复调用。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
