          "id": "java-tutorial-044-lesson",
          "title": "Java 044：对象数组与 varargs 结合",
          "summary": "用泛型+可变参数写通用的最大/查找工具。",
          "concepts": [
            "泛型",
            "可变参数",
            "比较"
          ],
          "objective": "能编写接受可变参数的泛型工具方法。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "把可变参数与泛型、Comparator 结合，可写出通用的集合工具方法。",
          "code": "import java.util.Comparator;\n\npublic class Main {\n    @SafeVarargs\n    static <T> T max(Comparator<T> comparator, T... items) {\n        T best = items[0];\n        for (T item : items) {\n            if (comparator.compare(item, best) > 0) {\n                best = item;\n            }\n        }\n        return best;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        System.out.println(max(Integer::compare, 3, 9, 4));\n        System.out.println(max(String::compareTo, \"pear\", \"apple\", \"fig\"));\n    }\n}",
          "output": "9\npear",
          "pitfalls": [
            "泛型可变参数会引起警告，用 @SafeVarargs 声明安全。",
            "空参数数组会越界，需自行校验。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "运行示例，观察输出，然后修改程序让结果体现一个新的输入。",
              "hint": "改动示例中的常量或数据，重新编译运行，确认输出随之改变。",
              "answer": "把 泛型 相关的一处取值改成你自己的数据后重新运行。"
