          "objective": "能编写带多捕获与 finally 的异常处理。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "多个 catch 从上到下匹配；finally 总在最后执行，用于释放资源。可用 `catch (A | B e)` 合并同类处理。",
          "code": "public class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        System.out.println(run(\"10\"));\n        System.out.println(run(\"x\"));\n    }\n\n    static String run(String value) {\n        StringBuilder log = new StringBuilder();\n        try {\n            int number = Integer.parseInt(value);\n            log.append(\"ok:\").append(number);\n        } catch (NumberFormatException e) {\n            log.append(\"bad\");\n        } finally {\n            log.append(\"|\").append(\"done\");\n        }\n        return log.toString();\n    }\n}",
          "output": "ok:10|done\nbad|done",
          "pitfalls": [
            "finally 里 return 会覆盖 try 的返回值，避免。",
            "catch 顺序要从具体到宽泛。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
