      "id": "java-tutorial-052",
      "language": "java",
      "type": "java",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "Java 052：路径与目录操作",
      "summary": "用 Path/Files 创建目录、判断类型、列出内容。",
      "concepts": [
        "Path",
        "目录",
        "Files"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI Java 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-09",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "java-tutorial-052-lesson",
          "title": "Java 052：路径与目录操作",
          "summary": "用 Path/Files 创建目录、判断类型、列出内容。",
          "concepts": [
            "Path",
            "目录",
            "Files"
          ],
          "objective": "能用 Path 拼接路径并操作目录。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "Path 表示路径，用 resolve 拼接而不是字符串相加，跨平台更安全。Files.createDirectories 创建多级目录，Files.list 遍历。",
          "code": "import java.nio.file.Files;\nimport java.nio.file.Path;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {\n        Path root = Files.createTempDirectory(\"qfli_dir\");\n        try {\n            Path nested = root.resolve(\"a\").resolve(\"b\");\n            Files.createDirectories(nested);\n            System.out.println(\"isDir=\" + Files.isDirectory(nested));\n            System.out.println(\"name=\" + nested.getFileName());\n            System.out.println(\"exists=\" + Files.exists(nested));\n        } finally {\n            deleteRecursively(root);\n        }\n    }\n\n    static void deleteRecursively(Path path) throws Exception {\n        if (Files.isDirectory(path)) {\n            try (var stream = Files.list(path)) {\n                for (Path child : stream.toList()) {\n                    deleteRecursively(child);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        Files.deleteIfExists(path);\n    }\n}",
          "output": "isDir=true\nname=b\nexists=true",
          "pitfalls": [
            "用字符串拼接路径在不同平台会出错，用 resolve。",
            "递归删除要小心，仅限自己的临时目录。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "运行示例，观察输出，然后修改程序让结果体现一个新的输入。",
              "hint": "改动示例中的常量或数据，重新编译运行，确认输出随之改变。",
              "answer": "把 Path 相关的一处取值改成你自己的数据后重新运行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
