      "id": "java-tutorial-057",
      "language": "java",
      "type": "java",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "Java 057：生成器与 Iterable",
      "summary": "实现 Iterable/Iterator 让对象可被 for 遍历。",
      "concepts": [
        "Iterable",
        "Iterator",
        "自定义遍历"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI Java 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-09",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "java-tutorial-057-lesson",
          "title": "Java 057：生成器与 Iterable",
          "summary": "实现 Iterable/Iterator 让对象可被 for 遍历。",
          "concepts": [
            "Iterable",
            "Iterator",
            "自定义遍历"
          ],
          "objective": "能实现 Iterable 让自定义结构支持增强 for。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "实现 Iterable<T> 的 iterator() 方法后，对象可直接用于增强 for。适合封装内部数据结构。",
          "code": "import java.util.Iterator;\nimport java.util.NoSuchElementException;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static class Range implements Iterable<Integer> {\n        final int from;\n        final int to;\n\n        Range(int from, int to) {\n            this.from = from;\n            this.to = to;\n        }\n\n        @Override\n        public Iterator<Integer> iterator() {\n            return new Iterator<>() {\n                int current = from;\n\n                @Override\n                public boolean hasNext() {\n                    return current < to;\n                }\n\n                @Override\n                public Integer next() {\n                    if (!hasNext()) {\n                        throw new NoSuchElementException();\n                    }\n                    return current++;\n                }\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int total = 0;\n        for (int value : new Range(1, 4)) {\n            total += value;\n        }\n        System.out.println(\"total=\" + total);\n    }\n}",
          "output": "total=6",
          "pitfalls": [
            "next 在无元素时要抛 NoSuchElementException。",
            "迭代器状态应为每次 iterator() 新建。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "运行示例，观察输出，然后修改程序让结果体现一个新的输入。",
              "hint": "改动示例中的常量或数据，重新编译运行，确认输出随之改变。",
              "answer": "把 Iterable 相关的一处取值改成你自己的数据后重新运行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
