          "id": "java-tutorial-059-lesson",
          "title": "Java 059：断言与防御式编程",
          "summary": "用校验提前失败，用 assert 做开发期检查。",
          "concepts": [
            "防御式编程",
            "校验",
            "assert"
          ],
          "objective": "能在入口处校验参数，快速失败而不是静默错误。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "在方法入口校验参数，非法就抛异常，让错误尽早暴露。assert 默认关闭，仅用于开发期不变式，不应用于业务校验。",
          "code": "import java.util.Objects;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static int divide(int a, int b) {\n        if (b == 0) {\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"除数不能为 0\");\n        }\n        return a / b;\n    }\n\n    static String requireName(String name) {\n        Objects.requireNonNull(name, \"name 不能为空\");\n        if (name.isBlank()) {\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"name 不能为空白\");\n        }\n        return name.trim();\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        System.out.println(divide(10, 2));\n        System.out.println(requireName(\"  ok  \"));\n        try {\n            divide(1, 0);\n        } catch (IllegalArgumentException e) {\n            System.out.println(\"error=\" + e.getMessage());\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "output": "5\nok\nerror=除数不能为 0",
          "pitfalls": [
            "业务校验不要依赖 assert（可能被禁用）。",
            "校验消息要明确指出哪个参数不合法。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
