          "title": "Java 065：Stream 的 reduce 与聚合",
          "summary": "用 reduce/count/min/max 做归约。",
          "concepts": [
            "reduce",
            "聚合",
            "Optional"
          ],
          "objective": "能用 reduce 与聚合方法得到单一结果。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "reduce 把流元素逐步合并成一个值，可带初始值。count/min/max 是常用聚合，min/max 返回 Optional。",
          "code": "import java.util.List;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        List<Integer> numbers = List.of(3, 1, 4, 1, 5);\n        int sum = numbers.stream().reduce(0, Integer::sum);\n        System.out.println(\"sum=\" + sum);\n        int max = numbers.stream().reduce(Integer.MIN_VALUE, Math::max);\n        System.out.println(\"max=\" + max);\n        long count = numbers.stream().filter(n -> n > 2).count();\n        System.out.println(\"count=\" + count);\n    }\n}",
          "output": "sum=14\nmax=5\ncount=3",
          "pitfalls": [
            "带初始值的 reduce 要用单位元（加法的 0）。",
            "空流 reduce 无初始值返回 Optional。"
          ],
