          "id": "java-tutorial-068-lesson",
          "title": "Java 068：Stream 的排序与去重",
          "summary": "sorted/distinct/limit/skip 组合。",
          "concepts": [
            "sorted",
            "distinct",
            "limit",
            "skip"
          ],
          "objective": "能对流做排序、去重和截取。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "sorted 排序（可传 Comparator）、distinct 去重、limit 取前 N、skip 跳过前 N。可链式组合。",
          "code": "import java.util.Comparator;\nimport java.util.List;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        List<Integer> values = List.of(5, 3, 5, 1, 4, 3);\n        List<Integer> top = values.stream()\n            .distinct()\n            .sorted(Comparator.reverseOrder())\n            .limit(3)\n            .toList();\n        System.out.println(top);\n        System.out.println(values.stream().skip(2).findFirst().orElse(-1));\n    }\n}",
          "output": "[5, 4, 3]\n5",
          "pitfalls": [
            "sorted 会消耗流并缓存全部元素。",
            "findFirst 返回 Optional。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
