      "id": "java-tutorial-073",
      "language": "java",
      "type": "java",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "Java 073：函数式管道综合",
      "summary": "把 map/filter/sorted/collect 组合成完整数据管道。",
      "concepts": [
        "管道",
        "综合",
        "Stream"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI Java 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-09",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "java-tutorial-073-lesson",
          "title": "Java 073：函数式管道综合",
          "summary": "把 map/filter/sorted/collect 组合成完整数据管道。",
          "concepts": [
            "管道",
            "综合",
            "Stream"
          ],
          "objective": "能把多个流操作组合成清晰的数据处理管道。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "真实处理往往是「过滤 -> 变换 -> 排序 -> 收集」的管道。把每步拆开比嵌套循环更易读。",
          "code": "import java.util.Comparator;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Map;\nimport java.util.stream.Collectors;\n\npublic class Main {\n    record Order(String product, int amount) {}\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        List<Order> orders = List.of(\n            new Order(\"pen\", 3),\n            new Order(\"book\", 1),\n            new Order(\"pen\", 2),\n            new Order(\"bag\", 5));\n        Map<String, Integer> totals = orders.stream()\n            .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(Order::product, Collectors.summingInt(Order::amount)));\n        List<String> top = totals.entrySet().stream()\n            .sorted(\n                Map.Entry.<String, Integer>comparingByValue()\n                    .reversed()\n                    .thenComparing(Map.Entry.comparingByKey()))\n            .map(entry -> entry.getKey() + \"=\" + entry.getValue())\n            .toList();\n        System.out.println(top);\n    }\n}",
          "output": "[bag=5, pen=5, book=1]",
          "pitfalls": [
            "排序 Map.Entry 需要显式类型参数。",
            "值相同时必须加次级排序，否则顺序不稳定。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "运行示例，观察输出，然后修改程序让结果体现一个新的输入。",
              "hint": "改动示例中的常量或数据，重新编译运行，确认输出随之改变。",
              "answer": "把 管道 相关的一处取值改成你自己的数据后重新运行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
