      "id": "java-tutorial-074",
      "language": "java",
      "type": "java",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "intermediate",
      "title": "Java 074：Stream 与 IO 结合",
      "summary": "用 Files.lines 流式处理文件行。",
      "concepts": [
        "Files.lines",
        "Stream",
        "IO"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI Java 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-09",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "java-tutorial-074-lesson",
          "title": "Java 074：Stream 与 IO 结合",
          "summary": "用 Files.lines 流式处理文件行。",
          "concepts": [
            "Files.lines",
            "Stream",
            "IO"
          ],
          "objective": "能用 Files.lines 按行流式处理并在结束后关闭。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "Files.lines 返回一个 Stream<String>，惰性读行，适合大文件。它携带打开的文件句柄，必须用 try-with-resources 关闭。",
          "code": "import java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;\nimport java.nio.file.Files;\nimport java.nio.file.Path;\nimport java.util.stream.Stream;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {\n        Path file = Files.createTempFile(\"qfli_lines\", \".txt\");\n        Files.writeString(file, \"alpha\\nbeta\\ngamma\", StandardCharsets.UTF_8);\n        try (Stream<String> lines = Files.lines(file, StandardCharsets.UTF_8)) {\n            long count = lines.filter(line -> line.length() == 5).count();\n            System.out.println(\"five=\" + count);\n        } finally {\n            Files.deleteIfExists(file);\n        }\n        System.out.println(\"done\");\n    }\n}",
          "output": "five=2\ndone",
          "pitfalls": [
            "Files.lines 必须关闭，否则文件句柄泄漏。",
            "流已关闭后再使用会报 IllegalStateException。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "运行示例，观察输出，然后修改程序让结果体现一个新的输入。",
              "hint": "改动示例中的常量或数据，重新编译运行，确认输出随之改变。",
              "answer": "把 Files.lines 相关的一处取值改成你自己的数据后重新运行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
