      "concepts": [
        "CountDownLatch",
        "同步",
        "等待"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI Java 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-09",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "java-tutorial-082-lesson",
          "title": "Java 082：CountDownLatch 协调",
          "summary": "用倒计时门塞等待多个任务完成。",
          "concepts": [
            "CountDownLatch",
            "同步",
            "等待"
          ],
          "objective": "能用 CountDownLatch 等待一组线程全部就绪。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "CountDownLatch 初始化计数，每个线程完成后 countDown，主线程 await 直到计数归零，用于「等全部完成」的场景。",
          "code": "import java.util.concurrent.CountDownLatch;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws InterruptedException {\n        int workers = 3;\n        CountDownLatch latch = new CountDownLatch(workers);\n        for (int i = 0; i < workers; i++) {\n            new Thread(() -> {\n                System.out.println(\"work done\");\n                latch.countDown();\n            }).start();\n        }\n        latch.await();\n        System.out.println(\"all done\");\n    }\n}",
          "output": "work done\nwork done\nwork done\nall done",
          "pitfalls": [
            "latch 只能倒计一次，不能重复使用（用 CyclicBarrier）。",
            "忘记 countDown 会永久阻塞。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "运行示例，观察输出，然后修改程序让结果体现一个新的输入。",
              "hint": "改动示例中的常量或数据，重新编译运行，确认输出随之改变。",
              "answer": "把 CountDownLatch 相关的一处取值改成你自己的数据后重新运行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
