      "id": "java-tutorial-087",
      "language": "java",
      "type": "java",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "Java 087：工厂模式",
      "summary": "用工厂方法隐藏对象创建细节。",
      "concepts": [
        "工厂",
        "多态",
        "解耦"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI Java 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-09",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "java-tutorial-087-lesson",
          "title": "Java 087：工厂模式",
          "summary": "用工厂方法隐藏对象创建细节。",
          "concepts": [
            "工厂",
            "多态",
            "解耦"
          ],
          "objective": "能用工厂根据参数返回不同实现。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "工厂把「创建什么」与「如何使用」解耦：调用方只依赖接口，由工厂决定具体类型，便于扩展。",
          "code": "public class Main {\n    interface Payment {\n        String pay(int amount);\n    }\n\n    static class Alipay implements Payment {\n        @Override\n        public String pay(int amount) {\n            return \"支付宝支付 \" + amount;\n        }\n    }\n\n    static class WeChat implements Payment {\n        @Override\n        public String pay(int amount) {\n            return \"微信支付 \" + amount;\n        }\n    }\n\n    static Payment create(String channel) {\n        return switch (channel) {\n            case \"alipay\" -> new Alipay();\n            case \"wechat\" -> new WeChat();\n            default -> throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"未知渠道: \" + channel);\n        };\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        System.out.println(create(\"alipay\").pay(100));\n        System.out.println(create(\"wechat\").pay(200));\n    }\n}",
          "output": "支付宝支付 100\n微信支付 200",
          "pitfalls": [
            "新增类型时要修改工厂，注意单一职责。",
            "工厂适合创建逻辑复杂的情况，简单对象无需过度设计。"
          ],
