      "id": "java-tutorial-091",
      "language": "java",
      "type": "java",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "Java 091：冒泡排序与二分查找",
      "summary": "手写基础排序与有序数组查找。",
      "concepts": [
        "排序",
        "二分查找",
        "复杂度"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI Java 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-09",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "java-tutorial-091-lesson",
          "title": "Java 091：冒泡排序与二分查找",
          "summary": "手写基础排序与有序数组查找。",
          "concepts": [
            "排序",
            "二分查找",
            "复杂度"
          ],
          "objective": "能实现冒泡排序与二分查找并说明复杂度。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "冒泡排序相邻比较交换，O(n^2)；二分查找要求已排序，每次折半，O(log n)。",
          "code": "import java.util.Arrays;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static void bubbleSort(int[] values) {\n        for (int i = 0; i < values.length - 1; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < values.length - 1 - i; j++) {\n                if (values[j] > values[j + 1]) {\n                    int temp = values[j];\n                    values[j] = values[j + 1];\n                    values[j + 1] = temp;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    static int binarySearch(int[] sorted, int target) {\n        int low = 0;\n        int high = sorted.length - 1;\n        while (low <= high) {\n            int mid = (low + high) >>> 1;\n            if (sorted[mid] == target) {\n                return mid;\n            } else if (sorted[mid] < target) {\n                low = mid + 1;\n            } else {\n                high = mid - 1;\n            }\n        }\n        return -1;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int[] values = {5, 2, 9, 1, 7};\n        bubbleSort(values);\n        System.out.println(Arrays.toString(values));\n        System.out.println(\"index=\" + binarySearch(values, 7));\n        System.out.println(\"missing=\" + binarySearch(values, 3));\n    }\n}",
          "output": "[1, 2, 5, 7, 9]\nindex=3\nmissing=-1",
          "pitfalls": [
            "二分查找前必须已排序。",
            "(low+high) 可能溢出，用无符号右移。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "运行示例，观察输出，然后修改程序让结果体现一个新的输入。",
              "hint": "改动示例中的常量或数据，重新编译运行，确认输出随之改变。",
              "answer": "把 排序 相关的一处取值改成你自己的数据后重新运行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
