      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "java-tutorial-092-lesson",
          "title": "Java 092：递归与动态规划",
          "summary": "用记忆化把指数级递归降为线性。",
          "concepts": [
            "动态规划",
            "记忆化",
            "递归"
          ],
          "objective": "能用记忆化优化重复子问题。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "朴素斐波那契重复计算子问题是指数级。用数组缓存已算结果，每个值只算一次，降到 O(n)。",
          "code": "import java.util.Arrays;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static long fib(int n, long[] memo) {\n        if (n <= 1) {\n            return n;\n        }\n        if (memo[n] != -1) {\n            return memo[n];\n        }\n        memo[n] = fib(n - 1, memo) + fib(n - 2, memo);\n        return memo[n];\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int n = 40;\n        long[] memo = new long[n + 1];\n        Arrays.fill(memo, -1);\n        System.out.println(\"fib=\" + fib(n, memo));\n    }\n}",
          "output": "fib=102334155",
          "pitfalls": [
            "memo 要用 -1 初始化区分未计算。",
            "注意大数溢出，可用 long 或 BigInteger。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "运行示例，观察输出，然后修改程序让结果体现一个新的输入。",
