          "id": "java-tutorial-094-lesson",
          "title": "Java 094：不可变对象设计",
          "summary": "用 final、防御性拷贝构建不可变类型。",
          "concepts": [
            "不可变",
            "final",
            "防御性拷贝"
          ],
          "objective": "能设计线程安全的不可变对象。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "不可变对象创建后状态不变，天然线程安全。要点：字段 final、构造器完成初始化、可变字段要拷贝、不提供修改器。",
          "code": "import java.util.List;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static final class Basket {\n        private final List<String> items;\n\n        Basket(List<String> items) {\n            this.items = List.copyOf(items);\n        }\n\n        List<String> items() {\n            return items;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        List<String> source = new java.util.ArrayList<>(List.of(\"apple\"));\n        Basket basket = new Basket(source);\n        source.add(\"banana\");\n        System.out.println(\"basket=\" + basket.items());\n        try {\n            basket.items().add(\"x\");\n        } catch (UnsupportedOperationException e) {\n            System.out.println(\"immutable\");\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "output": "basket=[apple]\nimmutable",
          "pitfalls": [
            "直接保存传入集合引用会被外部修改。",
            "返回内部集合要用不可变视图或拷贝。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
