      "id": "java-tutorial-095",
      "language": "java",
      "type": "java",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "Java 095：密封类型与 instanceof 模式匹配",
      "summary": "用 sealed 限定子类集合，用 instanceof 模式匹配免去强制转换。",
      "concepts": [
        "sealed",
        "instanceof 模式匹配",
        "permits",
        "类型安全"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI Java 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-09",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "java-tutorial-095-lesson",
          "title": "Java 095：密封类型与 instanceof 模式匹配",
          "summary": "用 sealed 限定子类集合，用 instanceof 模式匹配免去强制转换。",
          "concepts": [
            "sealed",
            "instanceof 模式匹配",
            "permits",
            "类型安全"
          ],
          "objective": "能用 sealed 层次和 instanceof 模式匹配安全地处理形状，并列举密封类型的已知子类。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "sealed 接口用 permits 明确列出允许的子类，编译器因此知道类型的完整集合。Java 17 的 instanceof 模式匹配在判断类型的同时声明变量，省去显式强制转换；（switch 的记录模式需要更高版本的 Java，本项目按 17 编译，所以用 instanceof 模式。）",
          "code": "public class Main {\n    sealed interface Shape permits Circle, Square {}\n\n    static final class Circle implements Shape {\n        final double radius;\n\n        Circle(double radius) {\n            this.radius = radius;\n        }\n    }\n\n    static final class Square implements Shape {\n        final double side;\n\n        Square(double side) {\n            this.side = side;\n        }\n    }\n\n    static double area(Shape shape) {\n        if (shape instanceof Circle circle) {\n            return Math.PI * circle.radius * circle.radius;\n        }\n        if (shape instanceof Square square) {\n            return square.side * square.side;\n        }\n        throw new IllegalStateException(\"unknown shape\");\n    }\n\n    static String describe(Shape shape) {\n        if (shape instanceof Circle circle) {\n            return \"圆 r=\" + circle.radius;\n        }\n        return \"正方形 side=\" + ((Square) shape).side;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        System.out.println(\"square=\" + area(new Square(3)));\n        System.out.println(\"circle>0=\" + (area(new Circle(1)) > 3));\n        System.out.println(describe(new Square(2)));\n        System.out.println(\"permitted=\" + Shape.class.getPermittedSubclasses().length);\n    }\n}",
          "output": "square=9.0\ncircle>0=true\n正方形 side=2.0\npermitted=2",
          "pitfalls": [
            "同一个普通（未命名）模块中，sealed 的直接子类必须在同一个包内（不要求同一个文件）。",
            "Java 17 不支持 switch 里的记录模式，用 instanceof 模式匹配。",
            "instanceof 模式匹配后变量只在匹配分支内可见。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "运行示例，观察输出，然后修改程序让结果体现一个新的输入。",
              "hint": "改动示例中的常量或数据，重新编译运行，确认输出随之改变。",
              "answer": "把 sealed 相关的一处取值改成你自己的数据后重新运行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
