      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "Java 098：分层设计：控制台 MVC",
      "summary": "把输入、业务、输出分成三层的小应用。",
      "concepts": [
        "分层",
        "MVC",
        "职责分离"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI Java 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-09",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "java-tutorial-098-lesson",
          "title": "Java 098：分层设计：控制台 MVC",
          "summary": "把输入、业务、输出分成三层的小应用。",
          "concepts": [
            "分层",
            "MVC",
            "职责分离"
          ],
          "objective": "能把程序拆成 model/service/view 三层。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "分层让每层只关心自己的职责：模型保存数据、服务处理逻辑、视图负责展示，便于测试与替换。",
          "code": "import java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.List;\n\npublic class Main {\n    record Task(String title, boolean done) {}\n\n    static class TaskService {\n        private final List<Task> tasks = new ArrayList<>();\n\n        void add(String title) {\n            tasks.add(new Task(title, false));\n        }\n\n        void complete(int index) {\n            Task current = tasks.get(index);\n            tasks.set(index, new Task(current.title(), true));\n        }\n\n        List<Task> all() {\n            return List.copyOf(tasks);\n        }\n    }\n\n    static class TaskView {\n        void render(List<Task> tasks) {\n            for (int i = 0; i < tasks.size(); i++) {\n                Task task = tasks.get(i);\n                String mark = task.done() ? \"[x]\" : \"[ ]\";\n                System.out.println((i + 1) + \". \" + mark + \" \" + task.title());\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        TaskService service = new TaskService();\n        service.add(\"写代码\");\n        service.add(\"写测试\");\n        service.complete(0);\n        new TaskView().render(service.all());\n    }\n}",
          "output": "1. [x] 写代码\n2. [ ] 写测试",
          "pitfalls": [
            "视图不应包含业务逻辑。",
            "服务接口要稳定，便于以后换实现。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "运行示例，观察输出，然后修改程序让结果体现一个新的输入。",
