      "id": "java-tutorial-099",
      "language": "java",
      "type": "java",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "Java 099：性能与复杂度基础",
      "summary": "用大 O 衡量算法，避免常见性能陷阱。",
      "concepts": [
        "复杂度",
        "大O",
        "性能"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI Java 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-09",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "java-tutorial-099-lesson",
          "title": "Java 099：性能与复杂度基础",
          "summary": "用大 O 衡量算法，避免常见性能陷阱。",
          "concepts": [
            "复杂度",
            "大O",
            "性能"
          ],
          "objective": "能判断常见操作的复杂度并选择合适结构。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "大 O 描述随规模增长的趋势。ArrayList 随机访问 O(1) 但中间插入 O(n)，HashSet 查找平均 O(1)。选对结构比微优化更重要。",
          "code": "import java.util.HashSet;\nimport java.util.Set;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static boolean containsBrute(int[] values, int target) {\n        for (int value : values) {\n            if (value == target) {\n                return true;\n            }\n        }\n        return false;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int[] values = new int[1000];\n        for (int i = 0; i < values.length; i++) {\n            values[i] = i;\n        }\n        Set<Integer> set = new HashSet<>();\n        for (int value : values) {\n            set.add(value);\n        }\n        System.out.println(\"brute=\" + containsBrute(values, 999));\n        System.out.println(\"set=\" + set.contains(999));\n    }\n}",
          "output": "brute=true\nset=true",
          "pitfalls": [
            "在循环里做线性查找会变成 O(n^2)。",
            "过早优化是万恶之源，先测量再优化。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "运行示例，观察输出，然后修改程序让结果体现一个新的输入。",
              "hint": "改动示例中的常量或数据，重新编译运行，确认输出随之改变。",
              "answer": "把 复杂度 相关的一处取值改成你自己的数据后重新运行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
