      "id": "java-tutorial-100",
      "language": "java",
      "type": "java",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "Java 100：综合项目：迷你任务清单",
      "summary": "综合运用集合、流、异常与分层完成一个小应用。",
      "concepts": [
        "综合",
        "Stream",
        "分层",
        "异常"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI Java 教程（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-09",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "java-tutorial-100-lesson",
          "title": "Java 100：综合项目：迷你任务清单",
          "summary": "综合运用集合、流、异常与分层完成一个小应用。",
          "concepts": [
            "综合",
            "Stream",
            "分层",
            "异常"
          ],
          "objective": "能把全书知识整合成一个可运行的任务清单程序。",
          "prerequisites": [],
          "explain": "综合练习：用 Map 分组、用 Stream 统计、用自定义异常校验输入、用分层组织，输出完成率报告。",
          "code": "import java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Map;\nimport java.util.TreeMap;\nimport java.util.stream.Collectors;\n\npublic class Main {\n    record Task(String title, String owner, boolean done) {}\n\n    static class InvalidTask extends RuntimeException {\n        InvalidTask(String message) {\n            super(message);\n        }\n    }\n\n    static Task create(String title, String owner) {\n        if (title == null || title.isBlank()) {\n            throw new InvalidTask(\"标题不能为空\");\n        }\n        return new Task(title.trim(), owner, false);\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        List<Task> tasks = List.of(\n            create(\"设计\", \"ann\"),\n            create(\"编码\", \"ann\"),\n            create(\"测试\", \"bob\"));\n        // TreeMap 分组：输出按 owner 排序，不依赖默认 Map 的迭代顺序。\n        Map<String, Long> byOwner = tasks.stream()\n            .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(Task::owner, TreeMap::new, Collectors.counting()));\n        System.out.println(\"byOwner=\" + byOwner);\n        double rate = tasks.stream().filter(Task::done).count() / (double) tasks.size();\n        System.out.println(\"completion=\" + rate);\n        try {\n            create(\" \", \"cara\");\n        } catch (InvalidTask e) {\n            System.out.println(\"error=\" + e.getMessage());\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "output": "byOwner={ann=2, bob=1}\ncompletion=0.0\nerror=标题不能为空",
          "pitfalls": [
            "默认分组结果的顺序不固定，要稳定输出用 TreeMap 分组。",
            "输入校验要在创建入口完成。"
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "prompt": "运行示例，观察输出，然后修改程序让结果体现一个新的输入。",
              "hint": "改动示例中的常量或数据，重新编译运行，确认输出随之改变。",
              "answer": "把 综合 相关的一处取值改成你自己的数据后重新运行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
